2 CONT Elizabeth Scrymgeour
2 CONT *F, #12540
2 CONT *Last Edited=10 Jan 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Scrymgeour married John Lyon, 3rd Lord Glamis, son of Patrick Lyon, 1st Lord Glamis and Isabel Ogilvy, before 1450.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Sir John Scrymgeour and Marion Abernethy.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1450, her married name became Lyon.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Scrymgeour and John Lyon, 3rd Lord Glamis
