1 OCCU 4th Lord of Glamis, 4th Lord Glamis
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in Glamis Castle, Angus, Scotland on 1452 to Sir John III Lyon, and Lady Elizabeth Scrymgeour, Lady of Dudhope, 3rd Baroness of Glamis. Sir John Lyon, 4th Lord of Glamis married Elizabeth, Countess of Rothes, 
2 CONC Baroness of Glamis, Grey and had 9 children. He passed away on 9 Sep 1513 in Flodden Field, near Branxton, Northumberland, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on John Lyon, 4th Lord Glamis:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p1255.htm#i12541
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lyon, 4th Lord Glamis
2 CONT *M, #12541, 
2 CONT *d. circa 1500
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 Apr 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lyon, 4th Lord Glamis married Elizabeth Gray, daughter of Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray and Janet Keith, circa 18 May 1487.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died circa 1500.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of John Lyon, 3rd Lord Glamis and Elizabeth Scrymgeour. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of 4th Lord Glamis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John Lyon, 4th Lord Glamis and Elizabeth Gray
2 CONT *1. George Lyon, 5th Lord Glamis d. c 1505
2 CONT *2. Alexander Lyon d. c 1541
2 CONT *3. John Lyon, 6th Lord Glamis+ b. c 1491, d. 8 Apr 1528
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1642. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
