2 CONT
2 CONT Source: [http://bit.ly/15liQIW A Most Remarkable Family: A History of the Lyon Family from 1066 to 2014] (author: Michael Hewitt)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Lyon,_2nd_Lord_Glamis
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Lyon, 2nd Lord of Glamis (c. 1430–1486), was a Scottish nobleman.
2 CONT
2 CONT The son of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patrick_Lyon,_1st_Lord_Glamis Patrick Lyon, 1st Lord Glamis] (d. 1459), he was Keeper of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kildrummy_Castle Kildrummy Castle] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
2 CONC i/Kindrochit_Castle Kindrochit Castle] from his father's death until 1462. He later sat on the King's Council.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Agnes Crichton, daughter of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Crichton,_1st_Lord_Crichton William Crichton, 1st Lord Crichton], Chancellor of Scotland, but had no surviving children. His title was inherited by his 
2 CONC younger brother [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Lyon,_3rd_Lord_Glamis John Lyon].
2 CONT
2 CONT * References
2 CONT
2 CONT     "Alexander Lyon, second Lord Glamis". [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oxford_Dictionary_of_National_Biography Oxford Dictionary of National Biography] (online ed.). Oxford University Press. doi:[http://dx.doi.org/10.1093%2Fref%
2 CONC 3Aodnb%2F54277 10.1093/ref:odnb/54277]. (Subscription or UK public library membership required.)
2 CONT
