2 CONT 	 Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT     Marion Abernethy, she married, firstly, Sir Robert Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington, son of John Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington and Agnes Dunbar. 
2 CONT
2 CONT     Secondly she married, Sir John Scrymgeour, son of Sir James Scrymgeour of Dudhope and Egidia Maxwell. Her married name became Scrymgeour.1 Her married name became Maitland. 
2 CONT
