2 CONT Instrument of sasine following on precept, 20 April 1478, by Silvester Rattray of that ilk, in favour of John Rattray, his eldest son, and Elizabeth Kennedy, his spouse, of lands of Kinballach in barony thereof, sheriffdom of Pert
2 CONC h, 23 July 1479. Notary: Partick Barry, clerk, St Andrews diocese.
2 CONT
2 CONT Charter by John Rattray of that ilk, kt., to John Rattray, his son and apparent heir, and Margaret Abbircromme, his spouse, of lands of Bredwellis, Ottyrburne and Clayhillis and others in barony of Rattray, sheriffdom of Perth, 15
2 CONC  Jan. 1506/7. Seal damaged on tag. With precept and sasine following.
2 CONT
