2 CONC from William Rattray, brother of said David, 8 Nov. 1572.
2 CONT
2 CONT Letters by James, abbot of Scone, and convent thereof, appointing John Rattray of that ilk, kt., and Andrew Abbircromme of Innerpeffery, brother of said James, as bailies of regality of Scone, 18 May 1506. HMC 4th report p.536.
2 CONT
2 CONT Copy special retour in favour of Silvester Rattray as heir of deceased John Rattray, kt., his father, at Dundee, 10 Nov. 1533.
2 CONT
2 CONT Instrument narrating that Michael Tullo of Hilcarny, sheriff of Perth in that part, compeared in tolbooth of Dundee at instance of procurator for Silvester Rattray, and produced a commission under quarter seal for service in favou
2 CONC r of said Silvester as heir of deceased John Rattray, his father, and deceased John Rattray, his brother, which commission was read aloud and said procurator required the necessary breives for expeding the service, 22 Oct. 1533. H
2 CONC MC 4th report p.536.
2 CONT
2 CONT Precept of clare constat by Grizel Rattray of that ilk, wife of John, earl of Athol, in favour of Silvester Rattray as heir of deceased John Rattray, his brother, of lands of Bredwellis, Ottirburn and others in barony of Rattray, 
2 CONC sheriffdom of Perth, 20 Dec. 1533. HMC 4th report p.536.
