2 CONT Agnes Crichton||p2130.htm#i21295|William Crichton of that Ilk, 1st Lord Crichton|d. bt Jan 1454 - Jul 1454|p2130.htm#i21296||||Sir John Crichton||p27807.htm#i278067||||||||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=7 May 2008
2 CONT      Agnes Crichton was the daughter of William Crichton of that Ilk, 1st Lord Crichton. She married Walter Kerr, son of Andrew Kerr and Margaret Tweedie.
2 CONT      Her married name became Kerr. Children of Agnes Crichton and Walter Kerr 1.Sir Robert Kerr+ d. a 6 Nov 1500 2.Margaret Kerr 3.Mark Kerr d. 1433 4.Elizabeth Kerr+ d. 19 Oct 1548 5.Ralph Kerr d. a 1494
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2130.htm#i21295
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Crichton was the daughter of William Crichton, 1st Lord Crichton. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT # Alexander Lyon, 2nd Lord Glamis, son of Patrick Lyon, 1st Lord Glamis and Isabel Ogilvy, before 17 February 1450.
2 CONT # Walter Kerr of Cessford, son of Andrew Kerr of Auldtounburn and Cessford and unknown daughter Douglas, on 20 October 1487.
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 17 February 1450, her married name became Lyon. From 20 October 1487, her married name became Kerr.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' of Agnes Crichton and Walter Kerr of Cessford
2 CONT
2 CONT *     Sir Robert Kerr, younger of Cessford d. a 6 Nov 1500
2 CONT *     Margaret Kerr
2 CONT *     Mark Kerr d. 1433
2 CONT *     Elizabeth Kerr d. 19 Oct 1548
2 CONT *     Ralph Kerr d. a 1494
