2 CONT *The attribution of his children between his wives is not certain. TSP(Atholl) does not even try to say which child was by which wife but BE1883 does give a lead. However, with TSP naming more daughters than BE1883, with some name
2 CONC s being duplicated, some doubt remains on this matter which may be researched further in due course. 
