2 CONT Egidia (Gilles) Maxwell married Sir James Scrymgeour, Constable of Dundee, son of Sir Alexander Scrymgeour and Agnes of Glascester; They had 1 sons (Sir John, Constable of Dundee) & 1 daughter (Gilles, said to be married to James 
2 CONC Maitland).2,3 Egidia (Gilles) Maxwell died after 6 October 1384.2,3
