1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Janet Gray:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10803.htm#i108026
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Gray [1]
2 CONT *F, #108026
2 CONT *Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Gray married, firstly, Sir Alexander Blair of Balthayock.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Thomas Fraser, 2nd Lord Lovat, son of Hugh Fraser, 1st Lord Lovat and Violet Lyon, before 1509.[1],[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, thirdly, David Lindsay, 9th Earl of Crawford, son of Walter Lindsay and unknown Erskine, before 12 June 1535.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Patrick Gray, Master of Gray and Annabella Forbes.[1],[2] 
2 CONT *Her married name became Blair.[1] 
2 CONT *Her married name became Fraser.[1] 
2 CONT *From before 12 June 1535, her married name became Lindsay.[1] As a result of her marriage, Janet Gray was styled as Countess of Crawford on 27 November 1542. 
2 CONT *Her last will was dated 5 February 1549/50.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
