2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Ogilvy is the daughter of Sir John Ogilvy of Inverquharity and Helen Ogilvy.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Donald Farquharson, 1st of Monaltrie, son of Findla 'Mor' Farquharson, 1st of Invercauld and Beatrix Gardyne of that Ilk.1  Her married name became Farquharson.
