2 CONC tinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 476. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT    3. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 222.
