2 CONT Walter Ogilvy, Sheriff of Inverness and Banff Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 M, #2916, d. between 20 April 1507 and 7 August 1508 Father	Walter Ogilvy d. bt 1454 - 1456 Mother	Margaret Sinclair Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT      Walter Ogilvy, Sheriff of Inverness and Banff was born at of Auchlevyn and Boyne. He married Margaret Edmondstone, daughter of Sir James Edmondstone, Thane of Boyne and Isabel Forrester.1 Walter Ogilvy, Sheriff of Inverness a
2 CONC nd Banff died between 20 April 1507 and 7 August 1508. Family Margaret Edmondstone Children	 Janet Ogilvy+2 d. a 7 Oct 1526 George Ogilvy, 2nd Baron of Boyne+ d. b 1512 Sir Walter Ogilvy+3 d. 29 Nov 1558 Elizabeth Ogilvy+4,1 b. c 
2 CONC 1492, d. Sep 1518 Citations [S11564] The Scots Peerage, Vol. II, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 1-3. [S11564] The Scots Peerage, Vol. II, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 7. [S11564] The Scots Peerage, Vol. II, edited by
2 CONC  Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 7-10. [S11656] Genealogy of George A. A. & Linley Maree Hooper, p. 508. ___________________________________________________________________________
