2 CONT # [S8] BP1999 volume 1, page 40. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S8]
2 CONT # [S34] BP1970 page 1784. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S34]
2 CONT # [S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 1878. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT # [S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT
2 CONT ==pedigree==
2 CONT [https://books.google.com/books?id=9aU0AAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA9&ots=QeiONJQ7Sn&dq=Sir%20Robert%20Maxwell%20of%20Maxwell%2C%20Caerlaverock%2C%20Mearns%20and%20Pencaitland&pg=PA7#v=onepage&q&f=true "Memoirs of the Maxwells of Pollok"]
2 CONT
2 CONT IV- 3. Sir Aymer de Maccuswell, second of Caerlaverock. Married Mary of Mearns and acquired the Barony of Mearns. 1195-1266. He had
2 CONT *V- 3. Sir John Maxwell, ancestor of the Maxwells of Pollok. 1270-1306. Had
2 CONT **VI- 1. Sir Robert Maxwell, second of Pollok. 1306-1330. Had
