2 CONC herne Reliquiis. (Bannatyne Club, Edinburgh, MDCCCXLVII), 170 pp. including indexes]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://archive.org/details/registrumdedunfe00bann/page/n4/mode/1up Registrum de Dunfermelyn. Liber cartarum Abbatie Benedictine S.S. Trinitatis et B. Margarete Regine de Dunfermelyn (Bannatyne Club, Edinburgh, M.DCCC.XLII), 5
2 CONC 62 pp. including index and omissum]'''
