2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sir Walter Stewart+ b. bt 1394 - 1410, d. 24 May 1425
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Sir Alexander Stewart b. bt 1395 - 1410, d. 25 May 1425
2 CONT
2 CONT     * James Stewart, 1st of Baldoran+ b. bt 1395 - 1426, d. b 18 May 1451
