2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Marriage and children
2 CONT
2 CONT Murdoch was married to Isabella, daughter of Donnchadh, Earl of Lennox. They had four sons and a daughter: 1.Robert Stewart (d. 1421) 2.Walter Stewart (d. 1425) 3.Alasdair Stewart (d. 1425) 4.James the Fat (Seamas Mòr) Stewart (d.
2 CONC  1451) 5.Isabel, who married Sir Walter Buchanan, 13th Laird Buchanan
