1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN MOYDARTACH MACDONALD OF CLANRANALD (aka JOHN MACALASTER)===
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/stream/bub_gb_CxYXAAAAYAAJ#page/n20/mode/1up Clanranald: 15-38]  [https://archive.org/stream/historyofmacdlor00mack#page/379/mode/1up Macdonald: 379-402]
