1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===RANALD MACDONALD (aka RANALD GALLA)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ranald Galla was the son of Allan Macdonald, otherwise known as Allan MacRuari, the fourth of Moydart. Ranald Galla fought and was overthrown at the Battle of Blarleine by his nephew, John Moydartach, when the latter became def
2 CONC acto chief. [https://archive.org/stream/historyofmacdlor00mack#page/376/mode/1up Macdonald History, p. 376]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Account===
2 CONT
