1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 2. James, who in a bond of manrent, dated in 1578, is described as James Fraser "in Belladrum, brother german to Hucheon Fraser of Guisachan." His son Hugh became first of Belladrum, having received a charter of it
2 CONC  from Simon the eighth Lord on the 13th of June, 1598.
