2 CONT ===Robert FARQUHARSON (1st of Finzean)
2 CONT * ABT 1570 - 1632
2 CONT * TITLE: 1st of Finzean
2 CONT * BIRTH: ABT 1570, Inverness-shire, Scotland, United Kingdom
2 CONT * DEATH: 1632
2 CONT * Family 1 : Katherine MACKINTOSH MARRIAGE: ABT 1603, Inverness-shire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.thepeerage.com/p40404.htm#i404039
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Farquharson, 1st of Finzean was the son of Donald Farquharson, 1st of Monaltrie and Janet Ogilvy.2 He married Katherine Mackintosh, daughter of Lachlan 'Mor' Mackintosh, 16th of Mackintosh, 17th Chief of Clan Chattan and Ag
2 CONC nes Mackenzie.1 He died in 1632.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He held the office of Burgess of Aberdeen in 1606.1 On 11 May 1609 he acquired Finzean by charter from Alexander Gordon of Cluny.1
2 CONT
