2 CONC tion 11 Jul 1370) JOHN Dunbar, son of Sir PATRICK Dunbar & his wife Isabel Randolph of Moray (-before 15 Feb 1392).  He was created Earl of Moray by his father-in-law Robert II King of Scotland 9 Mar 1372.  m secondly (before 24 A
