1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From: http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTLAND.htm#RobertIIdied1390AA :
2 CONT
2 CONT ROBERT Stewart, son of WALTER Stewart 6th High Steward of Scotland & his first wife Marjorie Bruce (Paisley, Renfrewshire 2 Mar 1316-Dundonald Castle, Ayrshire 19 Apr 1390, bur Scone Abbey, Perthshire).  
2 CONT
2 CONT …. m firstly (1336, dispensation 22 Nov 1347) ELIZABETH Mure, daughter of Sir ADAM Mure of Rowallan, Ayrshire & his [first wife Joan Cunningham or his second wife Janet Mure] (-before 1355).  John of Fordun´s Scotichronicon (Conti
2 CONC nuator) records that "Robertum regem, secundum" married "de facto unam de filiabus Adæ de More militis", by whom he had "filios et filias extra matrimonium", but that they married in 1349 after papal dispensation[1073].  The Liber
2 CONC  Pluscardensisnames "Elizabeth filia domini Adam de Mure" as first wife of "dominus Robertus rex secundus"[1074].  The Papal dispensation for the marriage of "Robertus dni de Stratgnf militis…David Regi Scotie…nepos" and "Elizabet
2 CONC h Mox", issued by Pope Clement VI, is dated 22 Nov "pontificatus nostri anno sexto" (1347)[1075]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT … King Robert II & his first wife had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT … '''9.         [Lady KATHERINE Stewart .  m Sir ROBERT Logan of Rastalrig.] '''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I22853&tree=CC
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Stewart F, #105311, b. between 1336 and 1355 Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT      Katherine Stewart was born between 1336 and 1355. She was the daughter of Robert II Stewart, King of Scotland and Elizabeth Mure of Rowallan. She married Sir Robert Logan.1 Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT     [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 222. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.thepeerage.com/p10532.htm#i105311
2 CONT --------------------
