2 CONT # Alexander, 3rd of Pitsligo, heir to his grandfather the 2nd laird.  Married Isobel Wemyss
2 CONT # William of "Daach", predecessor of the House of Newe.  Married Elizabeth, eldest daughter of John Forbes of Brux.
