2 CONC . III, Archive.org, pp. 17-8 < [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/18/mode/2up Archive.Org] >
2 CONT # Cokayne, George Edward, "The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom", London: St. Catherine Press, 1913, Ed. 2 Vol III, Archive.org, p. 509
2 CONT #  Lee, Sidney, ed,"Dictionary of National Biography", London: Smith Elder & Co., 1903, Vol. XXXIII, Archive.org, pp. 279-80
