2 CONT
2 CONT == [https://sites.google.com/site/thescotspeerage/airlie-ogilvy-earl-of/walter-ogilvy-of-auchterhouse-kt Biographical Summary Copied from The Scots Peerage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Walter Ogilvy of Auchterhouse, Knight, Sheriff of Angus had issue: (3) Sir Andrew Ogilvy of Inchmartin witnessed a charter of Alexander Ogilvy of Auchterhouse in 1460 as 'patruus.' He received with Marjorie, his spouse, a c
2 CONC harter of the lands of Wester Dron from David Bosvile of Craigincat in 1439, and was living in 1461, when Sir John Wemyss makes a grant to David, his son and heir-apparent. He married Marjory, daughter of Sir John Glen of Inchmart
2 CONC in and Margaret Erskine, and had issue a son, (i) David Ogilvy of Inchmartin, ancestor of the Earls of Findlater.'''
