2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1427, without legitimate issue.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Thomas de Dunbar, 2nd Earl of Moray and Margaret (?).[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 3rd Earl of Moray [S., 1372] in 1415.[1]
