2 CONT == [https://www.myheritage.com/names/mariota_ogilvy Pedigrees Published by MyHeritage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mariota Ogilvy (born Hay of Leys) was born in 1460, at birth place , to William 1st Earl of Erroll Hay,1st Earl of Errol, 2nd Lord Hay, Constable of Scotland and Lady Beatrice Countess Of Erroll Hay Countess of Erroll in lieu o
2 CONC f a 2nd Earl of Erroll (born Douglas) . William was born in 1412, in Erroll, Perth, Scotland. Lady was born in 1429, in Douglas, South Lanarkshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. Mariota had 10 siblings: Willem 3rd Earl Van Erroll Hay 
2 CONC , Nicholas Erroll Hay 2nd Earl of Erroll and 8 other siblings . Mariota passed away in 1480, at age 20 at death place .'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mariota Ogilvy (born Hay of Leys) was born in 1456, at birth place , to William de Hay and Beatrice Hay (born Douglas) . William was born in 1423, in Errol, Perth and Kinross, Scotland, United Kingdom. Beatrice was born circa 1
2 CONC 429, in Douglas, South Lanarkshire, Scotland, United Kingdom. Mariota had 10 siblings: Margaret Fraser (born Hay) , Nicholas Hay and 8 other siblings . Mariota married David (Sir) Ogilvy . David was born in 1455, in Perth, Perthsh
2 CONC ire, Scotland. His occupation was a knight. They had 3 children: James Ogilvy and 2 other children. Mariota passed away in 1480, at age 24 at death place .'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == [http://www.thepeerage.com/p46350.htm#i463494 Biographical Summary by Darryl Lundy's Peerage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir David Ogilvy of Inchmartine is the son of Sir Andrew Ogilvy of Inchmartine and Marjorie Glen. He married Mariota Hay.  He died before 6 January 1506. Child of Sir David Ogilvy of Inchmartine and Mariota Hay: James Ogilvy of
2 CONC  Balgally and of Inchmartine d. 9 Sep 1513'''
