2 CONT '''25 November 1464: REX concessit ALEXANDRO DE OGILVY de Duntroune, et heredibus ejus,— terras de Inchmartyn, vic. Perth, el terras de Gleghern, vic. Lanark; — quas Cristiana de Glen, sponsa David Stewart, mater dicti Alex., cum 
2 CONC consensu dicti David, apud Faucland resignavit. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/176/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 821]'''
