2 CONC  Lufale of Bellumby, ALEXANDER OGILUY OF DUNTRUNE, James Rynde of Cass, Thomas Ogiluy of Clova, [ ? ] Ramsay of Newtibber and Alexander Ogiluy, son of and apparent heir to the said Thomas, in a dispute over the marches between Myl
