2 CONT
2 CONT '''David Stewart, here treated, died before 31 July 1488. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/373/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 1762]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''David Stewart, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Glen/6000000026866295352?through=6000000026866272447 He is noticed as her husband on 25 November 1564. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02sc
2 CONC ot/page/176/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 821]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''25 November 1564: REX concessit ALEXANDRO DE OGILVY de Duntroune, et heredibus ejus,— terras de Inchmartyn, vic. Perth, el terras de Gleghern, vic. Lanark; — quas Cristiana de Glen, sponsa David Stewart, mater dicti Alex., cum 
2 CONC consensu dicti David, apud Faucland resignavit. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/176/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 821]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''25 July 1468: REX concessit RICARDO DE RUTHIRFURDE, filio Rob. de  E. de Chattow, et heredibus  ejus, — duas mercatas terrarum do Glennyslaud, vic. Roxburgh ; — quas  Cristiana de Glen, sponsa David  Stewart,  cum consensu dict
2 CONC i  Dav., resignavit. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/198/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 955]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''31 July 1488: Rex concessit THOME MYDDILMAIST de Grevistoun, et heredibus ejus, — tertiam partem tertie  partis terrarum et baronie de Glen, vic. Peblis; — quam Margareta Ogilvy sponsa Silvostri Rettray de eodem,  ac filia et u
2 CONC na heredum quondam Cristiane Glen spouse quondam David Stewart, resignavit. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/373/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 1762]'''
2 CONT
