2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Ogilvy is the daughter of Sir James Ogilvy, 2nd of Deskford and Findlater.2 A contract for the marriage of Margaret Ogilvy and John Grant, 2nd of Freuchie was signed on 16 September 1484.3
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived at Deskford, ScotlandG.1 From 16 September 1484, her married name became Grant.1
2 CONT
