2 CONT Margaret (Ogilvy) Grant (abt. 1470 - abt. 1530) Privacy Level: Open (White) Margaret Grant formerly Ogilvy Born about 1470 in Banff, Banffshire, Scotlandmap ANCESTORS ancestors Daughter of James (Ogilvy) Ogilvy of Deskford and Mar
2 CONC garet Innes Sister of Katharine (Ogilvie) Urquhart, Alexander Ogilvy, Marion (Ogilvy) Gordon and James Ogilvy Wife of John (Grant) Grant of Freuchie 2nd — married [date unknown] [location unknown] DESCENDANTS descendants Mother of
2 CONC  James Grant, John Grant, Elizabeth (Grant) Mckenzie, Iain Mor Grant, Anna (Grant) Fraser, Agnes Grant, Alexander Dunbar Grant, Christiana Grant and Marjorie Grant Died about 1530 in Banff, Banffshire, Scotlandmap [uncertain] Prof
2 CONC ile manager: David Rentschler private message [send private message] Profile last modified 9 Dec 2017 | Created 1 Oct 2010 This page has been accessed 1,631 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography Margaret Ogilvy is the daughter of Sir James Ogilvy of Deskford. She married John Grant, 2nd of Freuchie, son of John 'Mor' Grant and Muriel Mackintosh. She married John Grant, 2nd of Freuchie, son of John 'Mor' Grant an
2 CONC d Muriel Mackintosh, on 16 September 1484. She lived at Deskford, Scotland. Her married name became Grant. Children of Margaret Ogilvy and John Grant, 2nd of Freuchie
2 CONT
