2 CONT '''Elizabeth of Danielstoun is the daughter of Sir Robert of Danielstoun.''' [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD220%2f2%2f1%2f41&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=danielstoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&
2 CONC dt=1600&di=n NRS: D220/2/1/41]
