2 CONT William Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington was the son of John Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington and unknown daughter Dundas.1 He married Martha Seton, daughter of George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton and Lady Margaret Campbell.1 H
2 CONC e died on 9 September 1513 at Flodden Field, Northumberland, England, killed in action.1  In 1477 he had sasine of Thirlestone.1 He fought in the Battle of Flodden on 9 September 1513.1
