1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ISABEL FORRESTER===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Isabel Forrester is the daughter of Sir John Forrester of Corstorphine. The name of her mother is not known. She married, as his first wife, Sir James Edmonstone of that Ilk. The marriage was ultimately annulled, and she renoun
2 CONC ced her appeal against the sentence on 3 February 1456-57. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/84/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 85]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/84/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 85]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ee/edmonstone1.php StirnetL Edmonstone 1]
