2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume II, page 376. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT * 3.[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume II, page 377. 4.[S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 220.
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Stewart,_Earl_of_Buchan
