2 CONT '''25 January 1444-45: Confirmation by Isabella, Duchess of Albany and Countess of Leuenax [Lennox], of charter 8 Jun 1444, by Robert, Earl of Mar and Lord of Erskyne [Erskine], to Patrick Galbrath [Galbraith], his squire and kins
2 CONC man, of lands of Gartskadane [Garscadden], in earldom of Leuenax, sheriffdom of Dumbertane [Dunbarton], ld silver blench ferm annually. Witnesses to charter - Thomas Sebald [Sibbald], William Achinlek [Affleck], David Colstane [Co
2 CONC lston]. Witnesses to confirmation - Andrew and Murdac Stewart, Kts, her nephews, James Stewart of Albany, Patrick Corntoune [Cornton], her chaplain, Donald, clerk, Donald son of Hugh, Colin MacMoldonych. [https://catalogue.nrscotl
2 CONC and.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD124%2f1%2f425&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=isabella+lennox&ko=a&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Erskine Family, Earls of Mar and Kellie, referen
2 CONC ce GD124/1/425]'''
