2 CONT TCP (Rothes) notes that TSP (Haliburton) shows Christina as dau of the younger Sir Walter by Mary Douglas whilst TSP (Rothes) shows her as dau of the elder Sir Walter by his 2nd wife, Isabel Stewart, "which seems more likely".
