2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/334/mode/1up?view=theater The Scots Peerage] shows as daughter of the 2nd Walter Haliburton.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Christina, married, as his second wife, in 1440, to George, Earl of Rothes. Nineteen years later the Earl raised an action of divorce against his wife on the ostensible ground that they were within the forbidden degrees of cons
2 CONC anguinity, but his reasons for so doing are not apparent.
2 CONT
