2 CONT *     Christian Haliburton is the daughter of Walter Haliburton and Isabella Stewart.1 She married George Leslie, 1st Earl of Rothes, son of Sir Norman Leslie of Rothes and Christian Seton.1
2 CONT *     Christian Haliburton was also known as Christian Halyburton. Her married name became Leslie.1
