1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown daughter Stewart is the daughter of Robert Stewart, 1st Lord Lorn.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alan MacDougall, 10th of Dunollie and of Lorn, son of Dougall Macdougall, 9th of Dunollie and of Lorn and unknown MacDonnell.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of unknown daughter Stewart and Alan MacDougall, 10th of Dunollie and of Lorn
2 CONT
2 CONT # Sir John Macdougall, 11th of Dunollie and of Lorn+1 d. 1480
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT MacDougall01 refers to her as daughter of Robert Stewart 2nd Lord of Lorn.
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.ancestorium.com/tng/getperson.php?personID=I019176&tree=1
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Previously shown as daughter of 2nd of Lorn based on "Burke's Landed Gentry (1970?) says he married a daughter of Robert Stewart, 2nd Lord of Lorn"
2 CONT
2 CONT "Your listing of "daughter of John (2nd Lord of Lorn) Stewart" also seems doubtful. You show ... that she married Allan (10th of Dunollie) Macdougal. I know of no authority for the view that John of Lorn had such a daughter, and t
2 CONC he leading history of the Macdougal family, AN OFFICIAL SHORT HISTORY OF THE CLAN MACDOUGALL, by Michael Starforth, at 12, says that Alan MacDougall, 10th chief, married a daughter of Robert Stewart of Lorn, and shows her as the s
2 CONC ister, not the daughter, of John Stewart of Lorn. "
2 CONT From Douglas Hickling
2 CONT Dhhic @ comcast.com
2 CONT 516 Blair Avenue
2 CONT Piedmont CA 94611
2 CONT (August 2003)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
