2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Archibald  Abernethy, here treated. He was alive on 5 August 1464, when he was named as one of the heirs in remainder to his elder brother https://www.geni.com/people/Willia
2 CONC m-Abernathy-2nd-Lord-Saltoun-of-Abernethy/6000000003484306899?through=6000000002188050841 [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/171/mode/1up RMS: 800] but he died before 10 January 1482-83. [https://archive.org/
2 CONC details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/321/mode/1up RMS: 1534]'''
