2 CONT '''John Abernethy, here treated, is the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Oswald-Abernethy-of-Teinside-and-Harwood/6000000027454824908?through=6000000194836648839 The name of his mother has not been identified. [https://archive.o
2 CONC rg/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/406/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VII: 406] On 28 January 1463-64 he was one of the heirs in remainder to William, Lord Abernethy, [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/16
2 CONC 6/mode/1up RMS: 778] and again on 10 January 1482-83. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/321/mode/1up RMS: 1534]'''
