2 CONT
2 CONT '''25 January 1562-63: Charter by which Alexander Bayne of Tulloch confirms that he has given his lands of Ferrincosky and others in the sheriffdom of inverness to Robert Munro of Foullis in exchange for the lands of Wester Logy i
2 CONC n the earldom of Ross and sheriffdom of Inverness. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi04scot/page/330/mode/1up RMS, 1546-1580: 1455 and 1456 on p. 330]'''
2 CONT                     2
