1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOHN, OUR 10TH GREAT-GRANDFATHER was born and died in St Nicholas.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Burnett#8084
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationships 10th great-grandfather of Paul Edward Lawrence 7th great-grandson of Alexander Burnard Grandfather of John Burnett [I] Charts Ancestry Chart of John Burnett I Descent from Alexander Burnard to Researcher Father Alexa
2 CONC nder Burnet d. b 2 Sep 1574 Mother Janet Hamilton d. bt 1557 - 1567
2 CONT
2 CONT Major Life Events
2 CONT      John Burnett married Elizabeth Lumsden, daughter of John Lumsden.1 Children of John and Elizabeth Lumsden
2 CONT
2 CONT     Alexander Burnet d. b May 1578
2 CONT     Margaret Burnett
2 CONT     John Burnett
2 CONT     Thomas Burnett d. 13 Sep 1644
2 CONT     Andrew Burnett b. 1590, d. 13 Sep 1644
2 CONT     Katherine Burnett1
2 CONT
2 CONT Narrative
2 CONT      John inherited from his father in 1574. On 2 September 1574, he signed the Bond of Allegiance of the Barons of the North.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      It is not clear according to Cannog to Castle whether John's sons John, Andrew, and Thomas, and daughter Katherine were by his wife Elizabeth or by another marriage or without marriage. Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT     [S478] Eileen A. Bailey, James C. A. Burnett, Charles J. Burnett and Ian B. D. Bryce, Crannog to Castle, Burnett Family, page 40.
2 CONT
