2 CONT * Inverurie and the earldom of the Garioch Author: John Davidson 1816-1892. Publisher: Edinburgh D. Douglas 1878. Page: 449.
2 CONT *Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com : accessed 21 February 2021), memorial page for John Johnston (1565–4 Feb 1613), Find a Grave Memorial no. 107974092, citing Keithhall-Monykeggy Old Keithhall, Keith H
