1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret JOHNSTON (John JOHNSTON1) was born 1584 in Scotland, and died 1672 in Aberdeen, Scotland. She married Thomas BURNETT 8 NOV 1608 in St. Nicholas Church, Aberdeen, Scotland, son of John BURNETT Sr and Isabel
2 CONC  JOHNSTON. He was born 2 SEP 1574 in St. Nicholas Parish, Aberdeen, Scotland, and died AFT 1644 in Aberdeen, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret was the daughter of John Johnston and was christened at St. Nicholas Parish Church in 1584.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:  some say she was the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-George-Johnston-of-that-ilk-and-of-Caskieben/6000000004202062983 & https://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Forbes/6000000004202052551?through=600000000420206298
2 CONC 3
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=collinsgensearch&id=I1563
2 CONT
2 CONT (UNKNOWN IF ACCURATE OR THE SAME PERSON) "My COLLINS Genealogical Research including BURNETT, BUNCH, HURST, HUTCHISON, PETTYJOHN, BLACKSTONE, BARLOW leading to another COLLINS family, etc. Updated: 2015-07-29 21:51:05 UTC (Wed)   
2 CONC  Contact: Ted Collins      Home Page: My Collins Gen Research Page 
2 CONT
2 CONT Not all data has been verified, continues to be a work in progress and is considered best available information at this time. Please bear in mind that there may be discrepancies. I find errors almost every week. Not all of these f
2 CONC amilies are mine, some collateral families are included. Most sources are included in the "Notes". Please feel free to contact me with any notes, additions, or errors. I try to update both websites weekly. I'm always willing to sh
2 CONC are since so many have shared with me.
2 CONT
