2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Francis Hay, here treated, the husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Murray/6000000032489116275 has been identified in error as the son of https://www.geni.com/people/Peter-Hay-4th-of-Megginch/6000000002115963
2 CONC 180?through=6000000032489391896 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Ogilvy/6000000011089058594?through=6000000032489391896 notwithstanding the fact that this couple are not known to have had son named Francis. [https
2 CONC ://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/hh4aa/hay07.php Stirnet: Hay 07]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''It would also appear that Francis Hay, here treated has been confused with https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Hay-9th-Earl-of-Erroll/6000000011739535897 The pedigree cited below certainly suggests that this is the 
2 CONC case. However, Francis Hay, here treated, is reported to have died at Halifax in West Yorkshire on 3 December 1598, and  https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Hay-9th-Earl-of-Erroll/6000000011739535897 died at Slains on 16 July 1631
2 CONC . Moreover, https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Hay-9th-Earl-of-Erroll/6000000011739535897 married Elizabeth Douglas and not Mary Murray, and he most certainly did not have a daughter named Susan Hay who was born in 1580. [https:/
2 CONC /archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/576/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 576] ''''</blockquote>'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The pedigree cited below belongs to the family of https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Hay-9th-Earl-of-Erroll/6000000011739535897 and not to the family of Francis Hay, here treated, the husband of Mary Murray:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/2:2:Q655-K1X FamilySearch: Pedigree Resource File] accessed 14 January 2021), entry for Francis Hay, cites sources; "Chisom Haskins Tree" file (2:2:2:MMXX-GVJ), submitted 20 May 2020 by 
2 CONC MonicaChisom [identity withheld for privacy]'''
