1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===DAME HELEN HAY===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Countess of Linlithgow===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen or Helenor Hay, is the only daughter of Andrew Hay, Earl of Errol, and his first wife Jean Hay. She married (contract dated 26 and 31 January 1583-84 9 ) Alexander, first Earl of Linlithgow. [https://archive.org/details/s
2 CONC cotspeeragefoun03paul/page/572/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: p. 572] She was a devoted Catholic, and was hunted from church to church by the Presbytery of Linlithgow in a vain attempt to effect her conversion. [https://archive.o
2 CONC rg/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/445/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: p. 445]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
