2 CONT *Last Edited=7 Apr 2013
2 CONT *''''''     Robert Douglas, Master of Morton was the son of William Douglas, 6th Earl of Morton and Lady Agnes Leslie.2 A contract for the marriage of Robert Douglas, Master of Morton and Jean Lyon was signed on 19 March 1582/83.1
2 CONC  He died in March 1584/85 killed by pirates.1,3,4
2 CONT *''''''     He lived at Lochleven, Scotland.
2 CONT *''''''Child of Robert Douglas, Master of Morton and Jean Lyon
