2 CONC s, Scotland. He died in 1620 in Scotland. He married Marione Galloway on 24 Jan 1609 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland. She was born in 1581 in Aberdeen, Aberdeenshire, Scotland. She died in Scotland. Robert Douglas and Marione G
2 CONC alloway had the following children:
