2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Alexander (6th Lord Saltoun) Abernethy, Alison Abernethy (born Keith)  Siblings: Isobel Cunningham (born Abernethy), John Abernethy, Alexander (of Wester Saltoun) Abernethy, Elizabeth (of Saltoun) Abernethy, George (7th L
2 CONC ord Saltoun) Abernethy  Husband: Alexander (6th of Meldrum) Seton  Husband: John Urquhart <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ==details==
2 CONT '''''Alexander Seton 6th of Meldrum''''', served heir to his father William, 3rd May 1581, 
2 CONT ==married twice.==
2 CONT #His first wife, Elizabeth, daughter of Alexander Irvine of Drum, bare him one son, Alexander, who married, in 1584, Christian, daughter of Michael Fraser of Stoneywood, and a daughter, Elizabeth – afterwards heiress of Meldrum, a
2 CONC nd ancestor of the Urquharts of Meldrum.  He died before his father, having been killed in 1590 (p.151).  
2 CONT #The second marriage of Alexander, 6th of Meldrum, was with Jean, daughter of Alexander, 6th Lord Abernethy of Saltoun.  Two sons were born of it – John ; and William, the last Seton of Meldrum – and two daughters, Margaret, wife 
2 CONC of Chalmers of Balbithan, and Isabel, wife of Erksine of Pittodrie.
2 CONT
