2 CONT George Lyon married Jean Nisbet circa 1673. He died after 21 January 1703.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of John Lyon and Catherine Ogilvy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Lyon and Jean Nisbet
