2 CONT *2. Margaret Lyon b. 30 May 1681
2 CONT *3. Reverend Robert Lyon b. 17 Feb 1685
2 CONT *4. George Lyon+ b. 28 Jul 1688
2 CONT *5. Reverend James Lyon b. c 1694
