2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Katherine MACKINTOSH
2 CONT * 1584 - ____
2 CONT * BIRTH: 1584, Inverness-shire, Scotland, United Kingdom
2 CONT * DEATH: Scotland, United Kingdom
2 CONT * Father: Lachlan Mohr MACKINTOSH,
2 CONT * Mother: Agnes MACKENZIE
2 CONT * Family 1 : Robert FARQUHARSON - MARRIAGE: ABT 1603, Inverness-shire, Scotland
2 CONT * Family 2 : Angus McConell Vic Angus MACDONALD
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.thepeerage.com/p45054.htm#i450531
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherine Mackintosh is the daughter of Lachlan 'Mor' Mackintosh, 16th of Mackintosh, 17th Chief of Clan Chattan and Agnes Mackenzie.2 She married, secondly, Robert Farquharson, 1st of Finzean, son of Donald Farquharson, 1st of Mo
2 CONC naltrie and Janet Ogilvy.2 A contract for the marriage of Katherine Mackintosh and Angus 'M'Connell Vic Angus' Macdonald was signed on 24 April 1590.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Farquharson. She was also known as Margaret Macintosh.2,3 From 24 April 1590, her married name became Macdonald. She was living on 29 July 1648.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Katherine Mackintosh and Robert Farquharson, 1st of Finzean
2 CONT # Alexander Farquharson of Finzean+2 d. 1665
