2 CONC ughter of Sir JOHN Lyons of Warkworth & his wife ---.  Richard & his first wife had one child:  
2 CONT **a)         Sir JOHN de Wydeville ([1341/43]-[after 8 Sep 1403)).  m firstly KATHERINE Fermbrand, daughter of [Sir JOHN Fermbrand of Biddenham, Bedfordshire & his wife ---].  m secondly (before 1379) as her second husband, ISABEL
2 CONC , widow of ROBERT Passelaw of Drayton Parslow, daughter of ---.  Sir John & his first wife had one child:  
