2 CONT Mariota Cardney was a daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/John-de-Cardeny-of-that-Ilk/6000000038729896957?through=6000000008371031952 John Cardney] and sister of [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-de-Cardeny-Bishop-of-Dunkel
2 CONC d/6000000077438127014?through=6000000008371031952 Robert Cardney, bishop of Dunkeld].
2 CONT
2 CONT She became one of the several mistresses of [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-II-King-of-Scots/6000000000174222887?through=6000000008371031952 Robert II King of Scots], and by him had a son John. In return for her 'services to t
2 CONC he Crown' Mariota received a Charter for the lands of Burleigh and Easter Balingall, dated 17 March 1373.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Family ==
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://www.stewartsociety.org/history-of-the-stewarts.cfm?section=famous-stewarts&subcatid=16&histid=140 History of the Stewarts | Famous Stewarts] The Stewart Society
