2 CONT # [http://bluebellstrilogy.com/blog/tag/children-of-robert-bruce/ The Bruce Children]
2 CONT # [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marjorie_Bruce Wikipedia: Marjorie Bruce]
2 CONT # [http://www.paisley.org.uk/history/marjorybruce.php History of Paisley: Marjory Bruce]
2 CONT # [http://www.electricscotland.com/history/women/wih10.htm Women in History of Scots Descent: Marjory Bruce]
2 CONT # [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heir_presumptive Heir presumptive]
