2 CONT ===NOTE 2===
2 CONT
2 CONT *Elizabeth Mure (died before May 1355) was mistress and then wife of Robert, High Steward of Scotland, and Guardian of Scotland (1338–1341 and from October 1346), who later became King Robert II of Scotland.
2 CONT *Elizabeth Mure (Muir) was said to be born at Rowallan Castle. Her parents were '''Sir Adam Mure of Rowallan, Ayrshire and Janet Mure'''.
2 CONT *She initially became the Steward's mistress. He married her in 1336 but the marriage was criticised as uncanonical, so he remarried her in 1349 following a papal dispensation dated at Avignon 22 November 1347. ....
2 CONT *From: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabeth_Mure
2 CONT
