1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Elizabeth Stewart==
2 CONT * Birth: " between 1379 and 1386" Dunfermline Palace, Fifeshire, Scotland 
2 CONT * Death: before 1411 in Dalkeith, Midlothian, Scotland 
2 CONT * Father: Robert Stewart of Scotland III b: 1337 in Dundonald Castle, Irvine, Ayrshire, Scotland 
2 CONT * Mother: Annabella Drummond b: Abt. 1350 in Stobhall, Cargill, Perthshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Stewart, Princess of Scotland was born between 1379 and 1386. She was the daughter of Robert III Stewart, King of Scotland and Annabel Drummond.1 She and Sir James Douglas, 1st Lord of Dalkeith obtained a marriage licens
2 CONC e on 10 November 1387.2 She died before 1411.2
2 CONT
2 CONT She gained the title of Princess Elizabeth of Scotland.2
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family==
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT # James Douglas 2nd Lord of Dalkeith Lord Morton b: Bet. 1370?1373 in Dalkeith, Midlothian, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # William Douglas b: 1405 in Dalkieth, Midlothian, Scotland 
2 CONT # James Douglas 3rd Lord of Dalkeith b: 1407 in Dalkeith, Midlothian, Scotland 
2 CONT # Henry Douglas b: 1409 in Dalkieth, Midlothian, Scotland 
2 CONT # Margaret Douglas b: 1411 in Dalkieth, Midlothian, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTLAND.htm#RobertIIIdied1406
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.         Lady ELISABETH Stewart (-before 1411).  The marriage contract between "Jacobus de Douglas filius et heres…dñi Jacobi", and if he died "Willelmus de Douglas filius predictus dñi Jacobi nunc minor", and "dñm Johannem prim
2 CONC ogenitum dñi nostri Regis comite de Carrick senescallim Scocie…filiabus…Margareta filia sua seniore aut Elizabeth filia sua minore" is dated Apr 1378[1260].  m (contract Apr 1378, before 10 Nov 1387) as his first wife, JAMES Dougl
2 CONC as of Dalkeith, son of JAMES Douglas & his first wife Agnes Dunbar (-before 22 May 1441).  He succeeded his father in 1420 in the barony of Aberdour, co. Fife, and in the castle and town of Dalkeith.  He may have been created Lord
2 CONC  Dalkeith in [1430][1261]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links==
2 CONT
