2 CONC "Yle insulam de Geday insulam de Jura insulam de Colinsay" to "Johannem de Yle consanguineum nostrum" by charter dated 1344[1390].  Robert II King of Scotland granted "insulam de Colowsay" to "Johanni del Yle…et…filis nostre Marga
