2 CONC st wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Matilda-Bruce/6000000002140596727 Matilda Bruce] (-Delny 9 Feb 1372).  http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#AngusIslesdied1330B
