2 CONC ealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 221. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families, page 222. [S37] BP2003 volume 3, page 3402. See link for full details for this sou
