2 CONT *F, #463485
2 CONT *Last Edited=26 Jan 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Keith married Sir Patrick Ogilvy of Auchterhouse, son of Sir Alexander Ogilvy of Auchterhouse, before 1413.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Sir Alexander Keith of Grandon.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1413, her married name became Ogilvy.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Christian Keith and Sir Patrick Ogilvy of Auchterhouse
2 CONT *1. Alexander Ogilvy of Auchterhouse+[1] d. bt Jul 1470 - Sep 1473
2 CONT *2. Margaret Ogilvy+[1]
2 CONT *3. Walter Ogilvy+[1] d. a 1478
2 CONT *4. Christian Ogilvy [2]
2 CONT
