2 CONC ames Irvine (#1) Pedigree of James Irvine (#2) Pedigree of James Irvine (#3)
2 CONT      Sir Thomas de la Haye, 7th Baron Erroll, Constable of Scotland was born circa 1342 at of Inchetuthyll, Perthshire, Scotland. He married Elizabeth Stewart, daughter of Sir Robert II Stewart, King of Scotland, Earl of Atholl, S
2 CONC trathearn, 7th Steward of Scotland and Elizabeth Muir, circa 7 November 1372; They had 2 sons (Sir William, Constable of Scotland; & Sir Gilbert) & 2 daughters (Elizabeth, wife of Sir George Leslie; & (unnamed daughter), wife of N
2 CONC orman Leslie, son of Andrew Leslie of Leslie).2,3 Sir Thomas de la Haye, 7th Baron Erroll, Constable of Scotland died in July 1406.2,3 Family 	Elizabeth Stewart Children	
2 CONT
