1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas DeLaHay was born in 1380, at birth place, to Thomas de la Haye and Elizabeth de la Haye (19gga) (born Stewart). Thomas was born in 1342, in Kinnoull Manor, Inchetuthyll, Perth, Perthshire, Scotland. Elizabet
2 CONC h was born in 1346, in Dundonald Castle, Strathclyde, Ayr, Scotland. Thomas had 5 siblings: Alicia de Haye (born de Haye of Erroll), William de la Haye and 3 other siblings. Thomas married Isabel Joan DeLaHay (born Babthorpe) in 1
2 CONC 409, at age 29 at marriage place. Isabel was born in 1390, in Hemingbrough, Yorkshire, England. They had 3 daughters: Alice Tate / Thwaites (born de la Haye) and 2 other children. Thomas married Janet delaHay (born Johannet Thomas
2 CONC ) in 1430, at age 50. Janet was born in 1410. Thomas passed away on month day 1426, at age 46 at death place.
