2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT William was of Kincardine, co., and Old Montrose, co. Angus. He was capture at the battle of Homildon Hill in 1402 but was ransomed. In 1406, he was commissioner for peace with England and served similar roles several times. He se
2 CONC rved as an auditor in Exchequer.
