1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ALICIA MURE (aka ALICIA MORE) ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alicia More is the daughter of Reginald More, [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00stua/page/431/mode/1up Stewart Genealogy: pp. 431-2]  Her father has been identified as Sir Reginald Mure of Abercorn. [http://www.sti
2 CONC rnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4fz/mure01.php Stirnet: Mure 01]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alicia More married William de Herch. Her husband died before 6 July 1340. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00stua/page/431/mode/1up Stewart Genealogy: pp. 431-2]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Proposed Second Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Alicia More is reported to have married Sir John Stewart of Railston. According to the late George Burnett, Lord Lyon King of Arms, writing in the appendix to the preface of volume four of the Exchequer Rolls of Scotland, Sir J
2 CONC ohn Stewart of Railstoun: "has been wrongly identified with the John Stewart who was with David II. (king of Scots) at Chateau Gaillard, and there contracted a marriage with Alice, daughter of Reginald More the Chamberlain, and wi
2 CONC dow of William de Herch (Airth?), in ignorance of canonical impediment, and in 1340 and 1341 received two papal dispensations removing that impediment." [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir04grea/page/n192/mode/1up Excheq
2 CONC uer Rolls IV, 1406-1436: p. clxxxix]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from Stewart Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''6 July 1340: Dispensation in favour of John Stuart and Alice More, [daughter of] Reginald More, and widow of William de Herch. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00stua/page/431/mode/1up Stewart Genealogy: p. 431]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 March 1341: Dispensation in favour of John Stuart and Alice More, [daughter of] Reginald More and widow of William de Herch. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00stua/page/432/mode/1up Stewart Genealogy: p. 432]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Printed Evidence ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00stua/page/n8/mode/1up Genealogical history of the Stewarts, etc. By Andrew Stuart, Esq., M. P. (Printed for A. Strahan; and T. Cadell, jun. and W. Davies, in the Strand, London, 17
2 CONC 98), 468 pp.]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
