2 CONC Lindsay (1407–?), married Robert Erskine, 1st Lord Erskine and had issue.  Isabella Lindsay (1407–?), married Sir John Maxwell.  [edit] ReferencesGrant, Neil. Scottish Clans and Tartans. New York, Octopus Publishing Group Limited:
