2 CONT https://www.allabouthistory.co.uk/History/Scotland/Person/William-Douglas-8th-Earl-Douglas-2nd-Earl-Avondale-1425-1452.html
2 CONT https://en-academic.com/dic.nsf/enwiki/2429402
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/GHRF-C9S/william-douglas-8th-earl-of-douglas%2C-2nd-earl-of-avondale-1425-1452
