1 BIRT
2 DATE 1467
2 ADDR
3 CITY Pitsligo
3 STAE Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1510
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://books.google.com/books?id=YbrgAAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA237&ots=HR5sMVA8gP&dq=John%20Forbes%20of%20brux%20the%20white%20laird&pg=PA237#v=onepage&q=John%20Forbes%20of%20brux%20the%20white%20laird&f=false Publicati
2 CONC ons, Volume 34] By Scottish History Society.  Page 237
2 CONT
2 CONT John Forbes with the sleick hair, called the whyt Laird, married Elizabeth Gordon, daughter to Alex. Gordon of Cairnburrow, and got on her 4 daughters ; '''one''' married on Wm. Forbes of Davan;
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/70/mode/2up The Scots Peerage] page 71
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?id=sZdDAAAAYAAJ&vq=Daach%20brux&dq=alexander%20Forbes%203rd%20of%20pitsligo&pg=PA27#v=snippet&q=Daach%20brux&f=false Genealogy of the Forbes Family] Lumsden.  Page 27.  "Sr Alexander Forbes oye to 
2 CONC Sr Wm- Forbes of Pitsligo married the Lord Ogilvie's daughter, who did bear to him John [sic: Alexander in TSP] Forbes of Pitsligo, and ane oy'r. called Wm. of Daach, who was predecessor of the houss of Newe. Wm. Forbes of Daach, 
2 CONC brother to John Forbes of Pitsligo, married Forbes, daughter to the whit Laird of Brux, who did bear to him Alex. Forbes of New, and John Forbes of Sinshannie."
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p41381.htm#i413803
