3 STAE Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1500
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Seen as the Daughter of FORBES, Alexander 3rd of Pitsligo & Christian Ogilvie. However it seems more likely she is of the generation above - daughter of William Forbes & Mariota Ogilvy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name also seen as Barbara.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married John GORDON 2nd of Auchleuchries, 1st of Pitlurg, son of John GORDON 1st of Auchleuchries or Auchleuchry and Elizabeth ABERNATHY. (John GORDON 2nd of Auchleuchries was born about 1450)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # GORDON, John 3rd of Auchleuchries+
2 CONT # GORDON, James 1st of Cairnborrow+
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/thanageoffermart00byutemp#page/308/mode/2up Thannage of Fermantyn] Page 309
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________
