1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of William Forbes & Mariota Ogilvie.  Heir to his grandfather, Alexander Forbes, 2nd Laird of Pitsligo, in 1477.  Died 1496.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marries Isobel Wemyss, who survived him & in 1501 was the wife of William Blair.  1 son, 4 daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded by his son John.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/70/mode/2up The Scots Peerage] page 71
2 CONT # [http://books.google.com/books?pg=PA26&lpg=PA26&dq=alexander+Forbes+3rd+of+pitsligo&sig=gCwBLNHMC42hVk_uUrp4ay6ZkPY&ei=3DGIUvnHO4jU2AXi4ICoCg&id=sZdDAAAAYAAJ&ots=YLXx8nyFm5&output=text Geneology of the Forbes Family] page 26.  N
2 CONC ames him as John: "John Forbes of Pitsligo married Wcems, daughter to Sir Patrick Weems of Reircs, and begat on hef John Laird of Pitsligo, with diverss daughters; one was married to Asloune, ane oy'r. on Wm. Woodman of Fenzies; a
2 CONC ne oy'r. on Wm. White in Abd, ane oy'r. on Wm. Lawson, in Dysart."
