2 CONC y the marriage inabout 1320 of Patrick, son of Sir Patrick above, of Wester Powrie to Isabel the heiress of Robert Ramsay of Auchterhouse, became hereditary sheriffs of Angus in the fourteenth and fifteenth centuries.
