1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Ogilvy is the daughter of Sir Patrick Ogilvy of Auchterhouse and Christian Keith.1,2 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://thepeerage.com/p21082.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir John Oliphant of Aberdalgie, son of Sir William Oliphant of Aberdalgie and Marian de Berwick.3     
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Ogilvy and Sir John Oliphant of Aberdalgie
2 CONT # Laurence Oliphant, 1st Lord Oliphant+1 d. b 1500
2 CONT # James Oliphant1 d. Jun 1491
2 CONT # John Oliphant1
2 CONT # Margaret Oliphant1
