2 ADDR
3 STAE Scotland
1 OCCU Countess Buchan/ Baroness Auchterhouse
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Ogilvy is the daughter of Alexander Ogilvy of Auchterhouse.1 She married James Stewart, 1st Earl of Buchan, son of Sir James Stewart of Lorn and Lady Joan Beaufort, on 27 March 1459.2
2 CONT
2 CONT From March 1466/67, her married name became Stewart. After her marriage, Margaret Ogilvy was styled as Countess of Buchan in 1469.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Ogilvy and James Stewart, 1st Earl of Buchan
2 CONT *Alexander Stewart, 2nd Earl of Buchan+3 d. 1505
2 CONT *unknown daughter Stewart+3
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p10826.htm#i108251 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/U/per_page.php?id=15913 Geneall]
2 CONT * [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 230. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families.
2 CONT *[S2] Peter W. Hammond, editor, The Complete Peerage or a History of the House of Lords and All its Members From the Earliest Times, Volume XIV: Addenda & Corrigenda (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), page 1
2 CONC 20. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV.
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 565. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT ''' EARLS of BUCHAN 1469-1585 (STEWART)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT JAMES Stewart, son of JAMES Stewart of Lorn & his wife Joan Beaufort (-[Jan 1497/Jan 1500]).  Earl of Buchan 1469. 
2 CONT '''m (before 1 Mar 1467) MARGARET Ogilvy, daughter and heiress of ALEXANDER Ogilvy of Auchterhouse & his wife''' ---. 
2 CONT James & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >1.         ALEXANDER (-1505).  Earl of Buchan.  m firstly (before 20 May 1491) ISABEL Ogilvy, daughter of --- (-after 20 May 1491).  m secondly (before 1499) as her first husband, MARGARET Ruthven, daughter of WILLIAM Lord Ruthve
2 CONC n & his first wife Isabel --- (-1548).  She married (before 21 Jun 1508) John Erskine the younger of Dun.  Alexander & his second wife had four children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>a)         JOHN ([1498]-1551 after 14 Jul).  Earl of Buchan.  m MARGARET Scrymgeour, daughter of JAMES Scrymgeour of Dudhope & his wife ---.  John & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>i)          JOHN (-killed in battle Pinkie 10 Sep 1547).  Master of Buchan.  m firstly ELIZABETH Stuart, illegitimate daughter of JAMES Stuart Earl of Moray & his mistress Marion Stewart .  m secondly (before 15 May 1547) MARGA
2 CONC RET Ogilvy, daughter of WALTER Ogilvy of Boyne & his wife --- (-after 26 Dec 1549).  John & his second wife had one child:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>(a)       CHRISTIAN ([1547/48]-Aberdeen 20 Sep 1580).  Ctss of Buchan.  Betrothed (16 Jan 1550) to JAMES Stewart, illegitimate son of JAMES V King of Scotland & his mistress Margaret Erskine ([1531]-murdered Linlithgow 21 Jan 
2 CONC 1570, bur 14 Feb 1570 Edinburgh, St Giles).  He was created Earl of Moray in 1562.  m ROBERT Douglas of Morton, son of ROBERT Douglas of Lochleven & his wife Margaret Erskine (-Mills of Drum 18 Aug 1580).  Earl of Buchan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>ii)         JAMES .  m CHRISTIAN, daughter of JOHN Strang of Balcaskie & his wife ---.  James & his wife had four children:   
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>(a)       JAMES .  1618. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>(b)       ALEXANDER . 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>(c)       daughter . 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>(d)       daughter . 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>b)         son (1501-young).
2 CONT
2 CONT >>c)         AGNES .
2 CONT
2 CONT >>d)         JANET (-after 14 Jan 1513).  m as his first wife, ALEXANDER Livingston Lord Livingston, son of WILLIAM Livingston Lord Livingstone & his wife Agnes Hepburn of Whitsome (-[25 Jul 1549/4 Jan 1551]).  
2 CONT
2 CONT James had one illegitimate child by an unknown mistress: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >2.          daughter (-after 1530).  m ALEXANDER Abernethy Lord Saltoun, son of JAMES Abernethy Lord Saltoun & his wife --- (-before 25 Jul 1527). 
2 CONT
2 CONT James had two illegitimate children by MARGARET Murray, widow of WILLIAM Murray, daughter of ---.
2 CONT
2 CONT >3.          JAMES Stewart (-killed in battle Flodden 1513).  First of Traquair.  m CATHERINE Rutherford, daughter of PHILIP Rutherford of that Ilk & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >-           EARLS of TRAQUAIR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >4.          AGNES (-Feb 1557).  Balfour Paul records “Isabella Stewart, daughter of James Earl of Buchan” as mother of King James’s daughter “Janet” (no source cited)[1061].  Mistress ([1509]) of JAMES IV King of Scotland, son of
2 CONC  JAMES III King of Scotland & his wife Margarethe of Denmark (17 Mar 1473-killed in battle Flodden 9 Sep 1513).  m firstly (1511) ADAM Hepburn Earl of Bothwell, son of PATRICH Hepburn Earl of Bothwell & his second wife Margaret Go
2 CONC rdon of the Earls of Huntly  ([1492]-killed in battle Pinkie 9 Sep 1513).  m secondly ([9 Sep 1513/14 Feb 1514]) ALEXANDER Lord Home, son of ALEXANDER Home Lord Home (-beheaded Edinburgh 8 Oct 1516, bur Greyfriars).  m thirdly ([1
2 CONC 520/15 Nov 1525]) as his second wife, ROBERT Maxwell Lord Maxwell, son of JOHN Maxwell Lord Maxwell & his wife Agnes Stewart of Garlies ([1493/94]-Logan 9 Jul 1546).  m fourthly (before 13 Dec 1549) as his first wife, CUTHBERT Ram
2 CONC say, son of NICHOLAS Ramsay of Dalhousie & his wife --- (-after Feb 1557).
2 CONT
