2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 April 1453: Charter by which Alexander Lindsay, Earl of Crawford, Lord Lindsay, confirms that he has given the lands of Bolochet and Petnacre in the barony of Alyth, and sheriffdom of Perth, to Thomas Ogilvy of Clova and his
2 CONC  wife Elizabeth Douglas. These lands were to be held by Thomas and Elizabeth and their lawful male heirs, whom failing by Thomas's nearest lawful heirs. This charter was confirmed under the Great Seal of Scotland on 29 October 146
2 CONC 3. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/164/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 769]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Printed Evidence ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/n6/mode/1up Registrum Magni Sigilli Regum Scotorum. The Register of the Great Seal of Scotland, A.D. 1424-1513. Edited by James Balfour Paul, FSA. Scot. (H. M. General Re
2 CONC gister House, Edinburgh, 1882), 1153 pp. including indices and errata]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
