2 TITL Robert The Bruce, King of Scotland
2 NOTE Robert I, King of Scots (11 July 1274 – 7 June 1329) usually known in modern English as Robert the Bruce (Medieval Gaelic: Roibert a Briuis; modern Scottish Gaelic: Raibeart Bruis; Norman French: Robert de Brus or Robert de Bruys;
3 CONC  ) was King of the Scots from 1306 until his death in 1329.
