2 CONT * Hudson, B. (2022). Weird Sisters. In ''Macbeth before Shakespeare''. Oxford University Press. [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Macbeth_Before_Shakespeare/lnWVEAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=SIR+%22JOHN+WEMYSS%22+1429&pg=PA125&prin
2 CONC tsec=frontcover page 125].
