1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ancestor of Arthur Balfour Prime Minister of Great Britain1902 to 1905.
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Balfour, 1st of Munqhany
2 CONT * Parents: son of Michael Balfour, Janet Ogilvy
2 CONT * Died:  9 September 1513 at Battle of Flodden Field, Branxton, Northumberland, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT married 
2 CONT # Marjory Drury, daughter of George (Andrew) Drury. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT # Michael Balfour
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. Sir Michael de Balfour of Munquhanny and Strathor in whose favour his grandfather (while attending James III with John Lord Lindsay and other Fife Barons against the rebellious James, Earl of Douglas) resigned his lands of Mun
2 CONC quhanny, Strathor etc. into the King's hands for new infeftment to the said Michael, and who accordingly received a Charter from James III at Edinburgh 13 October 1465. By his wife Janet Ogilvy he had a son Michael and a daughter 
2 CONC Margaret, the wife of William 3rd Earl of Rothes. Sir Michael and his son-in-law fell at Flodden 1513.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT * http://www.orkneybalfours.com/HTM/lineage.htm
