2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p100.htm#i2987
2 CONT *Sir Michael Balfour1
2 CONT *M, d. 9 September 1513
2 CONT *Father Sir Michael Balfour, Baron Strathore 
2 CONT *Mother Janet Ogilvy 
2 CONT *     Sir Michael Balfour was born at of Munquhanny, Scotland. He married Marjory Drury, daughter of George (Andrew) Drury. Sir Michael Balfour died on 9 September 1513 at Battle of Flodden, Scotland.
2 CONT *Family Marjory Drury  
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦Janet Balfour
2 CONT **◦Margaret Balfour+
2 CONT **◦Andrew Balfour+
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S213] Unknown author, Burke's Commoners, Vol. III, p. 134.
