2 CONT *http://www.thepeerage.com/p2813.htm#i28127
2 CONT *Sir Michael Balfour
2 CONT *M, #28127
2 CONT *Last Edited=29 May 2008     
2 CONT *     Sir Michael Balfour lived at Monquhany, Fife, Scotland.
2 CONT *Child of Sir Michael Balfour
2 CONT **1.Margaret Balfour+
2 CONT *<nowiki>-------------------</nowiki>
