2 CONT '''Christian Ogilvy, here treated, is reported to be the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-David-Ogilvy-of-Inchmartin-Kt/6000000011089191387?through=6000000184312383881 The name of her mother is not known. [https://archi
