2 CONT
2 CONT '''According the late Francis J. Grant, writing in his account of the family of Lord Gray for the Scots Peerage, Patrick Gray, afterwards Lord Gray: "by indenture dated 25 April 1476, betwixt Andrew, Lord Gray, and David Ogilvy of
2 CONC  Inchmartine, Patrick, Lord Gray, was contracted in marriage to Christian Ogilvy, daughter of the said David, but this marriage did not take  place, as appears from a discharge by the said David Ogilvy to Lord Gray dated 16 Januar
2 CONC y 1503-4." [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/278/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 278-9]'''
2 CONT
