2 CONC gdale. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD26%2f3%2f1023&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=marion+hay&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Leslie family, Earls
