2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for Sir Sylvester Rattray of that Ilk, here treated. He was alive on 24 April 1493. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD79%2f1%2f35&
2 CONC st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=sylvester+rattray&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1450&dt=1542&di=n NRS: GD79/1/35] but he was succeeded by https://www.geni.com/people/John-Rattray-11th-of-that-Ilk/6000000003828323124?through=6000000011088749879 befor
2 CONC e 9 October 1495. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD181%2f11&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=rettra&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1490&dt=1517&di=n NRS: GD181/11]'''
2 CONT
