2 CONT '''16 April 1478: Charter by which SILVESTRI RETTRAY DE EODEM confirms that he has given the twenty pound lands of Kinbauloch and the lands of Haltoun, both in the barony of Kinbauloch and Sheriffdom of Perth, to his son and appar
2 CONC ent heir JOHANNI RETTRAY and his wife ELIZABETH KENNEDY, as agreed in their marriage contract. The lands in question were to be held by them in conjunct fee and liferent, and thereafter by their lawful heirs, whom failing by the n
2 CONC earest lawful heirs of Silvestri Rettray de eodem. SILVESTRI RETTRAT DE EODEM held these lands directly of the crown. A charter of confirmation under the Great Seal of Scotland was issued to JOHANNI RETTRAY and his wife ELIZABETH 
2 CONC KENNEDY on 28 May 1479. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/294/mode/1up RMS: 1424-1513: 1427]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
