1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Ogilvy, 2nd Laird of Boyne, and Elspeth Irvine had four children together: a son who succeeded his father, and three daughters. 
2 CONT The children of George Ogilvy and Elspeth Irvine were:
2 CONT * Sir Walter Ogilvy, 3rd of Boyne: He succeeded his father and was born around 1504.
2 CONT * Margaret Ogilvy.
2 CONT * Janet Ogilvy.
2 CONT * Elizabeth Ogilvy: Some sources, including Geni.com and The Irvine Family of Drum, explicitly list her as a daughter. This Elizabeth Ogilvy is said to have married Alexander Irvine around 1526
