1 NAME Agnes Seton (Gordon)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1482
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===Agnes Gordon1
2 CONT *F, #631353
2 CONT *Last Edited=3 Dec 2013
2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p63136.htm#i631353
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Gordon is the daughter of Patrick Gordon of Methlic and Haddo and Marion Oglivie of Findlater.1 She married John Leslie, 2nd of Wardis, son of Alexander Leslie, 1st of Wardis and Isabel Lauder.1  Her married name became Lesl
2 CONC ie.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT "He (John Leslie 2nd of Wardis) married, fourthly, Agnes Gordon, daughter of Patrick Gordon of Haddo, ancestor of the Earls of Aberdeen, and had issue
2 CONT *I. ANDREW, progenitor of the Leslies of Bucharn, and of the Leslies of Clisson in France, of whom afterwards.
2 CONT *II. BESSIE, married, first, to Robert Winton, and, secondly, to Andrew Menzies.
2 CONT *III. MARJORY, married to James Keith of Aquhorsk.
2 CONT *IV. Another Daughter, married to John Leith, third son of Patrick Leith of Edingarioch, in 1520."
2 CONT
2 CONT from Family of Leslie
2 CONT
2 CONT "Before 1st March, 1501-2,(Council Reg., VIII., 76.), he had married for his third wife Agnes or Annabella, a daughter of Patrick Gordon of Haddo, by whom he had Andrew, progenitor of the Leslies of Bucharn and of the Leslies of C
2 CONC lisson, in France; Bessie, married to Robert Winton, and secondly to Andrew Menzies ; Marjory, married to James Keith of Aquhorsk ; and another daughter, married in 1520 to John Leith, a son of Leith of Edingarioch."
2 CONT
2 CONT from Aldermen and Provosts
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: as seen, these sources disagree on the order of John Leslie's wives. Aldermen and Provosts has been followed here. 1 2
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Citations
2 CONT * https://www.patrickspeople.scot/our%20family/6436.htm
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2305. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
