2 CONT Birth:	1482 - Cromarty, Ross & Cromarty, Scotland Death:	Aug 26 1553 - Frenchie, Perthshire, Scotland Parents:	John Grant, Margaret Grant Wife:	Elizabeth Grant Children:	John Grant, Isabel Campbell Siblings:	John Grant, Anna Frase
