1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARION MAXWELL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marion Maxwell is not mentioned in William Fraser's account of the family. [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/465/mode/1up Memoirs of the Maxwells of Pollock I: 465-66] According to G. Harvey Johnston, Mari
2 CONC on Maxwell is  the daughter of Sir John Maxwell of Calderwood. [https://archive.org/stream/heraldryofhamils00john#page/121/mode/1up Heraldry of the Hamiltons: 120-21] It is possible that she is the daughter of Margaret Borthwick. 
2 CONC [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4ae/maxwell01.php Stirnet: Maxwell 01]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Note ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Borthwick's husband, Sir John Maxwell of Calderwood, is the son of Sir Robert Maxwell of Calderwood, and the grandson of Sir John Maxwell of Pollock. [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4ae/maxwell01.php Stirn
2 CONC et: Maxwell 01] It follows, therefore, that he is not the same person as John, Master of Maxwell.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/heraldryofhamils00john#page/121/mode/1up G. Harvey Johnston, FSA (Scot)., The Heraldry of the Hamiltons with Notes on all the Males of the Family, Descriptions of the Arms, Plates and Pedigrees (W.
2 CONC  & A. K. Johnston Limited, Edinburgh & London, MCMIX), pp. 120-21]'''
2 CONT # '''[http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/mm4ae/maxwell01.php Stirnet: Maxwell 01]'''
