2 CONT *''''''Isobel Gray1
2 CONT *F, #256242
2 CONT *Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT *''''''     Isobel Gray married Sir James Scrymgeour, son of Sir James Scrymgeour and Margaret Maitland, in 1495.1
2 CONT *''''''     She is the daughter of Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray.2 From 1495, her married name became Scrymgeour.
2 CONT *''''''Child of Isobel Gray and Sir James Scrymgeour
2 CONT ** 1.James Scrymgeour+2 d. 1546
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 1, page 1222. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT * 2.[S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *http://thepeerage.com/p25625.htm#i256242
2 CONT *_____________
2 CONT *''''''Isobel 'the Younger' Gray1 
2 CONT *F
2 CONT *Father    Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray, Sheriff of Forfar, Justice of Scotland d. Feb 1514
2 CONT *Mother    Elizabeth Stewart b. a 1460
2 CONT *''''''     Isobel 'the Younger' Gray married James Scrymgeour, Constable of Dundee, son of James Scrimgeour and Margaret Maitland, circa 1495. Isobel 'the Younger' Gray married Sir John Campbell, son of Thomas Campbell, circa 152
2 CONC 1.2
