2 CONT
2 CONT Martha Seton is the daughter of George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton and Lady Margaret Campbell.1 She married William Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington, son of John Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington and unknown daughter Dundas.2  
2 CONC Her married name became Maitland.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Martha Seton and William Maitland of Thirlestane and Levington
2 CONT * Sir Richard Maitland, Lord Lethington+2 b. 1496, d. 20 Mar 1585/86
