2 CONC gue/details.aspx?reference=GD237%2f7%2f1&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=edmonstone&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1400&di=n National Records of Scotland, Don of Newton and Edmondstone, reference GD237/7/1]'''
