1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Elizabeth Douglas'''1,2,3,4,5,6,7
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT F, #4446, '''d. circa 1451'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Sir Archibald Douglas, 4th Earl Douglas, Duke of Touraine, Lord of Galloway & Wigtoun8,4,9,6,7 b. c 1375, d. 17 Aug 1424
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Margaret Stewart8,4,9,6,7 d. bt Jan 1450 - Sep 1456
2 CONT Charts	
2 CONT Pedigree of James Irvine (#1)
2 CONT Pedigree of James Irvine (#2)
2 CONT Pedigree of James Irvine (#3)
2 CONT '''     Elizabeth Douglas and John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Buchan, Chamberlain of Scotland, Constable of France obtained a marriage license on 1 May 1411; Date of dispensation, being related in the 3rd degree of consanguinity. They h
2 CONC ad 1 daughter''' (Margaret, wife of George, 1st Lord Seton).2,3,4,5,6,7 '''Elizabeth Douglas and Sir Thomas Stewart, Master of Mar obtained a marriage license on 1 May 1427; Date of dispensation being related in the double 3rd deg
2 CONC rees of consanguinity and in the 2nd & 3rd degree of affinity.2,4,5,10,7 Elizabeth Douglas and Sir William Sinclair, 3rd Earl of Orkney, 1st Earl Caithness, Lord Sinclair obtained a marriage license on 12 August 1432; Dispensation
2 CONC  to remain in marriage, being related in the 2nd & 3rd and 3rd degree of consanguinity, & in the 2nd and 3rd degrees of affinity. They had 1 son''' (William 'the Waster') '''& 1 daughter''' (Elizabeth, wife of Sir Andrew Leslie, M
2 CONC aster of Rothes, & of Sir John Houston).11,2,3,4,5,6,7 '''Elizabeth Douglas died circa 1451'''.12,3,4,6,7
2 CONT '''Family 1'''
2 CONT '''John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Buchan, Chamberlain of Scotland, Constable of France''' b. c 1380, d. 17 Aug 1424
2 CONT '''Child'''	
2 CONT *Margaret Stewart+ d. b 8 Jan 1461
2 CONT '''Family 2'''
2 CONT '''Sir Thomas Stewart, Master of Mar''' d. b 12 Aug 1432
2 CONT '''Family 3'''
2 CONT '''Sir William Sinclair, 3rd Earl of Orkney, 1st Earl Caithness, Lord Sinclair''' d. bt 7 Dec 1476 - 29 Mar 1482
2 CONT '''Children	'''
