2 CONT [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10801.htm#i108004]     
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Stewart is the daughter of John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Buchan and Lady Elizabeth Douglas.1 She married George Seton, 1st Lord Seton, son of Sir William Seton of Seton and Janet Dunbar, before 8 January 1436/37.1,2 She died 
2 CONC before 8 January 1461.
2 CONT
2 CONT      From before 8 January 1436/37, her married name became Seton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Stewart and George Seton, 1st Lord Seton
2 CONT
2 CONT John Seton, Master of Seton+ d. b 14781 
2 CONT
2 CONT Douglas Seton 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
