2 CONT No. 7 on House of Argyle Chart, Call No. B12 C17; married Margaret Stewart, daughter of Sir John Stewart, the illegimate son of Robert III.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The name Cambel was first used by the family in the 13th century. The first chief of the clan to appear on record as "Campbell" may well have been Sir Duncan of Lochawe when he was created Lord Campbell in 1445.'  copied from Clan
2 CONC  Campbell website, history page.
2 CONT
