1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD CAMPBELL  Master of Campbell===
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''(aka GILESPIC CAMPBELL or CELESTIN CAMPBELL)'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Campbell is the son of Sir Duncan Campbell of Lochow, afterwards Lord Campbell, and his wife Marjory Stewart. He predeceased his father and died before March 1440. He is said to have married twice. First to Elizabeth 
2 CONC Somerville, and second to a daughter of Murdac, Duke of Albany, Regent of Scotland. He left a son named Colin who succeeded his grandfather as Lord Campbell and was afterwards created Earl of Argyll. [https://archive.org/stream/sc
2 CONC otspeeragefoun01pauluoft#page/354/mode/1up The Scots Peerage I: 332]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun01pauluoft#page/356/mode/2up The Scots Peerage I: 332]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/12 The Scots Peerage VIII: 12]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===SmartCopy References===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-265391321-1-501446/archibald-gillespic-campbell-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 13 20
2 CONC 16, 0:50:19 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-263809511-1-502966/archibald-gillespic-campbell-in-myheritage-family-trees MyHeritage Family Trees] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Dec 13 20
2 CONC 16, 4:12:51 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ='''Archibald Campbell, Master of Campbell'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT Archibald was the eldest son of Duncan, 1st Lord Campbell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Archibald died ca. 1431–1440, before his father was created a Lord of Parliament in 1457.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ='''Archibald Roy Campbell, Master of Campbell'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st son and heir ap. of Sir Duncan Campbell of Lochow, 1st Lord Campbell, by his first wife Lady Marjory Stewart, 1st dau. by his second wife of Robert Stewart, 1st Duke of Albany
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: c. 1382
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: (1) Elizabeth Somerville of Carnwath (b. 1389, d. 1419), daughter of John Somerville, 2nd Lord Somerville and Helen Hepburn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by 1st wife:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Colin Campbell, later 2nd Lord Campbell, later 1st Earl of Argyll b. bt 1435 - 1440, d. 10 May 1493
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: (2)  Margaret? Stewart, daughter of Murdoch Stewart, 2nd Duke of Albany,  and Joan Douglas before 1440.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by 2nd wife: Without issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: March 1446
2 CONT
2 CONT Tenure: Died before his father
2 CONT
2 CONT Other titles: None
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by: Duncan Campbell, 1st Lord Campbell
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded by: Eldest son, Colin Campbell, 2nd Lord Campbell, 1st Earl of Argyll
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: He was also known as Gillespic. He was styled as Master of Campbell. He was also known as Celestine. He lived at Lochow, Argyllshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clann Campbell Society (North America): [https://www.ccsna.org/archibald-campbell-master-campbell]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ='''Lord Archibald Gillespic Campbell (1405-1440)'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Birth:''' 1405, Lochawe, Argyll, Scotland, United Kingdom
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Death:''' 22 March 1440 (Age 35), Kilmun, Argyll, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT '''SPOUSES AND CHILDREN:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lord Archibald Gillespic Campbell (1405-1440)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 13 January 1432, Carnwath, Lanarkshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lady Elizabeth Somerville (1415-1460)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children (6)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # Lady Elizabeth Campbell (1430-1485)
2 CONT # Anne Campbell (1431-?)
2 CONT # Duncan Campbell (1431-?)
2 CONT # Lady Catherine Campbell (1432-1482)
2 CONT # Sir Colin Campbell 1st Earl of Argyll (1433-1493)
2 CONT # Margaret Campbell (1440-1530)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''PARENTS AND SIBLINGS:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sir Duncan Na-Adh Campbell 1st Baron of Campbell (1370-1453)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 12 March 1395, Argyll, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT * Lady Marjory Marcelline Stewart, Countess of Monteith (1375-1423)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children (2)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # Lord Archibald Gillespic Campbell (1405-1440)
2 CONT # Celestine Campbell (1406-1453)
