2 CONT Note 1 - The Battle of Sark was fought in October 1448. Soooo this could NOT have been the John Wallace who married Catherine Douglas. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Looking back up the tree a little is a John Wallace b. ca 1390 who married Elizabeth Cathcart. This John was know as the "Good Laird" and is of an age (58) that makes him a prime candidate for being the "Hero of Sark" 
2 CONT
