1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MATILDA STEWART ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to Sir Archibald Edmonstone of Duntreath, Baronet (1795-1871), Matilda Stewart was the illegitimate daughter of Lord James Stewart, sole surviving son of Murdoch Duke of Albany. She married Sir William Edmonstone of D
2 CONC untreath, the marriage being attested to by a precept of sasine among the family archives of the lands of Dungoyak, and other portions of Duntreath, dated 17 May 1456. By Matilda Stewart Sir William left (according to Crauford's g
2 CONC enealogy) six sons and one daughter. [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalacco00inedmo/page/32/mode/1up Edmonstone of Duntreath: 32-3]'''
