1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *http://www.thepeerage.com/p2812.htm#i28119
2 CONT *''''''Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes
2 CONT *M, #28119, d. before 3 August 1473
2 CONT *Last Edited=10 Apr 2008
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.8%
2 CONT *     Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes was the son of George Leslie, 1st Earl of Rothes and Christian Haliburton. He married Elizabeth Sinclair, daughter of William Sinclair, 1st Earl of Caithness and Lady Elizabeth Douglas.1 He di
2 CONC ed before 3 August 1473.1
2 CONT *     Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes was styled as Master of Rothes.
2 CONT *Children of Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes and Elizabeth Sinclair
2 CONT **1.John Leslie, Master of Rothes
2 CONT **2.George Leslie, 2nd Earl of Rothes d. fr 24 Feb 1512/13 - 31 Mar 1513
2 CONT **3.William Leslie, 3rd Earl of Rothes+ d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extin
2 CONC ct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume XI, page 188. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *<nowiki>------------------------</nowiki>
2 CONT *http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p976.htm#i29309
2 CONT *''''''Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes1
2 CONT *M, d. before 3 August 1473
2 CONT *Father George Leslie, 1st Earl of Rothes, Lord Leslie b. b 2 Sep 1416, d. bt 31 Aug 1489 - 24 May 1490 
2 CONT *Mother Christian Halyburton 
2 CONT *     Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes married Elizabeth Sinclair, daughter of William Sinclair, Earl of Orkney & 1st Earl Caithness and Elizabeth Douglas. Andrew Leslie, Master of Rothes died before 3 August 1473.
2 CONT *Family Elizabeth Sinclair d. 1508 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦William Leslie, 3rd Earl of Rothes+ d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT **◦John Leslie, Master of Rothes d. bt May 1478 - 23 Jun 1481
2 CONT **◦George Leslie, 2nd Earl Rothes d. b 31 Mar 1513
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT *1.[S9128] Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. XI, p. 188; Scot's Peerage, Vol. VII, p. 276.
2 CONT *<nowiki>---------------------------</nowiki>
