1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Stirnet's [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/aa/abernethy1.php#link1 "Abernethy1" page (membership required to view without interruption)]: "''TSP'' suggests that the <this> elder daughter married [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Walter-or-William-Ogstoun/6000000003076870565 Walter Ogston of that ilk]. The Ogston source suggests that she was Walter's mother, having married ... <John Ogston of that ilk.>"
