1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN BANE===
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Spurious Pedigree'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''John Bane, here treated, is misidentified as the son of Thomas Bane in at least one pedigree published by   [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bain-392 WikiTree] and in another twelve published by [https://www.myheritag
2 CONC e.com/matchingresult-ae59f3e136e9c9942ff9b3db14f8002f?auth=62c557d9aa4446f3c18ef3dcd8228b47&callback_token=cfERWFZBnPr5o3BRBLJtyIl6k4cPJD8zIfiMefav&trn=partner_Geni&trp=match_button_profile#smart_matches My Heritage] but the date 
2 CONC of birth offered for him, that is Edinburgh on 20 October 1601, suggests otherwise. The baptism registered on that date does belong to a child named John Bane, but the father is Archibald Bane, rather than Thomas Bane. [National R
2 CONC ecords of Scotland, Edinburgh Baptisms, 1595-1610, reference OPR.685/1/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000100190794189& Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===His Baptismal Record===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Bane, here treated, is the son of Archibald Bane, Cook in Edinburgh. The name of his mother is not mentioned in his baptismal record. He was born before 20 October 1601, the date upon which his baptism was registered at Ed
2 CONC inburgh in Midlothian, Scotland. His baptismal record reads as follows: "Archibald Bane cuik a. s. n. Johnne w. Johnne Kincaid of Craigholme. James Reid pultreman.". [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Baptisms, 1595-1610, re
2 CONC ference OPR.685/1/1] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000100190794189& Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Spurious Descent Published by WikiTree===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Bain Born October 20, 1601 in Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland Son of Thomas Bain and [mother unknown] [sibling(s) unknown] Husband of Alesone (Ker) Bain — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Father of James Bane Sr. 
2 CONC (James Bane Sr married to Elizabeth (Clark) Bane) Died [date unknown] [location unknown] [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bain-392 WikiTree: John Bain]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Bain Born 1580 in Scotland Son of John A. Bain and Agnes (Fraser) Bain Brother of Archibald Bane or Bain and John Bain [spouse(s) unknown] Father of John Bain Died 1626 in Perth, Kinross-shire, Scotland [https://www.wiki
2 CONC tree.com/wiki/Bain-393 WikiTree: Thomas Bain]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Alexander Bain Born 1514 in Cromarty, Ross & Cromarty County, Scotland Son of Duncan Bayn and Catherine (Mckenzie) Munro Brother of Robert Munro V, Hugh Munro, Hector Munro, George Munro, John Munroe and Robert Munro Husba
2 CONC nd of Agnes (Fraser) Bain — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Father of Thomas Bain and John Bain Died October 29, 1600 in Perth, Kinross-shire, Scotland [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bain-394 WikiTree: John Alexander Bai
2 CONC n]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note: Alexander Bain of Tulloch has been misidentified here as John Alexander Bain. Alexander Bayne of Tulloch is reported to have married Janet Dingwall. https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4ae/bayne1.php Stirnet: Bay
2 CONC ne 1]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Duncan Bayn Born about 1489 in Dingwall, Scotlandmap Son of [father unknown] and [mother unknown] [sibling(s) unknown] Husband of Catherine (Mckenzie) Munro — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Father of John A. Bain Die
2 CONC d 1559 in Tulloch Castle, Dingwall, Ross and Cromarty, Scotland Duncan Bayne, 1st of Tulloch [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bayn-1 WikiTree: Duncan Bayn]'''
