1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Lady Elizabeth Stewart, of Atholl''' was born in 1549 in Atholl, Perthshire, Scotland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-10086599 John Stewart, 4th Earl of Atholl] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-37101431 Elizabe
2 CONC th Gordon, Countess Atholl]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-85723332 Hugh Fraser, 5th Lord Lovat] on December 24, 1567 in Scotland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had the following children:
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-109406312 Anne Fraser]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-37799599 Hon. Simon J. Fraser, Sr., 6th Lord Lovat]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-37101668 Mary (Fraser) Cumming]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34662739034 Elizabeth Fraser]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34662738876 Alexander Fraser]; 
2 CONT # [https://www.geni.com/profile-34662738915 Thomas Fraser].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34663419509 Robert Stewart, Lord Darnley] circa 1578. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth married [https://www.geni.com/profile-56401258 James Stewart, Earl of Arran] on July 6, 1581 in Scotland. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-21538861 Catherine (Stewart) Grant];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652601446 James Stewart, 4th Lord Ochiltree];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34652631558 Henry Stewart of Killinnan]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in September 1595 in Scotland. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT # https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00006024&tree=LEO cites
