1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===COLONEL ROBERT STEWART OF EDAY===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Colonel Robert Stewart is the eldest son of Captain Sir James Stewart and his wife Margaret Lyon. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft#page/573/mode/1up The Scots Peerage] It has been suggested that he was bor
2 CONC n before 1647.[http://thepeerage.com/p1559.htm#i15582 Darryl Lundy's Peerage] He died before 3 September 1688. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH9%2f15%2f15&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=
2 CONC Ethay&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers relating to Orkney and Shetland, reference RH9/15/15]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Colonel Robert Stewart of Eday married Lady Jean Gordon. The marriage contract is dated 11 July 1657. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/351/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 351]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
