2 CONT ===Evidence Published by the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''3-14 September 1688: Ethay: Depositions re writs and securities in action before lords of council and session, at instance of Robert Stewart, [son] and apparent heir of deceased captain Robert Stewart of Eday, against James Bai
2 CONC kie of Tankerness, and others, so that said Robert can decide whether to enter as heir to his said father or not [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH9%2f15%2f15&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&
2 CONC k=Ethay&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers relating to Orkney and Shetland, reference RH9/15/15]'''
