1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY ANNE HAMILTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Anne Hamilton, here treated, is the eldest daughter of James Hamilton, Marquess of Hamilton, and his wife Lady Anne Cunningham. She was married (contract dated 7 and 13 April 1631) to Hugh, Lord Montgomerie, afterwards sev
2 CONC enth Earl of Eglinton, and died at Struthers in Fife 16 October 1632. They had one daughter. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/375/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 375]'''
