1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY MARY HAMILTON ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Mary Hamilton is the daughter of James Hamilton, second Marquess of Hamilton and his wife Lady Anna Cunningham. She married, as his first wife (contract dated 4 June 1630) to James, Master of Drumlanrig. She died without i
2 CONC ssue on 29 October 1633. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/375/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 375]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
