1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Janet Turing was born in 1568 in Foveran, Aberdeenshire, Scotland. She is the daughter of James Turing of Foveran. She married John Johnston of Caskieben, son of George Johnston of Caskieben and Christian Forbes. [
2 CONC 1]  his first wife.  She died about 1595 in Craig, Aberdeenshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT Genealogical account of the family of Johnston of that Ilk, formerly of Caskieben, in the shire of Aberdeen, and of its principal branches.  by Johnston, Alexander, Writer to the Signet (Publication date 1832)  Page 9-10. [https:/
2 CONC /archive.org/details/genealogicalacco1832john/page/n23/mode/2up Archive.Org]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Johnson married  first to Janet, daughter of Turing of Foveran. Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT #George, his successor, married to Elizabeth, daughter of William Forbes of Tolquohoun
2 CONT #John, no succession 
2 CONT #Elizabeth, married to Bannerman of Elsick
2 CONT #Jean, married to William Forbes of Knapernay
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * http://www.thepeerage.com/p48797.htm#i487963
