1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Elizabeth Douglas was the daughter of William Douglas, 6th Earl of Morton and Lady Agnes Leslie., She married Francis Hay, 9th Earl of Erroll, son of Andrew Hay, 8th Earl of Erroll and Lady Jean Hay, in 1590. 
2 CONC Her married name became Hay. Children of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Francis Hay, 9th Earl of Erroll Lady Mary Hay+ d. 11 Apr 1631Lady Anne Hay+William Hay, 10th Earl of Erroll+ d. 7 Dec 1636Lady Jean Hay+Lady Elizabeth Hay+Lady So
2 CONC phia Hay+ d. c 12 Mar 1642Lady Margaret Hay
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Douglas-957 WikiTree Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 16 2017, 3:36:16 UTC''
