2 CONT  TITLES: Forfeiture> By proclamation 1654.
2 CONT
2 CONT  PUNISHMENT: Imprisoned> Taken prisoner at Worcester; committed to the Tower; at liberty for the benefit of his health 1652.
2 CONT  PUNISHMENT: Forfeiture> Forfeited by proclamation 1654.
2 CONT
2 CONT  CONDITION: spm> Died without male issue.
