1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Find a Grave memorial [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/156196433/anne-douglas Lady Anne ''Keith'' Douglas]==
2 CONT Portrait of Anne Douglas (Keith), Countess of Morton by George Jamestone 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Anne Keith1
2 CONT *F, #25760, d. 30 May 1648
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Apr 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.03%
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne, Countess of Morton
2 CONT
2 CONT by George Jamestone 2     
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Anne Keith was the daughter of George Keith, 4th Earl Marischal and Margaret Home.1 She married William Douglas, 7th Earl of Morton, son of Robert Douglas, Master of Morton and Jean Lyon, on 28 March 1604. She died on 30 May 
2 CONC 1648.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Douglas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Anne Keith and William Douglas, 7th Earl of Morton
