1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Margaret Douglas was born in 1610.[1] She died on 13 March 1677/78.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  daughter of William Douglas, 7th Earl of Morton and Lady Anne Keith.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # circa 6 August 1626 to Archibald Campbell, 1st Marquess of Argyll, son of Archibald Campbell, 7th Earl of Argyll and Lady Agnes Douglas.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Campbell. As a result of her marriage, Lady Margaret Douglas was styled as Countess of Argyll in 1638. As a result of her marriage, Lady Margaret Douglas was styled as Marchioness of Argyll, on 15 November 
2 CONC 1641.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Margaret Douglas and Archibald Campbell, 1st Marquess of Argyll
2 CONT
2 CONT # Lord Neil Campbell [2]
