2 CONT # Archibald Campbell, 9th Earl of Argyll+1 b. 26 Feb 1628/29, d. 30 Jun 1685
2 CONT # Lady Mary Campbell+3 b. a 1634, d. 4 Feb 1690/91
2 CONT
