1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == MARGARET OGILVY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Margaret Lyon, here treated, is the daughter of Sir Patrick Ogilvy of Inchmartine.  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''29 June 1628: Antenuptial contract of marriage between Frederick Lyone of Brigtoune and Margaret Ogilvie daughter of Sir Patrick Ogilvie of Inchmartine and dame Anna Campbell, his spouse. [Note: This Margaret Ogilvie not in Sco
2 CONC ts Peerage]. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD248%2f577%2f8&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=patrick+ogilvie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Ogilv
2 CONC y family, Earls of Seafield (Seafield Papers), reference GD248/577/8]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/oo/ogilvy02.php Stirnet: Ogilvy 02]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ll/lyon02.php Stirnet: Lyon 02]'''
