1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir Nicholas Chetwode (d.1369) of Chetwode m Elizabeth, da. of Sir John Lyons† of Warkworth. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.histparl.ac.uk/volume/1386-1421/member/chetwode-sir-john-1412
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT The daughter, Elizabeth, of Sir John Lyons, (d.1385) who was Lord of Warkworth,[8] married Sir John [SIC: Nicholas] Chetwode:[10] Elizabeth had no male siblings and the estate passed to Chetwode, who adopted the Lyons arms and the
2 CONC  title 'Lord of Warkworth'.[11]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lyons_family
2 CONT
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT Date and place of death have also been erroneously reported to be 1410 at an unspecified location.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==links==
2 CONT * https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/cc4aq/chetwode1.php#link1 (membership required to view without interruption) has his death as 1351/2
