2 CONT From Daryl Lundy's Peerage page on Isabella, Lady of Mar:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10209.htm#i102090
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabella, Lady of Mar[1]
2 CONT *F, #102090, d. before 1302
2 CONT *Last Edited=20 Jan 2011
2 CONT *Isabella, Lady of Mar was the daughter of Donald, 6th Earl of Mar and Helen ferch Llywelyn.[1] 
2 CONT *She married Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland, son of Sir Robert le Brus, 1st Lord Brus and Margaret, Countess of Carrick, circa 1295.[1] 
2 CONT *She died before 1302.1
2 CONT *Isabella, Lady of Mar gained the title of Lady of Mar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Isabella, Lady of Mar and Robert I Bruce, King of Scotland
2 CONT *1. Margorie Bruce, Princess of Scotland+2 b. c 1297, d. 2 Mar 1316
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 209. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family.
2 CONT *2. [S323] Sir James Balfour Paul, The Scots Peerage: founded on Wood's edition of Sir Robert Douglas's The Peerage of Scotland (Edinburgh, Scotland: David Douglas, 1904), volume 1, page 8. Hereinafter cited as The Scots Peerage.
2 CONT
