1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR WILLIAM MURE OF ROWALLAN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir William Mure of Rowallan is the son of Sir Archibald Mure of Rowallan. According to the family historian: "William, heir and successor to Ard. married a daughter of the house of Craigie then Lindsay, he begot upon her Adame
2 CONC  who succeided." [https://archive.org/stream/historiedescento1825mure#page/38/mode/1up Historie, p. 38]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Note 1===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.mathematical.com/murewilliam1265.html Mure of Rowallan]
2 CONT
2 CONT William Mure
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1265 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1348
2 CONT
