2 CONT
2 CONT *Archibald Mure of Rowallan
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1231 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Margaret de Montgomerie
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1235 Eastwood, Renfrewshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Mure born about 1262 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonet Mure born about 1263 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert (Reginald) Mure born about 1267 Camceskane, Ayrshire, Scotland died after 1329
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew (Andro) Mure born about 1269 Monyhagen, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT spouse:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Margaret Lindsey
2 CONT
2 CONT born about 1261 Craigie, Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT (end of information).
2 CONT
2 CONT children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Sir Adam Mure of Rowallen born about 1290 Rowallan, Kilmarnock, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT died about 1330
2 CONT
2 CONT Reynold Mure born about 1291 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland died about 1357
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter Mure born about 1295 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter Mure born about 1297 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland [http://www.mathematical.com/murewilliam1265.html Mure of Rowallan]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Note 2===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.thepeerage.com/p466.htm#i4659 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
