2 CONT
2 CONT William Mure of Rowallan|d. c 1348|p466.htm#i4659|Sir Archibald Mure of Rowallan||p467.htm#i4661|Margaret de Montgomery||p467.htm#i4665|Sir Gilchrist Mure of Rowallan|b. c 1200\nd. c 1260|p467.htm#i4662|Isabel Comyn||p467.htm#i466
2 CONC 3|Sir John de Montgomery|d. c 1285|p467.htm#i4666||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=23 Mar 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      William Mure of Rowallan was the son of Sir Archibald Mure of Rowallan and Margaret de Montgomery. He died circa 1348.
2 CONT
