2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Lindsay was born about 1261, the daughter of William Lindsay, 1st of Craigie Castle.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Mure of Rowallan, born about 1265 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland, son of Sir Archibald Mure of Rowallan and Margaret de Montgomery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children  of Margaret Lindsay and William Mure of Rowallan
2 CONT # Andrew Mure,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT # Sir Reginald Mure, of Cowdams, later of Abercorn,   d. Aft 1329 [Reynold Mure born about 1291 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland died about 1357]
2 CONT #Sir Adam Mure, 1st of Rowallan+ b. c 1290, d. a 1332
2 CONT # daughter Mure born about 1295 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT # daughter Mure born about 1297 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
