1 NAME Archibald /Mure of Rowallan/
2 GIVN Archibald
2 SURN Mure of Rowallan
2 _MARNM Mure of Rowallan
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 1460
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD MURE OF ROWALLAN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir William Mure of Rowallan, the author of the Historie of the House of Rowallane, says this of him: "Archibald succeided to Sir Adame his fayr." [https://archive.org/stream/historiedescento1825mure#page/69/mode/1up Historie, 
2 CONC page 69] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been satisfactorily established for Archibald Mure of Rowallan. Sir William Mure of Rowallan, says this of him: "He died in battell against Ingland 1426." However, another William Mure, the 182
2 CONC 5 editor of the Historie, cast doubt upon this and suggested that the battle alluded to might have been [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Sark the Battle of Sark], which took place on 23 October 1488. [https://archive.org/s
2 CONC tream/historiedescento1825mure#page/70/mode/1up Historie, page 70] Here it should be noted that the Sark referred to is not Sark in the Channel Islands. It is a river in Dumfriesshire. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Sark Riv
2 CONC er Sark]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Concerning the actual date of his death, all that can presently be said is this. Archibald Mure of Rowallan was followed by Robert Mure of Rowallan. In 1460 Robert had a precept of sasine for Rowallan in the Sheriffdom of Ayr f
2 CONC rom the chancery of James III, King of Scots. It seems quite likely, therefore, probable even, that Archibald Mure of Rowallan died in or before 1460. [https://archive.org/stream/exchequerrollsof09scot#page/667/mode/1up The Excheq
2 CONC uer Rolls of Scotland, Volume IX, A.D. 1480-1497, p. 667]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Archibald Mure of Rowallan married Euphame Kennedy, daughter of the knight of Dunure, ancestor of the marquis of Ailsa, and had a son, named Robert.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Accounts===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/historieanddesc00muirgoog#page/n7/mode/1up The Historie and Descent of the House of Rowallane, 141 pp.]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Note by HRH Prince Kieren de Muire Von Drakenberg===
2 CONT
2 CONT This Archibald married Isabel/Isabella Montgomery. He is the son of another Archibald Muir (son of Adam Muir & Joanna (Janet) Danzielstoun) who was married to Euphemia Kennedy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=treeforhertosee&id=I7587 Kidder and Winchcomb Family Tree]
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Archibald MURE
2 CONT Sex: M
2 CONT Birth: 1385 in Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland Death: OCT 1448 in Battle of Sark, Dumfries-shire, Scotland Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg2552.htm#54289
2 CONT
