2 CONT
2 CONT     Isabel MONTGOMERY [Parents] 1 was born 1395 in Eaglesham, Renfrewshire, Scotland. She married Archibald MURE on 1415 in Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT     They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     M i Robert MURE was born 1425 and died 1504.
