2 CONT Father	Sir Archibald Douglas, 4th Earl Douglas, Duke of Touraine, Lord of Galloway & Wigtoun3,4 b. c 1375, d. 17 Aug 1424 Mother	Margaret Stewart3,4 d. bt Jan 1450 - Sep 1456
2 CONT
2 CONT      Mary Douglas married Sir Simon de Glendonwyn, son of Sir Adam de Glendonwyn and Margaret de Wauchope, circa 1407; They had 3 sons (Sir Simon; John; & Bartholomew) & 2 daughters (Janet, wife of Gilbert Grierson of Lag; & Hawis
2 CONC e).1,2
