1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Only daughter of George Douglas, 1st Earl of Angus (1370-1402) by Princess Mary (d. before 1458), daughter of Robert III, King of Scots.
2 CONT
2 CONT Widow of 1st Lord Forbes
