2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Lady Elizabeth Douglas:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10823.htm#i108221
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Douglas [1]
2 CONT *F, #108221
2 CONT *Last Edited=8 May 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.07%
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Elizabeth Douglas married, firstly, Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes, son of Sir John Forbes of that Ilk and Elizabeth Kennedy, between 6 October 1423 and 16 October 1423.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Sir David Hay of Lochorwart and Yester, son of Sir William Hay of Lochorwart and Yester and Alice de la Haye, after 1423.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of George Douglas, 1st Earl of Angus and Lady Mary Stewart.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From between 6 October 1423 and 16 October 1423, her married name became Forbes.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From after 1423, her married name became Hay.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Sir David Hay of Lochorwart and Yester
2 CONT *1. John Hay, 1st Lord Hay of Yester+4 d. bt Sep 1508 - 23 Oct 1508
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Elizabeth Douglas and Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes
2 CONT *1. Annabella Forbes+5
2 CONT *2. James Forbes, 2nd Lord Forbes+ d. bt 20 Sep 1460 - 30 Jul 1462
2 CONT *3. William Forbes5
2 CONT *4. Margaret Forbes5
2 CONT *5. Elizabeth Forbes5
2 CONT *6. Susanna Forbes+6 b. c 1423
