1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == SIR WILLIAM EDMONSTONE OF DUNTREATH ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir William Edmonstone of Duntreath is reported to have died in 1486. He cerainly died before 20 April 1487, the date upon which his son, Sir Archibald Edmonstone of Duntreath, was served heir to his deceased father. [https://a
2 CONC rchive.org/stream/genealogicalacco00inedmo#page/33/mode/1up Duntreath: 33]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/parishofstrathbl00smit#page/102/mode/1up John Guthrie Smith, FSA (Scot).,The Parish of Strathblane and its Inhabitants from Early Times : A Chapter of Lennox History (Glasgow : James Maclehose and 
2 CONC Sons, Publishers to the University, 1886), pp. 102-24]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ee/edmonstone1.php Stirnet: Edmonstone 1]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ee/edmonstone2.php Stirnet: Edmonstone 2]'''
