2 CONC 000000019873608068?through=6000000017346584085 ELLEN Campbell], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Archibald-Campbell/6000000159189069821?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1603741541010&through=6000000159189099835 ARCHIBALD [Gillespi
2 CONC e] Campbell] & his [second] wife [Isabel Lamont] (-after 1434).  She married secondly Duncan Earl of Lennox. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lord John & his second wife had eight children:
2 CONT >>>>>*b)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Donald-MacDonald-of-Harlaw-8th-Lord-of-the-Isles/6000000006727944691?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1603741770249&through=6000000012767608632 DONALD Macdonald] (-Ardtornish, Morven [1423][13
2 CONC 93]).  He succeeded his father in 1387 as Lord of the Isles.  He claimed the Earldom of Ross, de iure uxoris, and fought the battle of Harlaw in 1411 to enforce his rights.  m [https://www.geni.com/people/Mariota-Leslie-Countess-o
2 CONC f-Ross/6000000008239612705?through=6000000006727944691 MARY Leslie Ctss of Ross], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Walter-Leslie-Seventh-Earl-of-Ross/6000000003774828404?through=6000000008239612705 WALTER Leslie] & his wif
2 CONC e [https://www.geni.com/people/Euphemia-I-Countess-of-Ross/6000000002408076362?through=6000000003774828404 Eupheme Ctss of Ross] (-[1435]).  Donald & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT >>>>>>*i)          [https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-MacDonald-9th-Lord-of-the-Isles-12th-Earl-of-Ross/6000000006444398981?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1603741770249&through=6000000006727944691 ALEXANDER Macdonald] (-May 1449).  
2 CONC He succeeded his father as Lord of the Isles, and his mother as Earl of Ross. 
