1 NOTE Some sources show her as daughter of Malcolm 5th Earl of Lennox but given the dates I have gone with the suggestion of Jim Weber below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Post-em from Jim Weber
2 CONT
2 CONT "Even though you have sources, for the parents of "Miss" Lennox, by my reckoning she was born too late to be daughter of Malcolm, the 5th Earl (d. 19 Jul 1333).  I estimate her birth year to be 1370-90. 
2 CONT
2 CONT My current favorite, as a candidate is Margaret Lennox, 2nd daughter of Duncan, the 8th Earl.  According to CP VII:593, she m. bef. 25 July 1392 Robert Menteith of Rusky, who was dead in 1411.  CP doesn't mention any subsequent hu
2 CONC sband, but she died "bef 1456", which leaves a lot of room for a 2nd marriage.  My estimated date of Alisdair's daughter who m. James Stewart is 1411-15, which would fit nicely with Menteith's death as 1st husband in 1411."
1 NOTE There is no direct proof of the identity of Margaret, wife of
2 CONT Alisdair Mac Donald; the following explains her identification:
2 CONT Hamish Maclaren, World Connectdb=maclaren, rootsweb.com, has a source
2 CONT (whi ch I have not read, but accept on faith), that states that
2 CONT Alisdair's wi fe was the daughter of the Earl of Lennox, whom I named
2 CONT "Miss Lennox". Ham ish has done extensive research, especially
2 CONT onpeople of Scotland, but he h ad her father as Malcolm, the 5th Earl
2 CONT of Lennox, who I thought to have li ved too early to be Miss Lennox's
2 CONT father.  I found information on Margar et Lennox in the Complete
2 CONT Peerage, which would fits the timeline requireme nts for Hamish
2 CONT Maclaren's Miss Lennox to a tee.  In fact, given that Alisd air
2 CONT married a daughter of the Earl of Lennox, I believe that Margaret ist
2 CONT he only viable candidate available.  I give below the entry from the
2 CONT Compl etePeerage for Margaret, as well as my post-em/e-mail
2 CONT communication with H amish Maclaren.
2 CONT Note that there is a consanguinity problem in the next generation, as
2 CONT th ey are 1st cousins, but that type of problem would be caused by any
2 CONT daught er of the Earl of Lennox, and not because she is identified as
2 CONT Margaret.
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT Margaret m. before 25 July 1392, Robert Menteith of Rusky (dead 1411),
2 CONT a nd was living 18 May 1451, but probably dead in 1453.  She had issue
2 CONT by Ro bert, Sir Murdoch Menteith, who d. before 1456.  Sir Murdoch has
2 CONT ason Patr ick, who d. young and unmarried, and two daughters: Agnes,
2 CONT who m. about 14 60 Sir John Haldane of Gleneagles, and Elizabeth, who
2 CONT m. John Napier, s on and heir apparent of Sir Alexander Napier of
2 CONT Merchiston, Knight.  [Comp lete Peerage VII:593-4]
2 CONT See also notes from CP under sister Elizabeth about heirs andrelative
2 CONT ord er of birth.
2 CONT ------------------------
2 CONT Below are my post-em and response from Hamish Maclaren:
2 CONT Hello
2 CONT Sorry for the delay in replying to you, I am afraid that towards the e
2 CONT nd of November my computer died (with a loudcrack and smoke) and even
2 CONT t he hard drive was not recoverable. I then left townfor a month over
2 CONT the ho lidays, but I am now back and last week got a new computer. So
2 CONT I can final ly start reply too the 40 or more family tree e mails I
2 CONT havereceived and w ill be correcting and adding to the family tree
2 CONT file. I should have a new/ improved version on the web in a week or
2 CONT two.
2 CONT I have looked at what you suggest and at page 593 under "Lennox" in
2 CONT The C omplete Peerage, by G E Cokayne  and I think you have a good
2 CONT point so I wi ll change her father as you suggested.
2 CONT Thanks for the help
2 CONT Hamish Maclaren
2 CONT maclaren@earthlink.net
2 CONT -----Original Message-----
2 CONT To: maclaren@earthlink.net
2 CONT Subject: WorldConnect: Post-em posted
2 CONT Database: maclaren
2 CONT Individual: I26902
2 CONT Name: Jim Weber
2 CONT Email: jimweber@nwintl.com
2 CONT Even though you have sources, for the parents of "Miss" Lennox, by my
2 CONT reck oning she was born too late to be daughter of Malcolm, the 5th
2 CONT Earl ( d. 19 Jul 1333).  I estimate her birth year to be 1370-90.
2 CONT My current favorite, as a candidate is Margaret Lennox, 2nd daughter
2 CONT of Du ncan, the 8th Earl.  According to CP VII:593, she m. bef. 25
2 CONT July 1392 Rob ert Menteith of Rusky, who was dead in 1411.  CP doesn't
2 CONT mention any subse quent husband, but she died "bef 1453", which leaves
2 CONT a lot of room for a 2 nd marriage.  My estimated date of Alisdair's
2 CONT daughter who m. James Stewa rt is 1411-15, which would fit nicely with
2 CONT Menteith's death as 1st husba nd in 1411.
2 CONT Do you have any thoughts orfurther sources on this matter?
