2 CONT >ROBERT SUTHERLAND, 6th Earl of Sutherland; born c 1347; married 1389 Margaret, illegitimate daughter of Sir Alexander Stewart (‘The Wolf of Badenoch'), 1st Earl of Buchan of the c 1382 created(and 4th s of ROBERT II), apparently 
2 CONC by Mariot Athyn, and died by 1427, leaving: ''see doc.''
2 CONT
