2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert of the Haye [1]
2 CONT *M, #211328, 
2 CONT *d. 7 September 1436
2 CONT *Last Edited=31 Mar 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert of the Haye was the son of Sir William de la Haye, 1st Lord Hay and Margaret Gray.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Alice Hay, daughter of Sir William Hay of Lochorwart and Yester and Alice de la Haye.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 7 September 1436.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1424 he was hostage in England for King James I's ransom.2
