1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=REG&db=namegame&id=I6302
2 CONT
2 CONT From [http://www.thepeerage.com/p483.htm#i4825 The Peerage]:
2 CONT
2 CONT Janet Hay was the daughter of Sir William Hay of Lochorwart and Yester and Alice de la Haye.  She married Sir Alexander Home of Home and Dunglas, son of Sir Thomas Home of that Ilk and Nicole Papedy.1 She was also known as Jean.1 
2 CONC Her married name became Home.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Janet Hay and Sir Alexander Home of Home and Dunglas 1. Helen Home+1 d. a 1512 2. Thomas Home1 d. a 20 Jun 1443 3. George Home1 4. Alexander Home, 1st Lord Home+1 b. c 1403, d. bt Feb 1490 - Apr 1491
2 CONT
