2 CONT Janet Hay Home
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT 1392
2 CONT Gorebridge, Midlothian, Scotland
2 CONT Death
2 CONT 17 Aug 1424 (aged 31–32)
2 CONT Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT When Janet Hay was born in 1392 in Lochorwart Castle, Gorebridge, Midlothian, Scotland, her father, William, was 12, and her mother, Alice, was 10. She had one son with Alexander Home in 1407. She died as a young mother on August 
2 CONC 17, 1424, in Scotland at the age of 32.
