1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Alice Hay:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p21310.htm#i213099
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice Hay [1]
2 CONT *F, #213099
2 CONT *Last Edited=23 Nov 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice Hay is the daughter of Sir William Hay of Lochorwart and Yester and Alice de la Haye.[2],[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, Gilbert of the Haye, son of Sir William de la Haye, 1st Lord Hay and Margaret Gray.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, George Dunbar, 10th Earl of Dunbar, son of George Dunbar, 9th Earl of Dunbar and Christian de Seton, on 7 August 1421, although this marriage may not have occured at all.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Haye.[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From 7 August 1421, her married name became Dunbar.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Alice Hay and Gilbert of the Haye
2 CONT *1. William Hay, 1st Earl of Erroll+[1] d. 15 Nov 1461
2 CONT *2. Gilbert Hay [2] d. c 12 Sep 1487
2 CONT
