1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''detached as wife from her brother https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-William-Oliphant-of-Aberdalgie/6000000002188050535 on July 15, 2025
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT also seen as '''Marion Oliphant
2 CONT
2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT ==Marion (Mariot) Oliphant==
2 CONT * Father 	John Oliphant, of Aberdalgie 
2 CONT * Mother 	dau. Borthwick (1st wife)
2 CONT * Living on 24 Feb 1446 ? (named in charter with her sons of the lands at Cessford)
2 CONT * married: in 1399 to Robert Graham, of Kilpont 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT *  	1. Robert Graham, of Cessfurd
2 CONT *  	2. Walter Graham
2 CONT *  	3. Patrick Graham
2 CONT *  	4. Umfrid Graham
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Mariota Oliphant was born at of Aberdalgy, Scotland. A contract for the marriage of Mariota Oliphant and Sir William Graham, Lord Graham was signed in 1399.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is a charter by Sir James Hamilton of Cadzow to Marion Oliphant, and her sons Robert, Walter, Patrick, and Umfrid Grahame, of the lands of Cessford, on 24 February 1446-47.  TSP, (6-215) 
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft#page/216/mode/2up/search/Oliphant The Scots Peerage] Page 217:
2 CONT
2 CONT >"He (Graham, Duke of Montrose) married first, in his father's lifetime, a lady whose name in not certainly known ... There is probably confusion with the wife of his brother Robert."
2 CONT
2 CONT From [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft#page/214/mode/2up The Scots Peerage]: Page 214:
2 CONT
2 CONT >" .. An indenture of the date 1399 between Sir Patrick Grahame of Kincardine and Sir John Oliphant of Abergaldie that '''Robin de Grahame''' son the said Sir Patrick, shall wed to wyfe, God willand, daughter of the said Sir John.
2 CONC  ..."
2 CONT
