1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JOAN de Menteith (-after 21 Mar 1367).  [95]m firstly ([1323]) as his second wife, MALISE Earl of Strathearn, son of MALISE 6th Earl of Strathearn & his wife Agnes Comyn of Buchan ([1275/80]-before 1329).  [96]m se
2 CONC condly JOHN Campbell Earl of Atholl, son of Sir NEIL Campbell of Lochow & his wife --- ([1305/06] or [1313]-killed in battle Halidon Hill 19 Jul 1333).  [97]m thirdly (dispensation 11 Jul 1339) Sir MAURICE Moray of Drumsargard, so
2 CONC n of Sir JOHN Moray of Drumsagard & his first wife --- (-killed in battle Neville's Cross 17 Oct 1346).  He was created Earl of Strathearn 9 Feb 1344.  [98]m fourthly (post-nuptial dispensation 9 Nov 1347) as his second wife, WILL
2 CONC IAM Sutherland 5th Earl of Sutherland, son of KENNETH Sutherland 4th Earl of Sutherland & his wife [Mary or Marjorie of Atholl] (-before 19 Jun 1371).
2 CONT
