2 CONT John Gordon, Lord Gordon [1]
2 CONT *M, #108314, 
2 CONT *d. 1517
2 CONT *Last Edited=25 Apr 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.78%
2 CONT
2 CONT John Gordon, Lord Gordon married Margaret Stewart, daughter of James IV Stewart, King of Scotland and Margaret Drummond, in November 1512.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1517.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Alexander Gordon, 3rd Earl of Huntly and Lady Jean Stewart.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was styled as Lord Gordon in 1501.[1]
2 CONT
