2 CONC e of Scotland married Margaret Houston after 1497. Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray, Sheriff of Forfar, Justice of Scotland married Elizabeth Hay''', daughter of Sir William Hay, 1st Earl of Erroll, 2nd Lord Hay, Constable of Scotland a
2 CONC nd Beatrix Douglas, '''after 8 June 1501 at Perth, Perthshire, Scotland; As his 4th wife and her 2nd husband.8,2,3,5,6 Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray, Sheriff of Forfar, Justice of Scotland died in February 1514.2,3,5,6
