2 CONT *'''Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray1
2 CONT *'''M, #19658, d. February 1513/14
2 CONT *Last Edited=4 Feb 2016
2 CONT *'''     Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray was the son''' of Patrick Gray, Master of Gray and Annabella Forbes.2 '''He married, firstly, Janet Keith''', daughter of Sir Robert de Keith and Janet Seton, '''circa March 1463/64.2 He married
2 CONC , secondly, Lady Elizabeth Stewart''', daughter of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl and Lady Eleanor Sinclair, '''before 1483.2 He married, thirdly, Margaret Houston after 1497.2 He married, fourthly, Lady Elizabeth Hay''', daught
2 CONC er of William Hay, 1st Earl of Erroll and Lady Beatrix Douglas.2 '''He died in February 1513/14.2
2 CONT *'''     He succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Gray [S., 1445] circa 1469.2 He held the office of Hereditary Sheriff of Forfar in 1488.2 He took part in the rebellion by King James IV against his father, King James III.2 He held t
2 CONC he office of Justiciary General North of Forth in 1489.2 He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland].2 He held the office of Justiciary General South of Forth in 1506.2
2 CONT *'''Children of Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray
2 CONT **Isobel Gray+3
2 CONT **Marjorie Gray+4
2 CONT *'''Child of Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray and Lady Elizabeth Stewart
