2 CONT *'Stewart19'
2 CONT *Sir John Stewart of Balveny, 1st Earl of Atholl (b c1440, d 19.09.1512)
2 CONT *The attribution of his children between his wives is not certain. TSP(Atholl) does not even try to say which child was by which wife but BE1883 does give a lead. However, with TSP naming more daughters than BE1883, with some name
2 CONC s being duplicated, some doubt remains on this matter which may be researched further in due course.
2 CONT *m1. (1460) Margaret Douglas (b 1430, d before 1475, dau of Archibald, 5th Earl of Douglas)
2 CONT **1. Janet Stewart (d 27.10.1510)
2 CONT **m. Alexander Gordon, 3rd Earl of Huntly (d 16.01.1524)
2 CONT **'''2. Elizabeth Stewart 
2 CONT **'''m. Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray''' (d 1514)
2 CONT *m2. (before 1475) Eleanor Sinclair (dau of William Sinclair, 3rd Earl of Orkney, Earl of Caithness)
2 CONT **3. John Stewart, 2nd Earl of Atholl (d by 1522)
2 CONT **m. Janet Campbell (d c02.02.1545-6, dau of Archibald Campbell, 2nd Earl of Argyll)
2 CONT ***A. .... etc.
2 CONT **4. Andrew Stewart (d 1542, Bishop of Caithness)
2 CONT **5. Jean Stewart
2 CONT **m. John Gordon of Pitlurg (d 1546)
2 CONT **6. Catherine Stewart
