2 CONT **7. Elspeth Stewart
2 CONT **m. (c1510) Robert Innes, 2nd of Innermarkie (d c10.1551)
2 CONT **8. Marjory Stewart
2 CONT **m. Sir Colin Campbell, 3rd of Glenorchy (d 12.08.1523)
2 CONT **9. Margaret Stewart
2 CONT **m. Sir William Murray of Castleton (dvp Flodden 09.09.1513)
2 CONT **10. Isabel (or Elizabeth) Stewart
