1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====WIKITREE:  [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Forbes-185 John Forbes Sixth Lord Forbes (abt. 1472–1547)]
2 CONT * '''Born''' about 1472 in Forbes, Aberdeenshire, Scotland
2 CONT * BIO: John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes was born before 1477.2 He was the son of William Forbes, 3rd Lord Forbes and Lady Christian Gordon.3 He married, firstly, Lady Catherine Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl and
2 CONC  Lady Margaret Douglas.3 He married, secondly, Christian Lundie, daughter of Sir John Lundie of that Ilk and Elizabeth Forrester, before 26 February 1509/10.3 He married, thirdly, Elizabeth Barlow before 29 July 1515.1 He died in 
2 CONC 1547.2
2 CONT * He succeeded as the 6th Lord Forbes [S., 1445] in 1493.1
2 CONT * Children of John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes and Lady Catherine Stewart
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Forbes+
2 CONT ** James Forbes3
2 CONT * Children of John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes and Christian Lundie
2 CONT ** William Forbes, 7th Lord Forbes+3 d. 1593
2 CONT ** Marjory Forbes+4
2 CONT ** Elizabeth Forbes+4 d. Dec 1570
2 CONT ** John Forbes, Master of Forbes3 d. 17 Jul 1537
2 CONT ** Margaret Forbes3
2 CONT * Children of John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes and Elizabeth Barlow
2 CONT ** Arthur Forbes of Putachie3 d. Oct 1571
2 CONT ** Jean Forbes+1 b. b 1519, d. a 20 Nov 1554
2 CONT * '''Footnotes'''
2 CONT ** [1] G.E. Cokayne; with..., eds, ''The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinct or Dormant''. Gloucester, UK: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), Vol. I, p. 313.
2 CONT ** [2] Cokayne, and others, ''The Complete Peerage'', volume V, page 545.
2 CONT ** [3] ''BP''2003 volume 1, page 1451. See link for full details for this source. 
2 CONT ** [4] ''BP''2003.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====BOOK
2 CONT * ''Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of Peerage, Baronetage and Knightage.'' [https://www.google.com/books/edition/Burke_s_Genealogical_and_Heraldic_Histor/RVggAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%22John,%206th%20Lord%20Forbes,%20m
2 CONC .%201st,%20Katherine%22 '''p. 801''']:
2 CONT ** '''JOHN, 6th Lord Forbes, ''m''. 1st''', Katherine, dau. of John Stewart, Earl of Atholl, by whom he had a dau.,
2 CONT *** 1. '''Elizabeth ''', ''m''. John Grant, of Grant
2 CONT ** '''He ''m, 2ndly'',''' Christian, dau. of Sir John Lundin, of that Ilk, by whom he had,
2 CONT *** 1. [2] '''John, master of Forbes''', executed 17 July, 1537, for an alleged conspiracy against the life of JAMES V., ''s.p.''
2 CONT *** 2. [3] '''WILLIAM, 7th lord'''.
2 CONT *** 2. [4] '''Margaret''', ''m''. Andrew Fraser, of Muchal.
2 CONT *** 3. [5] '''Elizabeth''', ''m''. 1st, Gilbert Keith of Troup; and 2ndly, Alexander Innes, of Innea.
2 CONT *** 4. [6] '''Marjory''', ''m''. Alexander Forbes, of Brux.
2 CONT ** '''He ''m''. 3rdly,''' Elizabeth Berlay, widow of Alexander, 1st Lord Elphinstone, by whom he had
2 CONT *** 5. [7] '''Arthur, of Putachie''', killed in battled, 1572
2 CONT *** 6. [8] '''Janet''', ''m''. 1st, John, 3rd Earl of Atholl; 2ndly, Alexander Hay, of Daigety; 3rdly, William Leslie, of Halquhain.
2 CONT ** '''He was ''s''. by his son,…'''
2 CONT
