2 CONT ----
2 CONT === Alexander Kennedy, 4th of Bargany
2 CONT * Born: Abt 1491 	Bargany, Dailly, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT * Died: 1551
2 CONT * Parents: 	Thomas Kennedy, 3rd of Bargany and	Katherine Kennedy.  Married	15 Sep 1465 or 1485  [1, 3] 
2 CONT * Spouse: Mariot or Marion Dunbar  (b. Bef 1495, Mochrum, Wigtownshire, Scotland, daughter of 	Sir John Dunbar, of Mochrum and Janet Stewart) - married about 1512
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT * 	1. Thomas Kennedy, 5th of Bargany,   d. 1572, or perhaps aft 1587.  Married 1) Margaret Campbell 2) daughter of Gilbert Kennedy, 2nd Earl of Cassillis
2 CONT * 	2. Gilbert Kennedy, of Bargany or Kirkhill,   d. ? 1601.  Wife unknown, with issue.
2 CONT * 	3. Margaret Kennedy,   b. 1517, Bargany, Dailly, Ayrshire, Scotland  d. 12 Jan 1597, Edinburgh  (Age 80 years) AKA Margery Sophia Kennedy.  Married 1) Sir William Wallace, 12th of Craigie 2) Gilbert Kennedy, 3rd Earl of Cassill
2 CONC is, Lord Treasurer of Scotland
2 CONT * 	4. Elizabeth Kennedy.  Married 	Hugh Kennedy, of Culzean.
2 CONT * 	5. Janet Kennedy.  Married 	Sir John Mure, of Caldwel
2 CONT
