1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://books.google.com/books?id=YbrgAAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA237&ots=HR5sMVA8gP&dq=John%20Forbes%20of%20brux%20the%20white%20laird&pg=PA237#v=onepage&q=John%20Forbes%20of%20brux%20the%20white%20laird&f=false Publicati
2 CONC ons, Volume 34] By Scottish History Society.  Page 237
2 CONT
2 CONT John Forbes with the sleick hair, called the whyt Laird, married Elizabeth Gordon, daughter to Alex. Gordon of Cairnburrow, and got on her 4 daughters ; '''one''' married on Wm. Forbes of Davan; the 2d on John Forbes of Cluny; the
2 CONC  3d on Wm. Forbes of Terpersie; the fourth on Syinon Grant; which daughters should have succeeded to the Laird of Brux but were put by.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband:	
2 CONT # William Forbes of Daatch Children:	
2 CONT # Alexander Forbes of Newe
