2 CONC Forbes of Pitsligo married the Lord Ogilvie's daughter, who did bear to him John [sic: Alexander in TSP] Forbes of Pitsligo, and ane oy'r. called Wm. of Daach, who was predecessor of the houss of Newe. Wm. Forbes of Daach, brother
2 CONC  to John Forbes of Pitsligo, married Forbes, daughter to the whit Laird of Brux, who did bear to him Alex. Forbes of New, and John Forbes of Sinshannie."
