1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT Robert Gordon, 3rd of Auchleuchries and 1st of Pitlurg was the son of John Gordon, 2nd of Auchleuchries and Margaret Forbes.1  He died in 1546.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He is also called V. John Gordon of Auchleuchry, Lungar, Kinmundie, &c.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lady Jean Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl and Lady Eleanor Sinclair.1
2 CONT
2 CONT John Gordon married secondly, Margaret Drummond, of the family of Stobhall, without issue (she married after her husband's death George Baird of Auchmedden).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Robert Gordon, 3rd of Auchleuchries and 1st of Pitlurg and Lady Jean Stewart
2 CONT # John Gordon, 4th of Auchieuchries, 2nd of Pitlurg+1 d. 10 Sep 1547.  Married Janet Ogilvy of Cullen.
2 CONT # James Gordon, 5th of Auchleuchries; eceived a grant of Auchleuchries from his brother in 1546.  Had issue.
2 CONT # A daughter, who married Turing of Foveran.
2 CONT
2 CONT
