2 CONT # THE GORDONS OF PITLURG AND THE DESCENDANTS OF THOMAS GORDON who came +o America in 1684 and settled in Perth Amboy, New Jersey.  By FRANKLIN S. GORDON (1941).  Book page 11 (PDF page 13 of 160).  < [https://www.seekingmyroots.co
2 CONC m/members/files/G002879.pdf PDF] >   JOHN GORDON 2ND LAIRD OF PITLURG Married Lady Jean Stewart, daughter of John, first Earl of Athol half brother to King James II, and granddaughter to Queen Jane Beaufort by her second marriage 
2 CONC with Sir James Stewart "the black Knight of Lorne" with whom he begot a son John 3rd Laird of Pitlurg. He was killed at the battle of Pinkey.
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun01pauluoft#page/466/mode/2up The Scots Peerage vol 1 page 442] 
2 CONT #http://www.patrickspeople.co.uk/ourfamily/3087.htm
