2 CONT
2 CONT He died in infancy, shortly before his father's death
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the second child of Robert the Bruce and his second wife, Elizabeth de Burgh.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Bruce, the son of Robert the Bruce and Elizabeth de Burgh, is buried at Restennet Priory in Restennet, Angus, Scotland. 
