2 CONT **Sir Robert I de Brus, King of Scotland, Earl of Carrick, Lord of Annandale+2,4 b. 11 Jul 1274, d. 7 Jun 1329
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S248] Unknown author, The Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles, by Gerald Paget, Vol. 1, p. 156.
2 CONT * 2.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 520-521.
2 CONT * 3.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. IV, p. 592.
2 CONT * 4.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. I, p. 595-597.
2 CONT * 5.[S11564] The Scots Peerage, Vol. II, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 426.
