2 CONC , firstly, Adam de Kilconquhar, Earl of Carrick before 4 October 1266.1 She married, secondly, Sir Robert le Brus, 1st Lord Brus, son of Sir Robert de Brus, Lord of Annandale and Isabella de Clare, in 1271 at Turnberry Castle, Tur
2 CONC nberry, Ayrshire, Scotland, without Royal consent, and so she had to pay a heavy fine.2 She died before 9 November 1292.1 • She was also known as Marjorie. She succeeded to the title of 3rd Countess of Carrick [S., c. 1186] in 125
