2 CONT From an unidentified source: "Walter Oliphant of Aberdalgie and Kellie, son of the last, married Mary, daughter of Sir Robert Erskine of that Ilk, by whom he had John and Malcolm. In 1368 he was Keeper of Stirling Castle, and in 1
2 CONC 378 he has a charter of Kelly and Pitkiery, on the resignation of his father. (1)"
2 CONT
