1 NOTE Sir David Wemyss of Wemyss; of age by 1290; married 1st AnnabellaSinclair, widow of Sir Robert Bisset; married 2nd by 1304 Marjory,daughter of Walter Ramsay, and died by 1332, leaving presumably by her.[Burke's Peerage]
