2 CONT
2 CONT "Sir Patrick Gray his eldest Son, in the Life-time of his Father, was Gentleman of the Bed-chamber to, and a great Favourite to King James II. He married first Margaret, Daugh|ter of Sir Malcolm Fleeming, Lord of Biggar, by whom h
2 CONC e had no Issue, and thereafter Annabella, Daughter of Sir Alexander Forbes, Lord of Forbes, by whom he had Andrew his Grand|father's Successor; and Three Daugh|ters. 1st Elizabeth married to Sir David Rollo of Ballachie and Manmor
2 CONC e, 2d . . . to Andrew Monorgund of That-Ilk, 3d . . . . . to . . . . Coless of Bonymoon: He died before his Father in 1462."
2 CONT
2 CONT From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Patrick Gray, Master of Gray:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p2822.htm#i28220
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Gray, Master of Gray
2 CONT *M, #28220, 
2 CONT *d. between 23 August 1463 and September 1464
2 CONT *Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Gray, Master of Gray married, firstly, Margaret Fleming, daughter of Sir Malcolm Fleming of Biggar and Cumbernauld and Elizabeth Stewart, before 7 February 1439/40.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Annabella Forbes, daughter of Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes and Lady Elizabeth Douglas, before 1445.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died between 23 August 1463 and September 1464.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Andrew Gray, 1st Lord Gray and Elizabeth Wemyss. He was styled as Master of Gray.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Patrick Gray, Master of Gray and Annabella Forbes
2 CONT *1. Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray+[1] d. Feb 1513/14
2 CONT *2. Janet Gray [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 1642. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Patrick Gray, Master of Gray M, #28220, d. between 23 August 1463 and September 1464
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Gray, Master of Gray|d. bt 23 Aug 1463 - Sep 1464|p2822.htm#i28220|Andrew Gray, 1st Lord Gray|b. c 1390\nd. c 1469|p2408.htm#i24078|Elizabeth Wemyss|d. a 15 May 1470|p21323.htm#i213227|Sir Andrew Gray of Broxmouth|d. 1441|
2 CONC p22470.htm#i224700|Janet Mortimer||p22471.htm#i224703|Sir John Wemyss||p21323.htm#i213228||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT      Patrick Gray, Master of Gray was the son of Andrew Gray, 1st Lord Gray and Elizabeth Wemyss. He married, firstly, Margaret Fleming, daughter of Sir Malcolm Fleming of Biggar and Cumbernauld and Elizabeth Stewart, before 7 Feb
2 CONC ruary 1439/40.1 He married, secondly, Annabella Forbes, daughter of Alexander Forbes, 1st Lord Forbes and Lady Elizabeth Douglas, before 1445.1 He died between 23 August 1463 and September 1464.1
2 CONT      Patrick Gray, Master of Gray was styled as Master of Gray.1 Children of Patrick Gray, Master of Gray and Annabella Forbes 1.Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray+1 d. Feb 1513/14 2.Janet Gray1 Citations 1.[S37] Charles Mosley, editor, B
