2 CONC istory of an Ordinary American Family (Google eBook) Jodie K. Scales. iUniverse, Jun 3, 2001 - History.  Page 587.  "Grisel Wemyss married David Boswell of Glassmouth, son and heir of David Boswell of Balmuto, reuniting the third 
2 CONC line of the separated lines established by the three original co heiresses of Wemyss.
