2 CONT Euphemia Wemyss was contracted to marry William Livingston of Drumry on 19 November 1428, but according to Sir James Balfour Paul, "It is doubtful if the marriage ever took place". [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pau
2 CONC l#page/369/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, viii, p.36 9] Sir James Balfour Paul cites Family of Wemyss, i, 74. in support of this view. [https://archive.org/stream/memorialsoffamil01fras#page/145/mode/1up Memoirs of the Family of Wemy
2 CONC ss, i, p.74]
