2 CONT
2 CONT Marion Auchinleck1 F, #402707 Last Edited=6 Jun 2016
2 CONT      Marion Auchinleck is the daughter of Sir John Auchinleck of Glenbervie and Christian Lindsay.2,3 She married, firstly, Sir George Campbell of Loudoun, son of George Campbell of Loudoun and Elizabeth Stewart, in 1484 at Auchin
2 CONC leck, Ayrshire, Scotland.1,3 She married, secondly, William Cuninghame, 1st of Craigends, son of Alexander Cuninghame, 1st Earl of Glencairn and Margaret Hepburn, on 12 March 1497/98.1 She married John Campbell, son of George Camp
2 CONC bell of Loudoun and Elizabeth Stewart, circa 1499.3
2 CONT      From 1484, her married name became Campbell.1 From 12 March 1497/98, her married name became Cuninghame. From circa 1499, her married name became Campbell.3 Children of Marion Auchinleck and William Cuninghame, 1st of Craigen
2 CONC ds
2 CONT
2 CONT     David Cuninghame, 1st of Robertland+2 d. b 16 Jan 1543/44
