2 CONT http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p99.htm#i2969
2 CONT *George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife1
2 CONT *M, d. 28 November 1558
2 CONT *Father William Leslie, 3rd Earl of Rothes d. 9 Sep 1513 
2 CONT *Mother Margaret Balfour 
2 CONT *     George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Christian Wood. George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Margaret Crichton, daughter of William Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton and Margaret Stewart, b
2 CONC efore 1 April 1517. George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife and Margaret Crichton were divorced on 27 December 1520.2 George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Elizabeth Gray, daughter of Andrew Gray, 2
2 CONC nd Lord Gray, Sheriff of Forfar, Justice of Scotland and Janet Keith, before 5 June 1525.3 George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Agnes Somerville, daughter of Sir John Somerville, 2nd Baron Cambusnethan and Ja
2 CONC net Hepburn, before 29 January 1530. George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Isobel Lundie before 10 April 1543. George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife died on 28 November 1558 at Dieppe, France.
2 CONT *Family 1 Margaret Crichton  
2 CONT *Marriage* He married Margaret Crichton, daughter of William Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton and Margaret Stewart, before 1 April 1517.  
2 CONT *Divorce* George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife and Margaret Crichton were divorced on 27 December 1520.2  
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦Norman Leslie, Master of Rothes d. 1554
2 CONT **◦William Leslie
2 CONT **◦Helen Leslie+4,5 d. 26 Oct 1594
2 CONT **◦Robert Leslie, 1st Laird of Lundrassie d. b 13 Mar 1589
2 CONT **◦Janet Leslie b. c 1522, d. 17 Dec 1591
2 CONT *Family 2 Agnes Somerville  
2 CONT *Marriage George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Agnes Somerville, daughter of Sir John Somerville, 2nd Baron Cambusnethan and Janet Hepburn, before 29 January 1530.  
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **◦Agnes Leslie+6,7 d. a Feb 1594
2 CONT **◦Peter Leslie8 d. a 17 Jan 1559
2 CONT **◦James Leslie8 d. a 1574
2 CONT **◦Euphemia Leslie8 d. Apr 1588
2 CONT **◦Beatrix Leslie8
2 CONT **◦Elizabeth Leslie8 d. a 1557
2 CONT **◦Andrew Leslie, 5th Earl Rothes+ d. 1611
2 CONT *Family 3 Elizabeth Gray d. bt 9 Jan 1526 - Dec 1526 
2 CONT *Marriage* George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, Sheriff of Fife married Elizabeth Gray, daughter of Andrew Gray, 2nd Lord Gray, Sheriff of Forfar, Justice of Scotland and Janet Keith, before 5 June 1525.3  
2 CONT *Citations
