2 CONT He was Sheriff of Fife from 1529 to 1540 and a Lord of Session from 1541 and a Lord of the Articles from 1544.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT George "4th Earl of Rothes" Leslie Born about 2 Aug 1484 in Rothes, Moray, Scotland map ANCESTORS ancestors Son of William Leslie and Margaret (Balfour) Leslie Brother of John Leslie, James Leslie, Grisel (Leslie) Wardlaw, Unknown
2 CONC  (Rothes) Monypenny and	Isabel Leslie Husband of Margaret (Crichton) Leslie — married before 1 Apr 1517 (to 27 Dec 1520) [location unknown] Husband of Elizabeth (Gray) Leslie — married before 5 Jun 1525 [location unknown] Husband 
2 CONC of Agnes (Somerville) Leslie — married before 29 Jan 1530 (to before 10 Apr 1543) [location unknown] Husband of Isobel (Lundie) Leslie — married 10 Apr 1543 (to before 1550) in Scotlandmap DESCENDANTS descendants Father of Katheri
2 CONC ne Leslie, Margaret Leslie, Helen (Leslie) Kerr, Peter Leslie, Euphemia (Leslie) Cunningham, James Leslie, Janet Leslie, Andrew (Leslie) Leslie Earl of Rothes 5th and Agnes (Leslie) Douglas Died 28 Nov 1558 in Dieppe, Normandie, F
2 CONC rance map
2 CONT
2 CONT Categories: Earl of Rothes | Clan Leslie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clan Leslie tartan. George Leslie is a member of Clan Leslie. Join: Scottish Clans Project Discuss: SCOTTISH_CLANS British Aristocracy George Leslie was a member of aristocracy in the British Isles. Join: British Royals and Aristo
2 CONC crats Project Discuss: BRITISH_ARISTO Biography George Leslie was born at of Rothes, Elginshire, Scotland Abt 1484.[1] His parents were William Leslie, Earl of Rothes and Janet Margaret Balfour. He married Agnes Somerville Bef 29 
2 CONC Jan 1529/30 . Agnes Somerville was born at of Cambusnethan, Scotland Abt 1498 .
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of 3 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Leslie born Abt 1539.
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrew Leslie born 1534.
2 CONT
2 CONT James Leslie born Abt 1545.
2 CONT
2 CONT George Leslie died 28 Nov 1558 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes Somerville died Bef 10 Apr 1543 .
2 CONT
2 CONT George was born about 1500. He passed away in 1558.
2 CONT
