2 CONT
2 CONT '''Andrew Rattray, here treated, is the son of Silvester Rattray and his wife Alison Hepburn. [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/574/mode/1up RSRS 1513-22, p. 574]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On 1 April 1514 he had a precept of sasine for the lands of Balnakerde in the sheriffdom of Perth, and another for part of Wester Wemys in the sheriffdom of Fife. [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/543/mod
2 CONC e/1upRSRS 1513-22, p. 543]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' On 16 May 1515 he had a precept of sasine for one half of the lands of Westhall in the sheriffdom of Perth, as the heir of his deceased father, who had held this land by courtesy in right of Andrew's mother, [https://archive.o
2 CONC rg/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/574/mode/1up RSRS 1513-22, p. 574] and on the same date he had a precept of sasine for the remaining half, as heir of his mother's sister Jonet Haliburton. [https://archive.org/details/rotuli
2 CONC scaccariir14grea/page/574/mode/1up RSRS 1513-22, p. 545]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Liber Responsionum 1 April, Anni imvciv [1514]. Perth. Vicecomes respondebit pro 25 s. de firmis terrarum de BALNAKERDE termini S. Martini ultimo preteriti, existentium in manibus regis sasina non recuperata, que firme se exten
2 CONC dunt annuatim ad 50 s. , et pro 2 d. argenti per duplicationem albefirme earundem, regi debitis per sasinam datam Andree Rettray 1 Ap. a.r.l.. [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/543/mode/1upRSRS 1513-22, p. 5
2 CONC 43]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Liber Responsionum 1 April, Anni imvciv [1514]. Fiffe. Vicecomes respondebit pro 25 s. de firmis decime octave partis terrarum de WEMIS WESTIR cum sale et carbonibus ejusdem termini S. Martini ultimo preteriti existentis in man
2 CONC ibus regis sasiua non recuperata, et pro 50 s. de relevio ejusdem, regi debitis per sasinam datam Andree Rettray de eisdem die mense et anno predictis. [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/544/mode/1up RSRS 151
2 CONC 3-22, p. 543]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Liber Responsionum.16 May [1515]. Edinburgh infra Hadington. Vicecomes respondcbit pro 80 Ii. de firmis dimedietatis terrarum de WESTHALL cum pertinen. jacentis infra balliam suam, existentis in manibus regis per spatium 20 ann
2 CONC orum ult. elaps, ratione warde, que firme se extendunt annuatim ad 4 li. , regi debitis per sasinam datam Andree Rettre per decessum Jonete Haliburtoun, sororis matris sue, de eadem apud Edinburgh 16 Maii a.r.2. [https://archive.o
2 CONC rg/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/574/mode/1up RSRS 1513-22, p. 545]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     4
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Liber Responsionum.16 May [1515]. Edinburgh infra Hadington. Idem vicecomes respondcbit pro 6 It. dc firmis alterius dimedietatis predict, terrarum existcntis in manibus regis per spatium 3 terminorum ult. elaps. sasina non rec
2 CONC uperata, et pro 4 It. de relevio ejusdem dimedietatis, regi debitis per sasinam datam dicto Andree per decessum Silvestri Rettre, sui patris, habentis eandem per curialitatem Scotie ratione Alisone Hepburn, matris ipsius Andree, d
2 CONC e eadem, loco die et anno predictis. [https://archive.org/details/rotuliscaccariir14grea/page/574/mode/1up RSRS 1513-22, p. 574]'''
2 CONT
