2 CONT
2 CONT '''24 June 1541: Charter in favour of Patricio Hepburn and his wife Issobell Liddell. Witnesses: And. Rettray de BALLICARD and others. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi03scot/page/547/mode/1up RMS 1513-46: charter numb
2 CONC er 2389]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    6
2 CONT
2 CONT '''15 August 1601: (80) HENRICUS RATTRAY, heares Andreae Rattray de Balmakard, proavi, - in terris de Balmakaird. A. E. 12s. 6d. N. E, 50 s. ii. 115. [https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=PiVDAAAAcAAJ&pg=PR17&lpg=PR17&dq=Nether+Car
2 CONC myle&source=bl&ots=qkxdEQg71e&sig=HyjCNPSI5Zn-R82Uv3MfsmcM1os&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwivnPu529DTAhWlKsAKHeowAM0Q6AEIRDAG#v=snippet&q=rattray&f=false nquisitionum Ad Capellam Domini Regis Retornatarum, etc. II]'''
