2 CONT '''26 August 1601: (81) HENRICUS RATTRAY, heares Andreae Rattray de Balmakard, proavi, - in terris de Kyncarrochie, in regalitate de Scona in senescallatu de Huntingtour. E. 10 l. 3s. 4d. ii. 115. [https://books.google.co.uk/books
2 CONC ?id=PiVDAAAAcAAJ&pg=PR17&lpg=PR17&dq=Nether+Carmyle&source=bl&ots=qkxdEQg71e&sig=HyjCNPSI5Zn-R82Uv3MfsmcM1os&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwivnPu529DTAhWlKsAKHeowAM0Q6AEIRDAG#v=snippet&q=rattray&f=false nquisitionum Ad Capellam Domini Regi
2 CONC s Retornatarum, etc. II]'''
