2 CONC ere acquired in 1621 from Henry Rattray as heir by progress of the deceased Andrew Rattray of Balnacaird, his grandfather, and the deceased Andrew Rattray of Westhall, his great grandfather. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nr
