2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''22 October 1533: Instrument narrating that Michael Tullo of Hilcarny, sheriff of Perth in that part, compeared in tolbooth of Dundee at instance of procurator for SILVESTER RATTRAY, and produced a commission under quarter seal 
2 CONC for service in favour of SAID SILVESTER AS HEIR OF DECEASED JOHN RATTRAY, HIS FATHER, AND DECEASED JOHN RATTRAY, HIS BROTHER, which commission was read aloud and said procurator required the necessary breives for expeding the serv
2 CONC ice. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD385%2f225&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Craighall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1513&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Rattray Family of Craig
2 CONC hall, Perthshire, reference GD385/225]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
