2 CONC tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Craighall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1513&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Rattray Family of Craighall, Perthshire, reference GD385/225]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     3
