2 CONC ers in barony of Rattray, sheriffdom of Perth, 20 Dec. 1533. HMC 4th report p.536. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD385%2f225&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=rattray&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1
