2 CONC of Perth. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD385%2f226&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Craighall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1513&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Rattray Family of 
