2 CONC erth, 23 July 1479. Notary: Partick Barry, clerk, St Andrews diocese.''' cf https://www.geni.com/people/Silvester-Rattray-10th-of-that-Ilk/6000000011088749879?through=6000000003828323124; https://www.geni.com/people/John-Rattray-1
