1 NAME Elizabeth /Strachan/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Strachan
2 _MARNM Arbuthnot
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1513
2 ADDR
3 CITY Thornton
3 STAE Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 JUL 1542
2 ADDR
3 STAE Scotland
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Stirnet's [http://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4tz/strachan01.php#linklo "Strachan01" page (membership required to view without interruption)]: "mentioned by the [http://www.patrickspeople.co.uk/ patri
2 CONC ckspeople site] but not by ''MGC''"
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Elizabeth married Andrew ARBUTHNOTT 'in Pitcarles', son of Robert ARBUTHNOTT 12th of that Ilk and Mariota SCRIMGEOUR.1 (Andrew ARBUTHNOTT 'in Pitcarles' was born about 1496 and died in August 1570 1.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Andrew, frequently designed as in Pitcarles, a holding on the Arbuthnott estate 'adjacent to the manor place.' On 31 October 1555, he obtained from George Straiton a charter of the lands of Little Fiddes to himself in liferent, a
2 CONC nd Robert his son and apparent heir in fee. He lived, as his son the Principal remarks, in such wise 'ut dubitari potest meliorve an prudentior vir extiterit,' and died August 1570 at the age of seventy-three. His testament was re
2 CONC corded on 16 January 1571. It was at his suggestion, and largely with his aid, that Principal Arbuthnott wrote his account of the family to which reference has already been made. He married Elizabeth Strachan, daughter of Alexande
2 CONC r Strachan of Thornton..."
2 CONT
2 CONT >from ''Scots Peerage (vol 1)'' 1
2 CONT
