2 CONC re 1592 1.)
2 CONT
2 CONT   Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT "The Balbithan MS. says John married the first laird of Lesmoir's daughter. Captain Wimberley, in the Gordons of Lesmoir (p. 17), calls her Marjory. Patrick Grant of Rothiemurcus was surety, March 3, 1592-3, for Marjory Gordon, 'r
2 CONC elict' of John Gordon of Gight, in 500 merks, not to assist the Catholic Earls (Privy Council Register)."
2 CONT
