2 CONT *'''     Walter Barclay, 16th Laird of Towie was born at of Cullen Castle, Auldhaven, Banffshire, Scotland.1 He married Elizabeth (Elspeth) Hay, daughter of William Hay, circa 1553 at of Dalgety, England.1 Walter Barclay, 16th Lai
2 CONC rd of Towie died in 1587 at Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland; Slain.1
