2 CONT *_____________
2 CONT *'''Walter Barclay of Towie1
2 CONT *''' M, #131827, d. before 25 April 1587
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 Oct 2004 
2 CONT *'''     Walter Barclay of Towie was the son of Patrick Barclay of Towie and Janet Ogilvie.1 He married Elizabeth Hay.1 He died before 25 April 1587.1
2 CONT *'''      On 12 April 1559 he was infelt of his lands and barony.1 On 25 April 1569 he signed a bond to King James VI of Scotland.1 On 2 September 1574 he tendered his allegiance.1 In 1577 he was a cautioner for his kinsman Sir Ge
2 CONC orge Barclay of Gartlie.1
