1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Beatrix Seton 
2 CONT * Born: About 1535
2 CONT * Parents: George 6th of that Ilk, 4th Lord Seton (b abt 1507) & Elizabeth Hay
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix married Sir George OGILVY of Dunlugas and Banff, Provost of Banff, son of Sir Walter OGILVY of Dunlugas and Alison HOME, on 24 February 1557.1 (Sir George OGILVY of Dunlugas and Banff, Provost of Banff was born about 1536 
2 CONC and died on 11 August 1621 1.)
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Beatrix Seton and George Ogilvy:
2 CONT # OGILVY, Walter 3rd of Dunlugas and Banff, Provost of Banff+
2 CONT # OGILVY, George 'of Carnowseis', Provost of Banff+
2 CONT # OGILVY, James
2 CONT # OGILVY, Janet+
2 CONT # OGILVY, Robert Burgess of Banff
2 CONT # OGILVY, Elizabeth+
