2 CONT      Walter Ogilvy was the son of unknown Ogilvy.2 He died between 14 February 1627 and 10 May 1628.3
2 CONT      He lived at Dunlugus, Banffshire, ScotlandG.1 He lived at Banff, Banffshire, ScotlandG.1 Children of Walter Ogilvy and Helen Urquhart Sir George Ogilvy, 1st Lord Banff+1 d. 11 Aug 1663 Beatrix Ogilvy+4 Citations [S6] G.E. Cok
