1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04paul/page/25/mode/1up
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Ogilvy of Cardell''' was the son of Alexander Ogilvy, 4th of Deskford and Findlater and Janet Abernethy.2 He died before 29 April 1578.4  He lived at Cardell, Scotland.4
2 CONT
2 CONT He married by contract, firstly, Janet Gordon, daughter of Sir Robert Gordon of Lochinvar.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married by contract, secondly, Marion Livingston, daughter of Alexander Livingston, 5th Lord Livingston and Lady Agnes Douglas, on 30 October 1558.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of James Ogilvy of Cardell
2 CONT # Margaret Ogilvy+3
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of James Ogilvy of Cardell and Janet Gordon
2 CONT # Alexander Ogilvy of Collard+4 d. b 27 Jun 1562
2 CONT
2 CONT There were no surviving children of his 2nd marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
