2 CONT  Archibald Campbell, 2nd of Cawdor was the son of Sir John Campbell, 1st of Cawdor and Muriel Calder. He married Isobel Grant, daughter of James Grant, 3rd of Freuchie and Elizabeth Forbes, in 1543. He died in December 1551.
