2 CONT This profile is part of the Grant Name Study. John Grant, 4th of Freuchie, d. 3 June 1585 John Grant, 4th of Freuchie was the son of James Grant, 3rd of Freuchie and Elizabeth Forbes. He married, firstly, Lady Margaret Stewart, da
2 CONC ughter of John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Atholl and Grizel Rattray, before 19 February 1539. He married, secondly, Lady Janet Leslie, daughter of George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, before 8 March 1557/58. He died on 3 June 1585 Baillie
2 CONC  (steward) Kinloss Abbey.3 On 25 October 1577 he was granted by charter the Parkhill estate, Fifeshire, following its forfeiture by John Leslie. Children of John Grant, 4th of Freuchie and Lady Janet Leslie
2 CONT
2 CONT Donald Grant Helen Grant Children of John Grant, 4th of Freuchie and Lady Margaret Stewart
2 CONT
2 CONT Duncan Grant of Freuchie, younger d. 25 Mar 1582 Patrick Grant Grissel Grant Paterick Grant Elizabeth Grant Margaret Grant Katherine Grant Marjory Grant Janet Grant b. 1535 Barbara Grant b. 1545 Name Name: John "the Gentle" /Grant
