1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "(259) <strong>Sir William Moray of Abercairny</strong>, died 1640. He was served heir to his younger brother, Sir David Moray of Gorthy, 7th April 1629, and married Christian, daughter of Sir Laurence Mercer of Aldie, and had a s
2 CONC on: (260) Sir Robert Moray of Ogilvie"
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://www.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/62/mode/2up Heraldry of the MurraysThe heraldry of the Murrays: with notes on all the males of the family, descriptions of the arms, plates and pedigrees], by G. 
2 CONC Harvey Johnston, 1910, page 63, paragraph 259
