2 CONT
2 CONT http://redbookofscotland.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Tosheoch-of-Monzievaird.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT *1576, Nov. 29: issued a charter of marriage at Monzievaird to Elizabeth,  daughter of William Murray, 1st of Lettirbannochy (RMS 1546-1580, No. 2605)
2 CONT *appears to have been passed over in succession by his brother, Edward, without documented explanation.
2 CONT *1593, June 5: granted in concert with his brother, Edward, a charter of wadset (or mortgage) to William Murray of Ochtertyre for the "sheillings and grazings" of Glenturret, and Kirklands of Meckven.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Granted lands in 1577 by his father who took them back in 1578. Fined in 1613 for harbouring members of the outlawed Clan Gregor.
