2 CONT Name Duncan Robertson, 4th of Auchleeks.
2 CONT He was infeft in the fee of the lands of Dalchalloch and Auchleeks upon his father's resignation on 11 July, 1637. He succeeded to his father?s estate on his death and in which he was infeft on 21 June 1658. He obtained the lands 
2 CONC of Trinafour in which he was infeft on 23 April, 1680.
