2 CONT ------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT David Bruce, 6th of Clackmannan was the son of John Bruce, 5th of Clackmannan and Elizabeth Stewart.1 He was appointed Knight by King James IV.1 He died circa 1500.2
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT *He married, firstly, Janet Stirling, daughter of Sir William Stirling, 2nd of Keir.1
2 CONT *He married, secondly, Mariot Herries, daughter of Robert Herries of Terregles.1 widow of Sir David Stewart 4th of Roslyn 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Sir David Bruce, 6th of Clackmannan and Janet Stirling
2 CONT #Robert Bruce+1 Children of Sir David Bruce, 6th of Clackmannan and Mariot Herries
2 CONT #Sir David Bruce, 7th of Clackmannan+1 d. a 1556
2 CONT #Christian Bruce1
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT * The Scots peerage : founded on Wood's ed. of Sir Robert Douglas's Peerage of Scotland; containing an historical and genealogical account of the nobility of that kingdom Author Paul, James Balfour, Sir, 1846-1931 Page 471. [https
2 CONC ://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/473/mode/1up/search/%22James+Shaw%22 Archive.Org]
2 CONT *http://www.thepeerage.com/p24626.htm#i246259 cites 
2 CONT *[S37] BP2003 volume 1, page 1294. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT *[S6286] Clan MacFarlane and associated clans genealogy, online https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I21878&tree=CC cites 
2 CONT * [S6] Stirnet Genealogy, Peter Barns-Graham, Bruce02:.
2 CONT * [S6] Stirnet Genealogy, Peter Barns-Graham, Stewart08.
2 CONT * [S6] Stirnet Genealogy, Peter Barns-Graham, Bruce02.
