1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ROBERT BRUCE OF CULTMALINDIE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''According to Frances J. Grant: "Robert Bruce of Cultmalindie, in the parish of Tibbermore and County of Perth, was the second son of John Bruce, fifth laird of Clackmannan, by his wife Elizabeth, daughter of Sir David Stewart o
2 CONC f Rossyth, and died in 1508, having married, in 1475, Janet, daughter and co-heiress of John Barbour of Cultmalindie, with whom he received a half of these lands, and had issue." [https://archive.org/details/TheCountyFamiliesOfThe
2 CONC ShetlandIslands/page/n12/mode/1up The County Families of the Shetland Islands]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://archive.org/details/TheCountyFamiliesOfTheShetlandIslands/mode/1up The County Families of the Shetland Islands. Being Genealogies of Local Families Compiled from Public Records and Other Sources. By Frances J. Grant, W
2 CONC S., Carrick Pursuivant of Arms. (T. & J. Manson, Lerwick, MDCCCXCIII), 205 pp.]'''
