2 CONT * Last Edited=20 Jan 2008
2 CONT * '''Sir John Montgomerie of Ardrossan was the son of John Montgomery and Elizabeth Eglinton.2 He married, firstly, Agnes of the Isles.2 He married, secondly, Margaret Maxwell, daughter of Robert Maxwell of Carlaverock.2 He died f
2 CONC rom 1426/27 to November 1429.2
2 CONT * '''Sir John Montgomerie of Ardrossan lived at Ardrossan, Ayrshire, Scotland.1 He was a hostage for the Earl of Douglas and King James I.2
