2 CONC rossan, Scotland. He married Agnes of the Isles. Sir John Montgomerie married Agnes (Margaret) Maxwell, daughter of Sir Herbert Maxwell, Lord Carlaverock and Katherine Stewart, in 1414. Sir John Montgomerie died before 22 November
2 CONC  1429.
