2 CONT The Life Summary of David
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lord David Herries 5th Lord Of Terregles was born in 1436, in Dumfriesshire, Scotland, his father, Sir John Herries, was 20 and his mother, Elizabeth McClellan, was 16. He had at least 5 sons with Margaretha Crichton. He died
2 CONC  on 26 August 1495, at the age of 59.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The Life Summary of Margaretha
2 CONT
2 CONT When Margaretha Crichton was born in 1430, in Dumfriesshire, Scotland, United Kingdom, her father, Sir Robert Crichton, was 21 and her mother, Elizabeth Ann Erskine Baroness Gibson, was 20. She had at least 5 sons with Lord David 
2 CONC Herries 5th Lord Of Terregles. She died on 2 November 1462, in Rothiemay, Banffshire, Scotland, at the age of 32.
2 CONT
