1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===JOHN HAMILTON OF CAMBUSKEITH===
2 CONT
2 CONT John Hamilton of Cambuakeith is the son of James Hamilton of Cambuskeith. He married Marion Maxwell, daughter of Sir John Maxwell of Calderwood, and he was succeeded by a son named Alexander Hamilton of Cambuskeith [https://archiv
2 CONC e.org/stream/heraldryofhamils00john#page/120/mode/1up Hamilton Heraldry]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT The date upon which John Hamilton of Cambuskeith died is unknown but his son Alexander is said to have been served heir to his father in 1489 and it follows that he must have died in or before 1489 [https://archive.org/stream/hist
2 CONC oricalgeneal00ande#page/254/mode/1up Hamilton Memoirs]
