1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Annabella Boyd1
2 CONT *'''F, #37475, d. before 19 May 1489
2 CONT *Father      Robert Boyd, 1st Lord Boyd, Great Chamberlain of Scotland d. bt 22 Apr 1481 - 14 Oct 1482
2 CONT *Mother     Mariota (Janet) Maxwell d. c Feb 1473
2 CONT *'''     Annabella Boyd married Sir John Gordon, son of William de Gordon, circa 1470.2 Annabella Boyd died before 19 May 1489.2
2 CONT *'''Family      Sir John Gordon b. c 1448, d. a 11 May 1517
2 CONT *Child
2 CONT **Sir Alexander Gordon+ b. c 1477, d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S74] Brent Ruesch's Research Notes.
2 CONT * 2.[S11584] The Scots Peerage, Vol. V, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 102.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1248.htm#i37475 ___________________________
2 CONT *'''Annabella Boyd1
2 CONT *F, #179983
2 CONT *Last Edited=22 Jun 2013
2 CONT *'''     Annabella Boyd is the daughter of Robert Boyd, 1st Lord Boyd of Kilmarnock and Mariot Maxwell.1 She married Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar, son of William de Gordon, 1st of Lochinvar.2
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Gordon.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Annabella Boyd and Sir John Gordon of Lochinvar
2 CONT ** 1.Isobell Gordon+2
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S1322] David Arathoon, "re: Acheson Family and Campbell Family," e-mail message to Darryl Lundy, 8 April 2005 - 14 July 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Acheson Family and Campbell Family."
2 CONT * 2.[S32] BLG2001 page 883. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S32]
2 CONT *From: http://www.thepeerage.com/p17999.htm#i179983 ____________________________
2 CONT *'''Annabella Boyd[1]
