2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Adam Boyd, here treated, is not mentioned in the Scots Peerage account of the family of Robert, Lord Boyd, and his wife Mariota Maxwell, [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/142/mode/1up The Scots Peerag
2 CONC e V: pp. 142-47] or in Stirnet's review of the published histories. [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/boyd1.php Stirnet: Boyd 1]'''
