1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == PATRICK MAXWELL OF NEWARK ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Maxwell of Newark is the son of George Maxwell of Newark. His date of birth is not certainly known but he was probably of perfect age when the Lords of Council recognised him as the son and heir of his deceased father 2
2 CONC 6 January 1484-85. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/339/mode/1up RMS: 1612]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===The Murder of Alexander Hamilton of Auchinhowy, younger===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On 5  December 1530 Patrik Maxwell of Newark, William Stirling of Glorat, Mariot Maxwell, Lady Bardowie, Andrew Stirling of Banker, John and Stephen Spreull, Thomas Colquhoun of Kirkton, and John Colquhoun, his brother, were al
2 CONC l required to find surety for their attendance at the Justice-aire of Dumbarton to underly the law for intercomuning with Alan Hammiltoun of Bardowy, Alan Graham and Hugh Grey, rebels at the horn for art and part of the slaughter 
2 CONC of Alexander Hamilton, young Laird of Auchinhowy, and Keffane Williamsoun, his servant. [https://archive.org/stream/criminaltrialsin01pitc#page/n197/mode/1up Criminal Trials, i, p. 150*]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date of death has not so far been identified for Patrick Maxwell of Newark. He was alive on 18 April 1541 [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD220%2f1%2fF%2f6%2f5%2f3&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&
2 CONC tn=n&tp=n&k=Maxwell+of+newark&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=y NRS: GD220/1/F/6/5/3]  but it seems quite likely that he died before 4 November 1567, by which date his son George appears to have succeeded to Newark. [http://catalogue.
2 CONC nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH6%2f2101&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+maxwell&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: RH6/2101]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Patrick Maxwell of Newark married Mariote Crawford. They were married before 9 January 1498-99.  [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/526/mode/1up RMS: 2473]'''
2 CONT
