2 CONC hilling land of Estir-Kilbride, in the barony of Finlawstoun-Maxwel and sheriffdom of Renfrew. '''Patrick Maxwell of Newark had previously resigned these lands for a new grant for him and his wife. Patrick and Mariote were to hold
2 CONC  in conjunct fee and liferent, and possession was to descend to the heirs male of their bodies, whom failing to Patrick heirs'''. [https://archive.org/stream/registrummagnisi02scot#page/526/mode/1up Register of the Great Seal of S
