2 CONC alf of the lands of Litill Selloch, the lands of Auchinreoch and Glenheid with the mill of Carrikmure, the lands of Balthomas, Kilbride, Hoggistoun, and the one-half merklands of Bire of Thomastoun, extending to ten pound lands of
