1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ARCHIBALD MAXWELL OF STANELY===
2 CONT
2 CONT Archibald Maxwell of Stanely is the younger son of George Maxwell of Newark, and the nephew of Patrick Maxwell of Stanely. [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/464/mode/1up/search/mariot+maxwell Memoirs of the M
2 CONC axwells of Pollock, p. 464] According to William Fraser, when Patrick Maxwell of Stanely died without issue: "the lands and barony of Stanley soon afterwards became the patrimony of Archibald Maxwell, younger son of George Maxwell
2 CONC , nephew of this Patrick, and the first of Newark." [https://archive.org/stream/memoirsofmaxwev100fras#page/463/mode/1up Memoirs of the Maxwells of Pollock, i, pp. 463-44]
2 CONT
