2 CONT '''11 May 1564: Instrument of Sasine in favor of John Scrymgeour son of James Scrymgeour of Balbeuchly and Elizabeth Scrymgeour his spouse. Dated the 11 day of May 1564. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/deta
