2 CONT <blockquote>'''Fake Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''John Scrymgeour of Kirkton, here treated, the husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Bruce/6000000009617990197?through=6000000009617990192 has occasionally been misidentified as James Scrymgeour of Kirkton. [h
2 CONC ttps://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4as/scrymgeour02.php Stirnet: Scrymgeour 02] See also [https://www.thepeerage.com/p25629.htm#i256281 Darryl Lundy's Peerage] However, this falsehood is contradicted by the record evidenc
2 CONC e which follows.'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Scrymgeour of Kirkton, here treated, is the son and heir of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Scrymgeour-of-Kirkton/6000000199061286868?through=6000000009617990192 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Scrymge
2 CONC our/6000000009618037407?through=6000000009617990192 His maternal grandfather was https://www.geni.com/people/James-Scrymgeour-of-Dudhope-Constable-of-Dundee/6000000009618105527. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalo
2 CONC gue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2f819&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+scrymgeour&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1600&di=y NRS: GD137/819]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date and place of death has not been identified for John Scrymgeour of Kirkton, here treated. He made his last will and testament in 1580, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2
2 CONC f838&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+scrymgeour+of+kirktoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1500&dt=1590&di=y NRS: GD137/841]  and he was still alive on 20 July 1582, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=
2 CONC GD137%2f2081&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+scrymgeour+of+kirktoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1540&dt=1584&di=n NRS: GD137/2081] but he died before 22 November 1584. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?refer
2 CONC ence=GD137%2f865&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=agnes+bruce&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: GD137/865]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Scrymgeour of Kirkton, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Bruce/6000000009617990197?through=6000000009617990192. She is noticed as his widow on 22 November 1584. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nr
2 CONC sonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2f865&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=agnes+bruce&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: GD137/865]'''
2 CONT
