2 CONT '''March 1544: Band be way of instrument betuix Johnne Scrymgeour, constabill of Dundie, on the ane pairt, and Johnne Scrymgeour in Ballegerno, ane of the airis of lyne of James Scrymgeour, constabill of Dundie, be the quhilk thai
2 CONC  ar content to abyde the determinatioun of certane freyndis, daitit in Marche anno jm vc liiij. David Lude, notar. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso30scotuoft/page/10/mode/1up Scrymgeour Inventory: number 136]'''
