2 CONC legerno and Walkmylne, daitit 8 Junij anno jm vc lxv. Togidder with the seising following thairupoun. William Haitlie, notar. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso30scotuoft/page/9/mode/1up Scrymgeour Inventory: number 134
