2 CONC alogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2f825&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=john+scrymgeour+of+kirktoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1540&dt=1584&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Scrymgeour Wedderb
