2 CONT                    19
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 July 1582: Discharge by John Ker burgess in Dundee, to John Scrymgeour of Kirktoun for 5½ merks. Dated at Dundee. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2f2081&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=
2 CONC n&tp=n&k=john+scrymgeour+of+kirktoun&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1540&dt=1584&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Scrymgeour Wedderburn of Wedderburn Family, Earls of Dundee, reference GD137/2081]'''
