2 CONT * William Wallace held his last parliament here, prior to the Battle of Falkirk in 1298.
2 CONT *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Young_(Scottish_diplomat_and_tutor)_ Sir Peter's second wife was Dame Joanna Murray, widow of Lord Torphichen, who survived her marriage for only six months, dying in November 1596.
2 CONT * https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_Torphichen  The first Baron Sandilands had previously served as Lord St. John, the last Preceptor of the Order of St John of Jerusalem, of Rhodes, and of Malta in Scotland, and took the title f
2 CONC rom the Torphichen Preceptory in West Lothian. 
