1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JOHN GRAHAM OF CLAVERHOUSE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Graham of Claverhouse, here treated, is the eldest son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Graham/6000000027128810056?through=6000000206991738833 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Bethune/600000002712889831
2 CONC 5 Upon his father's resignation dated 13 July 1541 he received a Crown charter erecting Claverhouse and Ballargus, into the free tenandry of Claverhouse. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun03pa
2 CONC uluoft/page/318/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IIIL 318]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Graham of Claverhouse, here treated is reported to have died unmarried and without issue, before July 1547. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft/page/318/mode/1up The Scots Pee
2 CONC rage III: 318]
2 CONT
