1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR JAMES SCRIMGEOUR OF GLASSARIE (aka JAMES SCRYMGEOR)===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Scimgeour of Glasserie is the son of John Scrimgeour of Dudhope, constable of Dundee and lord of Glassarie. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%2f3898&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=
2 CONC n&tp=n&k=+Glassarie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: GD137/3898] An brief account of his life can be found in [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefou02paulgoog#page/n325/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III, pp. 311-13]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Scrimgeour of Glassarie married Margaret Carnegie. The marriage contract was dated 13 June 1565. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefou02paulgoog#page/n327/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 313]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir James Scrimgeour of Glassarie married Magdalene Livingston before 11 September 1581. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefou02paulgoog#page/n327/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 313]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-John-Scrimgeour-1st-Viscount-Dudhope/6000000007089418269?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1523918674554&through=6000000002674749196
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-Scrimgeour/6000000024656752880?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1523918850058&through=6000000003774822827
2 CONT # https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Scrymgeour/6000000019839536836?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1523918935478&through=6000000003774822827
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''23 June 1567: Instrument of sasine in favour of James Scrymgeour son and apparent heir of John Scrymgeour of Dudhope ,constable of Dundee and lord of Glassarie, following upon a precept of Mary Queen of Scots, dated 30 June 156
2 CONC 5, of the lands of Dudhope, Castlehill, the Constabulary, parts of Inverkeithing, lands in Perth and the lands and barony of Glassary and others. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD137%
2 CONC 2f3898&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=+Glassarie&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Scrymgeour Wedderburn of Wedderburn Family, Earls of Dundee, reference GD137/3898]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogical Accounts===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefou02paulgoog#page/n317/mode/1up The Scots Peerage:III, pp. 303-15 for Scrymgeour Earl of Dundee]
2 CONT # [https://quod.lib.umich.edu/e/ecco/004896980.0001.000/1:91?rgn=div1;view=fulltext Douglas Peerage: Scrymgeour Earl of Dundee]
2 CONT # [http://www.thepeerage.com/p20089.htm#i200884 Darryl Lundy's Peerage: Sir James Scrimgeour of Glassarie]
