1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == AGNES SCRYMGEOUR ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Agnes Scrymgeour, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/James-Scrymgeour-Constable-of-Dundee/6000000009618105527?through=6000000001806482293 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details
2 CONC .aspx?reference=GD137%2f791&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=erlishall&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n NRS: GD137/791]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from Scrymgeour Family Documents ==
2 CONT
2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''11 February 1537: Precept direct be William Mauld of Panmure for infefting of Peter Bruce, appeirand air to William Bruce of Erlishall, and Agnes Scrymgeour, his spous, in the half landis of Balrudrie, daitit the xj februar 153
2 CONC 7. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso30scotuoft/page/1/mode/1up Scrymgeour Documents: number 9]'''
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''9 April 1551: Charter grantit be Johnne, bischope of St. Androis, to Alexander Bruce, sone and appeirand air to Peter Bruce of Fordell, and Nannis Scrymgeour, his spous, of the half pairtis of the half landis of the Kirktoun of
2 CONC  Strathdichtiemertyne and Baldoven, daitit 9 Aprile anno jm v c lj zeiris. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso30scotuoft/page/7/mode/1up Scrymgeour Documents: number 89]'''
2 CONT
