2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Agnes Somerville, here treated, is the daughter of Hugh fifth Lord Somerville, and his second wife Jonet Maitland. [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08paul#page/19/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 19]'''
