2 CONT
2 CONT == First Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Agnes Somerville, here treated married https://www.geni.com/people/John-Tweedie-of-Drumelzier/6000000179704367826?through=6000000053635933035  [https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08paul#page/19/mode/1up The Scots P
2 CONC eerage VIII: 19] On 17 December 1533 she and her husband had a charter under the Great Seal of Scotland which confirmed their possession of  the lands of Hopcailzo in the sheriffdom of Peebles. John had previously resigned this la
2 CONC nd in order to obtain and new grant in favour of himself and his wife. They were to hold this land of the crown, in conjunct fee and liferent. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi03scot/page/291/mode/1up?view=theater Regi
2 CONC ster of the Great Seal of Scotland, 1513-46: 1328]'''
