2 CONT
2 CONT == [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft#page/18/mode/2up Biographical Summary from the Scots Peerage] ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Agnes Somerville married, in 1533, to John, son and apparent heir of James Tweedie, son and apparent heir of John Tweedie of Drummelzier, and with her husband had a charter from his grandfather of the ten-pound land of Hopcailz
2 CONC o. The King was present at the marriage. She was married, secondly, probably as his second wife, to William Murray of Romanno, who afterwards married Helen Henderson." [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft#page/18/
2 CONC mode/2up The Scots peerage VIII, 19]
