2 CONT ===DAVID BRUCE OF CLACKMANAN AND RAIT===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''11 September 1497: Charter by which James IV, King of Scots, confirms possession of the baronies of Clackmanan and Rait to David Bruce, son of David Bruce of Clackmanan, and his heirs. David Bruce senior had previously resigned
2 CONC  these lands in order to obtain a new grant under the Great Seal of Scotland in favour of his son David. David senior reserved his own liferent and that of his wife Mariote Herriis. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02s
2 CONC cot/page/505/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: charter number 2372]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wildthingsgrow.com/ghtout/getperson.php?personID=I1026&tree=tree1
2 CONT
2 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/owt/person.aspx?pid=11449532&st=1
2 CONT =-=-=-=-=-=-
2 CONT
2 CONT Nephew David Bruce of Rate resigned his right to Clackmannan in 1506/7 and the title passed to his uncle David Bruce, son of David 6th Baron, but his 2nd wife Marion Herries.
2 CONT
