2 CONC hich became  extinct  in  the  male  line  on  the  death,  8  July 1772,  of  Henry  Bruce,  fifteenth  and  last  Baron.
2 CONT >>>>>2.  [https://www.geni.com/people/Sir-Edward-Bruce-of-Blairhall-and-Easter-Kennet/6000000003615931244?through=6000000003435018681 Edward,  of  Blairhall]  born  1505,   had  a  charter  of  the  lands  of Easter  Kennet,  1537
2 CONC ,  on  the  resignation  of  Robert  Brady. This  charter  was  confirmed11  by  James  v.  24  April  1537. He  had  also  a  charter 12  from  the  Abbot  of  Culross  7  June 1540,  confirmed  15  February  1542-43,  of  the  l
2 CONC ands  of  Bergady and  two  parts  of  the  Shire  mills
