2 CONT *'''Marion Bruce1,2
2 CONT *'''F, #47086, d. July 1575
2 CONT *Father      Sir David Bruce, Baron O'Lack Manor d. a 1505
2 CONT *Mother     Janet Blackadder1
2 CONT *'''     Marion Bruce married John Menteith circa 1500.1 Marion Bruce married Robert Bruce, son of Sir Robert Bruce and Mariota Forrester, before 1 July 1547.1 Marion Bruce married Magnus Sinclair, son of William Sinclair, 4th Lor
2 CONC d Sinclair and Agnes Bruce, before 6 December 1561.1,3 Marion Bruce died in July 1575.1
2 CONT *'''Family 1      John Menteith d. b 1506
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Robert Bruce d. b 6 Dec 1561
2 CONT *'''Family 3      Magnus Sinclair d. 16 Jul 1586
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11565] The Scots Peerage, Vol. III, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 473.
