2 CONT Peerage has an error George Seton the First was third Lord of Seton. http://www2.thesetonfamily.com:8080/history/7th_Lord_Seton_Epitaph.htm 
2 CONT
2 CONT George Seton, 1st Lord Seton1 
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #108005, d. circa 15 July 1478
2 CONT
2 CONT George Seton, 1st Lord Seton|d. c 15 Jul 1478|p10801.htm#i108005|Sir William Seton of Seton|d. 17 Aug 1424|p521.htm#i5208|Janet Dunbar|d. a 1434|p521.htm#i5209|Sir John Seton of Seton|d. c 1434|p2983.htm#i29826|Katherine Sinclair|
2 CONC d. a 28 Mar 1450|p2983.htm#i29827|George Dunbar, 10th Earl of Dunbar|b. c 1370\nd. bt 1455 - 1457|p1050.htm#i10499||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=28 May 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=1.56%
2 CONT
2 CONT      George Seton, 1st Lord Seton was the son of Sir William Seton of Seton and Janet Dunbar.2 He married, firstly, Margaret Stewart, daughter of John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Buchan and Lady Elizabeth Douglas, before 8 January 1436/3
2 CONC 7.1,2 He married, secondly, Christian Murray, daughter of Sir William Murray of Tullibardine, before 8 January 1460/61.2 He died circa 15 July 1478.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT      George Seton, 1st Lord Seton was invested as a Knight in 1439.2 In 1448 he went to France as an envoy.2 He was created 1st Lord Seton [Scotland] circa 22 March 1450/51.2 He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland]
2 CONC  in 1458.2 In 1472 he went to England as an envoy.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of George Seton, 1st Lord Seton and Christian Murray
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Seton 2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Seton, 1st Lord Seton and Margaret Stewart
2 CONT
