2 CONC |Janet Dunbar|d. a 1434|p521.htm#i5209|John Stewart, 3rd Earl of Buchan|b. c 1381\nd. 17 Aug 1424|p10800.htm#i107995|Lady Elizabeth Douglas|b. bt 1385 - 1401\nd. c 1451|p10800.htm#i107996|
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=25 Apr 2008
