2 CONT
2 CONT      John Seton, Master of Seton was the son of George Seton, 1st Lord Seton and Margaret Stewart.1 He married Christian Lindsay, daughter of John Lindsay, 1st Lord Lindsay of the Byres and Agnes Stewart, circa 20 January 1458/59.
2 CONC 1 He died before 1478.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      John Seton, Master of Seton was styled as Master of Seton in 1451.1
