2 CONT
2 CONT ===Helen Campbell
2 CONT *Birth  	Abt 1463  	Glenorchy, Argyllshire, Scotland 
2 CONT *    Father  	'Black' Colin Campbell, of Breadalbane, 1st of Glenorchy, b. Abt 1428, Lochow, Argyllshire, Scotland  
2 CONT *    Mother  	Margaret Stirling, b. Abt 1432, Keir, Dumfriesshire, Scotland  
2 CONT *    Family 1  	Alexander MacIain MacDonald, 7th & last chief of Ardnamurchan, b. Abt 1459, Ardnamurchan, Argyllshire, Scotland.    Married  	Abt 1489  	Glenorchy, Argyllshire, Scotland 
2 CONT * Family 2  	Iain Og MacLaine, 5th of Lochbuie, b. Abt 1470  -    Married  	Y  [3] 
2 CONT *  Family 3  	Iain MacEwin McAlaster MacGregor, of Glen Strae, 7th Chief of Clan Gregor, b. Abt 1460  -  Married  	Y  [2, 4] 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Alexander MacDonald and Helen Campbell:
2 CONT # Margaret MacIain MacDonald
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Iain Og MacLaine, 5th of Lochbuie  and Helen Campbell:
2 CONT #Murdoch MacLean, 6th of Lochbuie, b. 1496
2 CONT #Charles MacLean
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Iain MacEwin McAlaster MacGregor, of Glen Strae, and Helen Campbell:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Alasdair ruadh (Alistair Roy) MacGregor, of Glen Strae, 8th Chief of Clan Gregor, b. Abt 1496, Glen Strae, Argyllshire, Scotland
2 CONT # John (Iain) MacGregor
2 CONT # Gregor MacGregor, b. Abt 1502
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes  	
2 CONT
2 CONT 7th Chief ravished and afterwards m Helen, widow ot two other Highland chiefs, Maclain of Ardnamurchan and MacLaine of Lochbuie {qv) and dau of Sir Colin Campbell of Glenorchy, which relationship was no doubt the reason why the CA
2 CONC MPBELLs advanced him to the chiefship,
2 CONT
