1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. Malcolm Fleming of Monycabo (dvp. c. 1477), Master of Fleming
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father	Robert Fleming, 1st Lord Fleming d. bt 26 Mar 1491 - 16 Jan 1493
2 CONT * Mother	Janet Douglas
2 CONT
2 CONT mar. bef. 2 Apr 1472 Eupheme Livingston (mar. (2) bef. 1 Jun 1493 William Fleming of Bord; d. after 1 Jun 1493), 2nd dau. of James [Livingston], 1st Lord Livingston, by his wife Marian ....., and had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1a. Sir David Fleming of Monycabo (d. betw. 24 Oct 1480 and 2 May 1482), mar. Elizabeth Drummond (mar. (2) bef. Mar 1487/8 George Douglas, Master of Angus, 1st son and heir ap. of Archibald [Douglas[, 5th Earl of Angus), 2nd dau
2 CONC . of John [Drummond], 1st Lord Drummond, by his wife Lady Elizabeth Lindsay, only dau. of Alexander [Lindsay], 4th Earl of Crawford
2 CONT * 2a. John Fleming, later 2nd Lord Fleming
2 CONT * 1a. Elizabeth Fleming (d. after 25 Feb 1489/90), mar. George Fleming, Yr. of Bord, son and heir ap. of William Fleming of Bord
2 CONT * 2a. Isobel Fleming (d. after 6 Dec 1494)
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT # Unknown author, The Complete Peerage, by Cokayne, Vol. V, p. 531.
2 CONT # The Scots Peerage, Vol. VIII, edited by Sir James Balfour Paul, p. 534.
