2 CONT Elizabeth Livingston, who married Robert Callender or Callendar, grandson and heir apparent to Robert Callender of Durator. Their son, Robert Callender of Bancloich, married Marion Lindsay, and this last couple's daughter married 
2 CONC James Livingston of Inches, a member of a younger line of the Livingstons of Kilsyth. 
