2 CONT '''4 July 1493: Witnesses: Arch. Edmondstoun de Duntrith, and Jac. Edmondstoun de Polmays, and others. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/466/mode/1up RMS: 2205]
2 CONT
