2 CONC St. Andrews diocese. Witnesses: Alexander Levingstoun of Donypaiss, sir Robert Edmondstoun and sir William Andersoun, chaplains, Robert Sinclare, James Sinclare, Matthew Sinclare, John Mude, James Murray, Andrew Steward and John B
