2 CONT *'''M, #66563, b. circa 1405, d. after 8 May 1481
2 CONT *Father	Andrew Ker1 d. c Dec 1444
2 CONT *'''     Andrew Ker married Margery Douglas''', daughter of William Douglas, 2nd Laird of Cavers.1 '''Andrew Ker was born circa 1405 at of Cessford & Auldtounburn, Roxburghshire, Scotland.1,2,3 He died after 8 May 1481.1,2
2 CONT *'''Family     Margery Douglas''' b. c 1425, d. 1484
2 CONT *'''Children	
