2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # Abt 1460 to Margaret Hepburn, daughter of Sir Patrick Hepburn, 1st Lord Hailes and Ellen Wallace; her 2nd marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Margaret Ker, of, Cessford, Eckford, Roxburghshire, Scotland.  "It is on record that John Home of Ersilton married a Margaret Ker, but she was daughter of James Ker of Gateshaw and the later history of Margaret Ker of Cessford d
2 CONC oes not seem known."
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes 
2 CONT * KINSHIP: 1st son and heir-apparent by 1st wife.
2 CONT * RESIDENCE: Of Cessford {Cessford, Eckford, Roxburghshire, Scotland}.
2 CONT * RESIDENCE: Of Auldtonburn
2 CONT * PUNISHMENT: Remission> received a remission with his father and others for aiding and abetting Robert, Lord Boyd, in carrying off King James III from Linlithgow 1466.
