2 CONT Lady Janet Keith [1]
2 CONT *F, #109263, 
2 CONT *d. before 1504
2 CONT *Last Edited=27 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Janet Keith was the daughter of William de Keith, 1st Earl Marischal and Marjorie Fraser.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, firstly, John Leslie, Master of Rothes before 1481.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, secondly, Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath, son of Walter Stewart, 1st Lord Innermeath and Margaret Lindsay, before 23 June 1481.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 1504.1
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 1481, her married name became Leslie.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT From before 23 June 1481, her married name became Stewart.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Janet Keith and Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath
2 CONT *1. Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath+2 b. b 1504, d. 1532
2 CONT
