2 CONT Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath [1]
2 CONT *M, #109269, 
2 CONT *b. before 1504, 
2 CONT *d. 1532
2 CONT *Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.42%
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath was born before 1504.[1] He was the son of Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath and Lady Janet Keith.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Margaret Lindsay, daughter of John Lindsay, 3rd Lord Lindsay of the Byres and Marion Baillie, before 1532.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1532.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Innermeath [S., 1469] on 9 September 1513.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath and Margaret Lindsay
2 CONT *1. John Stewart, 4th Lord Innermeath+1 b. b 1521, d. Jan 1569/70
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
