2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stewart-15565
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Stewart is a member of Clan Stewart. Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath was born about 1500. He was the son of Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath and his wife Lady Janet Keith.
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded to the title of 3rd Lord Innermeath [S., 1469] on 9 September 1513.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1532.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Richard Stewart was married to Margaret Lindsay, daughter of John Lindsay, 3rd Lord Lindsay of the Byres and his wife Marion Baillie, about 1518.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Children of Richard Stewart and his wife Margaret Lindsay;
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. John Stewart. b. abt. 1518 in Innermeath, Perthshire, Scotland 2. Bernard Stewart. b. abt 1530 in Innermeath, Perth, Scotland
2 CONT
