2 CONT
2 CONT Peerage has an error.  George Seton II was the 4th Lord of Seton. See http://www2.thesetonfamily.com:8080/history/7th_Lord_Seton_Epitaph.htm 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p2144.htm#i21435
2 CONT
2 CONT George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton was the son of John Seton, Master of Seton and Christian Lindsay.1 He married Lady Margaret Campbell, daughter of Colin Campbell, 1st Earl of Argyll and Isabel Stewart, circa 14 September 1469.1 He die
2 CONC d from 11 June 1507 to 6 April 1508.1
2 CONT
2 CONT George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton succeeded to the title of 2nd Lord Seton [S., 1451] circa July 1478.1 In 1493 he was the founder of the Collegiate Chiurch of Seton.1 He was invested as a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) [Scotland] in 1496.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Seton, 2nd Lord Seton and Lady Margaret Campbell
2 CONT * George Seton, 3rd Lord Seton+ d. 9 Sep 15131  
2 CONT * Martha Seton+ 1 
