2 CONT *'''     Robert Cunningham, 2nd Lord of Kilmaurs was born at of Kilmaurs, Ayrshire, Scotland.1 He married Christian Lindsay, daughter of Sir John Lindsay, 1st Lord of Byres and (Miss) Stewart, before 19 July 1476.1 Robert Cunningh
2 CONC am, 2nd Lord of Kilmaurs died circa 1490.1
