1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Darryl Lundy's Peerage page on Margaret Lindsay:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p10927.htm#i109270
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Lindsay [1]
2 CONT *F, #109270, 
2 CONT *d. before February 1576/77
2 CONT *Last Edited=30 Apr 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Lindsay was the daughter of John Lindsay, 3rd Lord Lindsay of the Byres and Marion Baillie.[1],[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath, son of Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath and Lady Janet Keith, before 1532.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Sir James Stewart, son of Andrew Stewart, 1st Lord Avandale and Margaret Kennedy, before 4 June 1533.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before February 1576/77.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT As a result of her marriage, Margaret Lindsay was styled as Lady Innermeath before 1532.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margaret Lindsay and Richard Stewart, 3rd Lord Innermeath
2 CONT *1. John Stewart, 4th Lord Innermeath+[1] b. b 1521, d. Jan 1569/70
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Lindsay and Sir James Stewart
2 CONT *1. Henry Stewart+[3]
2 CONT *2. James Stewart, 1st Lord Doune+ b. a 1529, d. 20 Jul 1590
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT *1. [S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Exti
2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VIII, page 140. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *2. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume VIII, page 7.
2 CONT *3. [S37] Charles Mosley, editor, Burke's Peerage, Baronetage & Knightage, 107th edition, 3 volumes (Wilmington, Delaware, U.S.A.: Burke's Peerage (Genealogical Books) Ltd, 2003), volume 2, page 2768. Hereinafter cited as Burke's 
2 CONC Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Not the same women'''  Margaret Lindsay     Birth: 1441    Death: February 6, 1482  (41)  
2 CONT
2 CONT Immediate Family:  Daughter of John Lindsay 1st Lord Lindsay of the Byres and Agnes Stewart of Lorn Wife of Walter Stewart, 1st Lord Innermeath Mother of Thomas Stewart, 2nd Lord Innermeath 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lindsay-292
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/details/P3V6-HVY
