1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Christian Lundie''' was the daughter of John Lundie of that Ilk (fl. 1457-66 ).and Elizabeth Forrester.[1] [1][2] She died before 29 Jul 1515, the date John Forbes married his third wife, Elizabeth Barlow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian married, as his second wife, to John Forbes, the 6th Lord Forbes.[2] on 26 February 1510.  His first wife was Katherine (or Catherine) Stewart.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Christian Lundie and John Forbes:
2 CONT
2 CONT #     John Forbes (c.1509-1537).  Married Elizabeth Lyon.
2 CONT #     William Forbes (c.1510-1593). Married Elizabeth Keith.
2 CONT #     Margaret Forbes (c.1511) m. Andrew Fraser of Muchalls 
2 CONT #     Elizabeth Forbes (c.1513-1570) m1. Gilbert Keith of Troup; m2. Alexander Innes of Innes
2 CONT #     Marjorie Forbes (c.1514) m. Alexander Forbes of Brux
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT #James Balfour Paul,'' Scots Peerage,'' vol. 4 (Edinburgh, 1907), p. 53. < [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/52/mode/2up Archive.Org] > 
2 CONT # Matthew Lumsden, Genealogy of the Family of Forbes (Inverness, 1819), p. 12. < [https://books.google.com/books?id=sZdDAAAAYAAJ&pg=PP13&source=kp_read_button&hl=en&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Christian (Lundie) Lundie Lady Forbes (1463-bef.1515)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lundie-3 : accessed 06 March 2025). cites
2 CONT ## Wood, W. (1862). The east neuk of Fife, p. 240. Google Books.
2 CONT ## Lundy, Darryl, The Peerage; A genealogical survey of the peerage of Britain as well as the royal families of Europe, (Wellington, New Zealand, © 2018: Darryl Lundy); site updated on 10 Jul 2018, accessed 12 July 2018; thepeerag
2 CONC e.com for John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes, Person Page - 10922.
2 CONT #[https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=John_Forbes,_6th_Lord_Forbes&oldid=1257851784  John Forbes, 6th Lord Forbes] (died 1547) was a Scottish landowner. He was the son of William Forbes, 3rd Lord Forbes and Christian Gordon
2 CONC , daughter of Alexander Gordon, 1st Earl of Huntly. 
