2 CONT *” THE SCOTTS OF BALWEARIE And Some American and Canadian Descendants“ COMPILED AND EDITED BY CAROL CLARK JOHNSON (1914 – 2001)[https://vredenburgh.org/vredenburgh/pages/scotts_of_balwearie.pdf PDF] page 25
2 CONT * https://electricscotland.com/history/nation/scott.htm
