1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sir Thomas Hay, Master of Yester (d.1491), who married Elizabeth (1490-1544), daughter of Alexander Home, 2nd Lord Home, (who remarried James Hamilton, 1st Earl of Arran). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Thomas Hay was born before 1468. He was the son of John Hay, 1st Lord Hay of Yester.2 He married, firstly, Elizabeth Borthwick before 1483.2 He married, secondly, Elizabeth Home, daughter of Alexander Home, 2nd Lord Home and N
2 CONC ichola Ker, before 1490.1 He died between 29 September 1502 and 8 November 1504vp.2
