2 CONT John was born in Fernois, Renfrew, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT I also found this information but dates are a little different:
2 CONT
2 CONT John COCHRANE (~1520 - >1555) 	 Mary LINDSEY 	
2 CONT
2 CONT m. bef 1550 John "of Fernois" COCHRANE [168] 	Wife To John [COCHRANE] [874] b. ca 1510, Fernois\Paisley, Renfrew Co., SCOT d. aft 1570, Carikeel, Antrim Co., IRE, age: 60
2 CONT
2 CONT Children Hugh COCHRANE John COCHRANE
2 CONT > James "Old James Of Moboy" COCHRANE <
2 CONT
2 CONT On a different site, I found this information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Cochran, John [Male] b. 1529 Fernois,Paisley,Renfrenshire District,Scotland - d. 1613 Carrikeeel,Ulster,Antrim,Northern Ireland
2 CONT + Lindsey, Mary [Female] b. 1530 Fernois,Paisley,Renfrenshire District,Scotland - d. Fernois,Paisley,Renfrenshire District,Scotland - Marriage: 1549  SON: Cochran, John [Male] b. 1550 Fernois,Paisley,Renfrenshire District,Scotland
2 CONC  - d. 1570 Foughen,Londonderry,Ulster,Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Full Name: John of that Ilk, Earl of Paisley Cochran
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT John was born and died in Fernois, Renfrew, Scotland. See notes on William Cochran aka Walddemar de Cochrane born in 1230.
2 CONT
2 CONT I found other information on a different site that says this:
2 CONT
2 CONT  b. 1490 Fernois,Paisley,Renfrenshire District,Scotland - d. 1537 Carrikeel,Ulster,Antrim,Northern Ireland
