1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JAMES Stewart (-[Jan 1497/Jan 1500]).  Earl of Buchan 1469 had one illegitimate child by an unknown mistress: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.          '''daughter (-after 1530).  m ALEXANDER Abernethy Lord Saltoun, son of JAMES Abernethy Lord Saltoun & his wife --- (-before 25 Jul 1527).''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc359672001
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Dowager Lady Saltoun, daughter of James Stewart, Earl of Buchan, uterine brother of King James II., who must have been his widow [of Alexander Abernethy, Lord Saltoun], is said to have built the house of Park, in Banffshire
2 CONC , in 1530. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/409/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VII: pp. 409-10]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT unknown daughter Stewart is the daughter of James Stewart, 1st Earl of Buchan and Margaret Ogilvy.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Alexander Abernethy, 4th Lord Saltoun of Abernethy, son of James Abernethy, 3rd Lord Saltoun of Abernethy and unknown wife (?).3
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p18652.htm#i186513
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Stewart, Baroness Margaret Jane Margaret Jane Abernathy formerly Stewart Born about 1482 in Buchan, Aberdeenshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT *Daughter of James Stewart and Margaret (Ogilvy) Stewart
2 CONT *Sister of Alexander Stewart, Agnes (Stewart) Maxwell [half], Isabel Stewart, James Stewart [half], Margaret (Stuart) Gordon [half] and Elizabeth (Stuart) Home [half]
2 CONT *Wife of Alexander Abernethy PC — married
2 CONT *Mother of William Abernathy and Beatrix (Abernethy) Forbes
2 CONT *Died 1530 in Scotland
2 CONT *Suffix Baroness of Saltoun
2 CONT *Born Abt 1482 of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland
2 CONT *Died Aft 1530 , , , Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Person ID I42970 Full Tree | Magill, Larson Last Modified 27 Sep 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT Father James II Stewart, Earl of Buchan, b. Abt 1442, Earl Hill, Doddington, Northumberland, England Mother Margaret Murray, b. Abt 1446, of Falahill, Eddleston, Peebles, Scotland Married Abt 1474 , , , Scotland Family ID F18697 G
2 CONC roup Sheet, Family chart
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Sir. Alexander Abernathy, Baron, b. Abt 1485, of Saltoun, West Haddington, East Lothian, Scotland d. Jun 1527, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland (Age ~ 42 years) Married Abt 1503 of, , , Scotland Children + 1. Sir. William Abe
2 CONC rnathy, Baron, b. Abt 1504, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland d. Dec 1548 (Age ~ 44 years) + 2. Beatrix Abernathy, b. Abt 1505, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland 3. Lawrence Abernathy, b. Abt 1506, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland 4. John
2 CONC  Abernathy, Viscount of Balcors, b. Abt 1508, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland d. 14 Nov 1581, of, Balcors, Angus, Scotland (Age ~ 73 years) 5. Thomas Abernathy, b. Abt 1510, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland 6. Agnes Abernathy, b. Abt
2 CONC  1514, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland 7. William Abernathy, b. Abt 1516, of, Buchan, Aberdeen, Scotland Last Modified 17 Aug 2010 Family ID F18664 Group Sheet, Family chart
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Jane Stewart was born about 1482. She was the daughter of James Stewart (1st Earl of Buchan) and his wife Margaret Ogilvy. Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret was married to Alexander Abernethy (4th Lord Saltoun of Abernethy) the son of James Abernethy (3rd Lord Saltoun of Abernethy) Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Stewart and Alexander Abernethy, 4th Lord Saltoun of Abernethy;
2 CONT
