1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Isabel MacDonald, of Glengarry''' was born circa 1567 in Glengary, Inverness-shire, Scotland. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-20244226 Donald Macdonald, 8th of Glengarry and Morar] and [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-20245544 Margaret of Clanranald Macdonald]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-20248767 Sir Roderick Macleod, 15th of Macleod and Dunvegan] in 1592. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-37799631 John Macleod, 14th of Macleod]; [h
2 CONC ttps://www.geni.com/profile-113223560 Roderick Macleod of Talisker]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-113471522 Sir Norman MacLeod, 1st of Bernera]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-113472884 William Macleod, 1st of Hamer]; [https://www
2 CONC .geni.com/profile-113417399 Donald MacLeod, I of Greshornish]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34698826322 Flora MacLeod]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34641037716 Janet Macleod]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-123611744 Margaret Ma
2 CONC cLeod]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-123611615 Mary Macleod]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1615 in Isle of Skye, Scotland and was buried in Scotland. 
2 CONT ----
