2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabel MacDonald, of Glengarry was born circa 1567 in Glengary, Inverness-shire, Scotland. Her parents were Donald Macdonald, 8th of Glengarry and Morar and Margaret of Clanranald Macdonald.
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabel married Sir Roderick Macleod, 15th of Macleod and Dunvegan in 1592. Together they had the following children: John Macleod, 14th of Macleod; Roderick Macleod of Talisker; Sir Norman MacLeod, 1st of Bernera; William Macleod,
2 CONC  1st of Hamer; Donald MacLeod, I of Greshornish; Flora MacLeod; Janet Macleod; Margaret MacLeod; Mary Macleod.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1615 in Isle of Skye, Scotland and was buried in Scotland.
2 CONT Isabel Macdonell1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #506172
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=28 Aug 2011 D
2 CONT
