2 CONT == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "II. <strong>Alexander</strong>. Alexander, who fought against the Cromwellians in Ireland, and was wounded there, married Marion, daughter of Allan Mor Macdonald of Morar, and had by her — 
2 CONT * Ranald, his successor, 
2 CONT * James, who married Margaret, daughter of MacNeill of Barra. 
2 CONT * Angus, who married Anne, daughter of Charles Maclean of Drimnin. 
2 CONT * Una. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Macdonald of Kinlochmoidart died in 1689, and was succeeded by his eldest son."
2 CONT
