1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Donald Gorm_Mor9 Macdonald. Donald died 1617 in Scotland. 7th of Sleat. He raided the Maclean kands in Mull and was taken prisoner by the Macleans. Released by the order of the Government from Edinburgh after payin
2 CONC g a heavy fine. In 1610 Donald and five other chiefs met in Edinburgh and agrred to submit all disputes to the ordinary courts of law.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Donald Gorme Mor Macdonald, 7th Laird of Sleat died, in 1616, without any children so he was succeeded by his nephew Donald Gorme Og MacDonald of Sleat
2 CONT
