2 CONT
2 CONT '''Isabel Boyd gave up the testament dative and inventory of her deceased husband, John Blair, younger of that Ilk, who died intestate in January 1604, in name and behalf of their four daughters, Grissell, Issobell, Agnas and Marg
2 CONC aret Blair. Confirmation was granted to her on 3 July 1608. [National Records of Scotland, Glasgow Commissary Court, Testament Dative & Inventory of Johne Blair, younger, of that Ilk, reference CC9/7/5]'''
