2 CONT Hector Munro, 17th Baron of Foulis (d.1603), also known as the master of Foulis, was chief of the Highland, Scottish clan, Clan Munro. He is the 10th chief of Clan Munro who can be proved by contemporary evidence. He was seated at
2 CONC  Foulis Castle.
