2 CONC r, Katherine Margaret MacKenzie of Kintail, was 17. He married Lady Isabel Wemyss Baroness of Wemyss, 9th Baroness of Lovat on 11 October 1614, in Fife, Scotland. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters. He died o
2 CONC n 16 February 1646, in Beauly, Inverness-shire, Scotland, at the age of 54, and was buried in Kirkhill, Highland, Scotland, United Kingdom.
