2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gavin Cochrane of Craigmuir, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Margaret-Cleland/6000000202487922826?through=6000000021613881070 They were contracted on 31 July 1661. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlin
2 CONC ecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD180%2f202&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+cleland&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=y NRS: GD180/202]''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''31 July 1661: Contract of marriage between Gavin Cocherane, brother of William, Lord Cocherane, and Margaret Cleland, daughter of Alexander Cleland in Dormontsyd; Gavin to resign in favour of himself and Margaret, his half of t
2 CONC he Mure called Craiginfiochmure in the parish of Paislay and sheriffdom of Renfrew. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD180%2f202&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+cleland&ko=p&r=&ro=
2 CONC s&df=&dt=&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Cathcart Family of Genoch and Knockdolian, reference GD180/202]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
