2 CONT * ↑ 2.0 2.1 MacKay, WIlliam."Urquhart and Glenmoriston, Olden Times in a Highland Parish", Inverness: Northern Counties Newspaper and Printing and Publishing Company,1914, Archive.org, p. 510
2 CONT * ↑ 3.0 3.1 Anderson, Peter John. (1904). Major Alpin’s Ancestors and Descendants (p. 11). Aberdeen: Unknown. Retrieved from Internet Archive (Available online); accessed 11 September 2021.
