1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===LADY JEAN GORDON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Jean Gordon, here treated, is the daughter of John, Earl of Sutherland, and his first wife Lady Jean Drummond. She was born on 10 October 1634. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/351/mode/1up The Scot
2 CONC s Peerage VIII: 351]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Jean Gordon, here treated, married Captain Robert Stewart of Eday. The marriage contract is dated 11 July 1657. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/351/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 351]'''
2 CONT
