2 CONC  or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume III, page 77. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT *[S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XI, page 231.
2 CONT *[S8] BP1999. [S8]
