2 CONC ecember 1633, on which date he is further identified as John Hamilton, younger of Broomhill. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD89%2f1%2f66&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=broomehill&ko=p&r
