2 CONT
2 CONT '''John, Lord Belhaven, is the son of Sir James Hamilton of Broomhill and his wife Margaret Hamilton. [https://archive.org/stream/historicalgeneal00ande#page/250/mode/1up Memoirs: 250] He married Margaret Hamilton, bastard daughte
2 CONC r of James, second Marquess of Hamilton and had issue. He died on 17 June 1679. [https://archive.org/stream/heraldryofhamilt00john#page/n86/mode/1up Heraldry: 37]'''
