1 NAME Robert /Alexander of Dunvanaddy/
2 GIVN Robert
2 SURN Alexander of Dunvanaddy
2 _MARNM Alexander of Dunvanaddy
2 NICK NOT Hon. Robert Alexander of Stirling
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
