2 CONT Note:  TITL James Alexander McCluer The McCluer Family pg 184 – 188 Extracts from The McClure Family by Rev. James Alexander McClTEXT (BOQ) We are indebted to James Alexander McClure, author of" The McClure Family,"pp. 184-188 for
