2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/livesoflindsayso02crawuoft/page/140/mode/1up Lives of the Lindsays II: pp. 140-42]
2 CONT # [http://thepeerage.com/p2115.htm#i21146 Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
