1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JAMES HAMILTON Lord Polmont ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Hamton, Lord Polmont, is the only son of William Hamilton, Duke of Hamilton, and his wife Lady Elizabeth Maxwell. He died an infant and was buried on 12 March 1647-48, at Westminster Abbey. [https://archive.org/details/sc
