2 CONT "<strong>Sir George Johnston, Baronet [S 1626] of Caskieben</strong>, son and heir; succeeded to the Baronetcy on the death of his father. In 1660 he sold Caskieben to Sir John Keith, who changed its name to Keith Hall. He married
2 CONC , in or before 1648, (--), daughter of Sir William Leslie, 3rd Baronet [S 1625], of Wardes, by Helen, daughter of George Gordon, of Newton. He died before 10 June 1695."
2 CONT
