1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not sure if the first name is William... The Hester I found in the Wills for London is a different Hester then Hester Dethick...she is a Hester Smalpiece :
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.com/books?id=RkwuAAAAMAAJ&pg=PA322&dq=William+Johnson,+Alderman+of+Norwich&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiJ-tKt1rncAhUCOH0KHRPgDiMQ6AEIKTAA#v=onepage&q=William%20Johnson%2C%20Alderman%20of%20Norwich&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT An Essay Towards a Topographical History of the County of Norfolk ... By Francis Blomefield; p. 322.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Hester (Smalpiece) married a William Johnson Alderman of Norwich...and their son was a William who married a Mary. And they (William and Hester) had a daughter Anne who married a Robert Tichborne who was also a Alderman, died
2 CONC  1682.
