1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == HELEN CULLEN ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Cullen, here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/George-Cullen-Provost-of-Aberdeen/6000000206325844874?through=6000000193132083919 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Margery-Forbes/60000002063258
2 CONC 67864?through=6000000193132083919 She was born before 3 November 1643, the date upon which her baptism was registered at Aberdeen in Aberdeenshire, Scotland. Her baptismal record reads as follows: "1643. 3 November. George cullen 
2 CONC and mariori forbes ane dochter named Helen Bap: be Mr androu cant Patrik Leslie provest Mr thomas gray bailzie Paul robsone Godfathers." [National Records of Scotland, Aberdeen Baptisms, reference OPR.168/A/3] [https://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/documents/view?doc_id=6000000206406988841 Image of Baptismal Record]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Helen Cullen, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/William-Johnstone-of-Forresterhill/6000000033506680328?through=6000000193132083919 See [https://archive.org/details/officersgraduate00univuoft/page/57/mode/1up Off
2 CONC icers and Graduates: 57] They were booked for proclamation on 23 March 1662, at Old Machar in Aberdeenshire, Scotland. The marriage booking reads as follows: "1662. 23 March. Mr Wm Jonstoune regent gave evidence of his booking in 
2 CONC Abn wt Helen Cullen daughter to provest Cullen they were thryse proclaimed here & married there." [National Records of Scotland, Old Machar Marriages, reference OPR.168/B/6] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=600000020639
2 CONC 3341821 Image of Marriage Record] They were married on 29 April 1662, at Aberdeen in Aberdeenshire, Scotland. The marriage record reads as follows: "1662. Mr William Johnstoune and Helline Cullen mareid the 29 Apryll" [National Re
2 CONC cords of Scotland, Aberdeen Marriages, reference OPR.168/A/12] [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000206393183889 Image of Marriage Record]'''
2 CONT
