3 TEXT Fabulous Wintonhill farmhouse sleeping up to 14 people in 6 bedrooms, and the five star Winton Cottage, sleeping up to 12 people in 5 bedrooms. Only 1/2 an hour from Edinburgh city centre Set on the beautiful Winton estate
4 CONT Very well appointed and comfortable, and only 20 minutes form Edinburgh by car or train, it makes an ideal base for the wide range of active and passive pursuits available in the area.
4 CONT
4 CONT Wintonhill Farmhouse is one of the largest self-catering houses in East Lothian.
4 CONT
4 CONT The farmhouse has:
4 CONT
4 CONT 6 bedrooms  - sleeping 12-14
4 CONT large farmhouse kitchen with range cooker
4 CONT Games room with playstation, CD player and good selection of board games 
4 CONT Utility room
4 CONT Sitting room with open fire
4 CONT Dining room seating up to 16 and even a piano
4 CONT It has extensive gardens with plenty of parking space, patio, BBQ area and walled orchard ideal for football.
4 CONT
4 CONT
4 CONT Winton Cottage is a historic 5 star self-catering property, which was onvce the Laird's house and is set in a quiet corner of the estate. It is fully modernised but retains an abundance of character.
4 CONT
4 CONT The Cottage has:
4 CONT
4 CONT 5 Bedrooms, sleeping 10 -12 people
4 CONT 5 New modernised bathrooms
4 CONT Modern fully fitted bathroom, all with showers and 2 with baths as well
4 CONT Dining room seating up to 12 & patio doors leading into the garden
4 CONT Games room complete with pool table, plasma screen TV with freeview, DVD player & DC system with surround sound
4 CONT Car parking for 20 cars
4 CONT Huge sunny south facing garden with plenty of space for entertaining: a BBQ area, sand pit, herb garden and Summer house
