2 CONT John Gordon, 1st and last Viscount Melgum and Lord Aboyne was the son of George Gordon, 1st Marquess of Huntly and Lady Henrietta Stuart.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Lady Sophia Hay, daughter of Francis Hay, 9th Earl of Erroll and Elizabeth Douglas, in 1626.[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 9 October 1630 at Frendraugh Tower, Scotland, in a fire, without male issue.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He was created 1st Viscount Melgum and Lord Aboyne [Scotland] on 20 October 1627.[1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT On his death, his title became extinct.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John Gordon, 1st and last Viscount Melgum and Lord Aboyne and Lady Sophia Hay
2 CONT *1. Hon. Henrietta Gordon3
2 CONT
