1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/36258974/mary-clifton
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, first, on Feb 2,1626/7 at Halifax, Yorkshire, Henry Butterworth.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married, second, shortly after Jan 28,1640/1, Thomas Clifton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by first marriage): John Butterworth, Abraham Butterworth, Mary Butterworth Mason, Samuel Butterworth, and Henry Butterworth. NOTE: Older information names a daughter Sarah, born c1623, who married Pardon Tillinghast. How
2 CONC ever, she was born four years before the marriage of Henry and Mary, so she may not even be of the Butterworth family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by second marriage): Patience Clifton Beere/Berry Allen and Hope Clifton Holder. Some sources say the Mary Clifton Bowen was a daughter of hers, but Mary was born in 1628 (well before the marriage of Thomas Clifton and Ma
2 CONC ry), and she may have been a daughter of Thomas Clifton by a prior wife.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
