2 CONT http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~sam/butterworth/henry.html
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT The Butterworth Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Butterworth was born ca 1598-1600, possibly in Rochdale, Lacastershire, England. While still in England, in married Mary (____) ca 1620. Henry died ca 1640 in Weymouth, Norfolk County, Massachusetts. It is not known when or 
2 CONC how he came to America, but his brother, Samuel is also to be found in Weymouth and Rehoboth town records.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Mary, remarried in 1641 to Thomas Clifton, a Quaker, by whom she had two daughters, Hope and Patience. They moved to Newport, Rhode Island where Mary died on January 26, 1687/8.
2 CONT ----
