1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Alexander</strong>, second son of Alexander, second Earl of Linlithgow, who married (contract dated 25 and 28 August 1663) Mary, third daughter of William, second Duke of Hamilton, but had no issue by her. After his death
2 CONC  in August 1685, she married, secondly (contract dated 28 June 1690), Sir James Livingstone of Westquarter; and thirdly, James, third Earl of Findlater. The second Earl of Callendar had a natural son, Sir Alexander Livingston of G
2 CONC lentirran, who was created a baronet of Nova Scotia 20 July 1685."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun02pauluoft#page/362/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. II, page 363
