2 CONT *Fraser, Vol I, pp328-30 [https://archive.org/stream/douglasbook01fras#page/839/mode/2up Archive.Org]
2 CONT * The Complete Peerage, 1st edition, Volume 8, page 139 [https://archive.org/stream/completepeerage00cokagoog#page/n147/mode/2up Archive.Org] 
