1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://thepeerage.com/p2074.htm#i20740
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Mary Hay married George Keith, 7th Earl Marischal, son of William Keith, 5th Earl Marischal and Lady Mary Erskine, on 6 February 1662. She died circa November 1667. She was also reported to have died on 10 November 1701. She 
2 CONC was buried on 6 December 1667. She was the daughter of George Hay, 2nd Earl of Kinnoull and Lady Anne Douglas. From 6 February 1662, her married name became Keith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Alternate DOD 10 November 1701.
