1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == JAMES HAY ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Bogus Genealogy'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''According to Sir James Balfour Paul, writing in his account of the family of Alexander, Earl of Stirling, James Hay, here treated, was the father of https://www.geni.com/people/Grizel-Hay/6000000024008709858?through
2 CONC =6000000010010080671a lady who married, as his second wife, https://www.geni.com/people/Lt-Col-Hon-James-Alexander/6000000010010080671 [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08paul/page/180/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VIII: 1
2 CONC 80] This is wrong. https://www.geni.com/people/Grizel-Hay/6000000024008709858?through=6000000010010080671 was in fact the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Hay-of-Linplum/6000000014883958909?through=60000000240087098
2 CONC 58 This is confirmed by her contract of marriage with https://www.geni.com/people/Lt-Col-Hon-James-Alexander/6000000010010080671 [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f189%2f6&st=1&tc=
2 CONC y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Hay+of+Linplum&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1700&di=n NRS: GD1/189/6]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == The Question of Identity ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''James Hay, here treated, is reported to be the son of https://www.geni.com/people/George-Hay-2nd-Earl-of-Kinnoull/6000000013940045370?through=6000000182637066838 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Douglas/60000000064
2 CONC 44413937?through=6000000182637066838 According to the Scots Peerage his name is mentioned in an Aberdeen sasine, date not given, but nothing more is said of him. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05paul/page/224/mode/1u
2 CONC p The Scots Peerage V: 224]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 October 1664: Contract of marriage between James Alexander, son of deceased William, Earl of Stirling, and Grissell Hay, second daughter of deceased Sir William Hay of Linplum. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinec
2 CONC atalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD1%2f189%2f6&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Hay+of+Linplum&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1700&di=n National Records of Scotland, Gorgie Mills titles, Edinburgh; Burgess tickets, reference GD1/189/6]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05paul/page/224/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 224]'''
