2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Biography:''' Anne Hay (d. 14 Feb 1700) was the daughter of Sir James Hay, 1st Bt. and Sidney Massey. She married James Douglas, 10th Earl of Morton, son of William Douglas, 7th Earl of Morton and Lady Anne Keith, on 10 Februar
2 CONC y 1649.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of James Douglas, 10th Earl of Morton and Anne Hay
2 CONT
2 CONT # Charles Douglas, died at sea, unmarried.[1]
2 CONT # James Douglas, 11th Earl of Morton b. b 1660, d. 7 Dec 1715
2 CONT # Robert Douglas, 12th Earl of Morton b. b 1661, d. 22 Jan 1730
2 CONT # William Douglas, died without issue.[2]
2 CONT # George Douglas, 13th Earl of Morton b. 1662, d. 4 Jan 1738
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
