1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Of Alexander Seton, 3rd Earl of Dunfermline (June 12, 1642 - d. btw. August 23-October 27, 1677), very little is known. He succeeded his father, Charles Seton, 2nd Earl of Dunfermline, in 1672. He had no children, 
2 CONC and upon his death in 1677 the title went to his brother, James Seton, 4th Earl of Dunfermline. The title became extinct with James; he was outlawed in 1690, and died without heirs in 1694.
