1 TITL Lady
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lady Mary Campbell was born after 1634.  She died on 4 February 1690/91.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  daughter of Archibald Campbell, 1st Marquess of Argyll and Lady Margaret Douglas.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT # George Sinclair, 6th Earl of Caithness, son of John Sinclair, Master of Berriedale and Lady Jean Mackenzie, on 22 September 1657 at Roseneath, Dunbartonshire, Scotland. 2
2 CONT # John Campbell of Glenorchy, 1st Earl of Breadalbane and Holland, son of Sir John Campbell of Glenorchy, 4th Bt. and Lady Mary Graham, on 7 April 1678.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT From 22 September 1657, her married name became Sinclair. As a result of her marriage, Lady Mary Campbell was styled as Countess of Caithness on 22 September 1657. From 7 April 1678, her married name became Campbell. As a result o
2 CONC f her marriage, Lady Mary Campbell was styled as Countess of Breadalbane and Holland on 13 August 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Lady Mary Campbell and John Campbell of Glenorchy, 1st Earl of Breadalbane and Holland
2 CONT # Hon. Colin Campbell+3 b. bt 1671 - 1679, d. 31 Mar 1708
2 CONT
