1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Ker was the daughter of Harry Ker. She married John Fleming, 4th Earl of Wigton, son of John Fleming, 3rd Earl of Wigton and Lady Jean Drummond, on 5 December 1660. She died in November 1673. Her married name 
2 CONC became Fleming.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Anne Ker and John Fleming, 4th Earl of Wigton
2 CONT * Jean Fleming1 d. Apr 1683. Married George Maule 
2 CONT
