2 CONT
2 CONT Child Baptized: James
2 CONT 30 Mar 1698 • Dundee, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT JA: GUTHRIE merchant & CHRISTIAN SCOTT, child: JAMES, Name Fathers: JAMES GUTHRIE, son to Mr JO: GUTHRIE merchant; JA: CRAWFORD son to ___ CRAWFORD, merchant, JAMES MARE? Merchant.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child Baptized: Robert
2 CONT 8 Jun 1699 • Dundee, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT JAMES GUTHRIE merchant & CHRIST: SCOTT had a son baptized ROBERT; Name Fathers: ROT: LAMB of Aldbarr, MR ROT: RAIT Minister of Dundee, ROT: LAUDERDALE surveyor of his majesty's customs & ROT: WATSON merchant.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child Baptized: Thomas
2 CONT 10 Oct 1700 • Dundee, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT JA: GUTHRIE merchant, & CHRIST. SCOTT, child: THOMAS, Name Fathers: TSO: MOODIE ___, TSO: WATSON merchant, THO: WATSON younger of Grange
2 CONT
2 CONT Child Baptized: William
2 CONT 22 Apr 1702 • Dundee, Angus, Scotland
2 CONT JA: GUTHRIE merchant & CHRIST. SCOTT, Child: Wm, Name Fathers: WM SCOTT merchant, WM CRAWFORD son to ___ CRAWFORD, WM TRAIL son to GEO. TRAIL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lands of Craigie
2 CONT 26 Feb 1704
2 CONT "A matter regarding the Muir of Craigie was settled between the Town, James Guthrie of Craigie, and James Kyd, heir of the late George Kyd of Craigie. First indication that lands of Craigie had passed from Kyd family to Guthrie fa
