1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Found on my Heritage, don't know who verifiable it is:
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Margaret DOUGLASS, of Mar (born ERSKINE), 1513 - 1572 Margaret DOUGLASS, of Mar (born ERSKINE) was born in 1513, at birth place, to John Erskine 5th Lord Erskine and Katherine Erskine 5th Lord Erskine (born Monypenny). John w
2 CONC as born circa 1487, in Nisbet, Roxburghshire, Scotland. Katherine was born circa 1485, in Ardwenny,Angusshire,,Scotland. Margaret had 8 siblings: Elizabeth Falconer (born Erskine), John (5th Lord Erskine) Erskine of Dun and 6 othe
2 CONC r siblings. Margaret married Robert DOUGLASS. Robert was born on November 7 1505, in Kilmarnock, East Ayrshire, Scotland. They had 5 children: William DOUGLASS, Euphemia Lindsay (born DOUGLASS) and 3 other children. Margaret marri
2 CONC ed James V STEWART. James was born on April 15 1512. They had one son: James Douglas. Margaret married Charles Murray. Charles was born in 1520, in Scotland. They had 2 daughters: Janet Colville (born Erskine) and one other child.
2 CONC  Margaret married Unknown. They had 5 sons: John STEWART, Henry Bruce and 3 other children. Margaret passed away on month day 1572, at age 59 at death place.
2 CONT
2 CONT Added by Janet Milburn 8/17/19
