2 CONC n 1290, in Warkworth, Northumberland, England, United Kingdom, at the age of 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Richard de Lyons, II   Birth:	1242 Warkworth, Northumberland, England (United Kingdom)  Death:	circa 1269 (22-31) Immediate Family:	 Son of Sir Roger de Lyons, of Warkworth and Joanna de Napton Husband of Marjorie de Ackle and
