2 CONT *[453] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. X, Cap. XXVIII, p. 113. 
2 CONT *[454] Balfour Paul The Scots Peerage, Vol. V, Mar, p. 577, citing Acta Parliamenta Scotorum, I, p. 423 [not yet consulted]. 
2 CONT *[455] CP VIII 402-3. 
2 CONT *[456] Stevenson (1870), Vol. I, pp. 410 and 414. 
2 CONT *[457] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. XI, Cap. XIII, p. 150. 
2 CONT *[458] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. XIII, Cap. XII, p. 287. 
2 CONT *[459] Stuart (1798), p. 429. 
2 CONT *[460] John of Fordun (Skene), Annals, CLXXVIII, p. 366. 
2 CONT *[467] Calendar of Documents Scotland (Bain), Vol. II, 823, p. 200. 
2 CONT *[468] Johannis de Fordun (Goodall), Vol. II, Lib. XI, Cap. XIII, p. 150. 
2 CONT *[469] Stephenson, J. (ed.) (1870) Documents illustrative of the History of Scotland from the death of King Alexander the Third to the accession of Robert Bruce 1286-1306 (Edinburgh), Vol. II, CCCLXXXV, p. 92. 
2 CONT *[470] Cupar, Vol. II, Appendix, II, 5, p. 286. 
2 CONT *[471] Fraser, Sir. W. (1874) The Lennox, Vol. I, p. 240 (not yet consulted), cited in CP VII 591. 
2 CONT
