2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Marjory, of Mar
2 CONT * AKA Margaret de Mar 
2 CONT * Gender: Female
2 CONT * Born: 1280
2 CONT *  Father: Sir Donald (Malcolm), 6th Earl of Mar (Abt 1243 - Aft 25 Jul 1297)
2 CONT * Mother: Helen, of North Wales (Abt 1246 - Aft 1295)
2 CONT * Married: 1) John Comyn 2) Kenneth de Moravia
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT Spouse:  John Comyn, 2nd of Strathbogie, 9th Earl of Atholl (Between 1266 and 1270 - 10 Nov 1306):
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT * 1  John, of Strathbogie ( - Abt 1316)
2 CONT * 2 Isabel, of Strathbogie ( - 1317)
2 CONT *3  David Comyn, last of Strathbogie, 10th Earl of Atholl (1290 - 28 Dec 1326)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Kenneth de Moravia, 4th Earl of Sutherland ( - 19 Jul 1333)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT *  1 Nicholas Sutherland, of Duffus ( - Bef 1434)
2 CONT *  2  William Sutherland, 5th Earl (King) of Sutherland ( - 1370)
2 CONT *  3 Eustachia Sutherland ( - Yes, date unknown)
2 CONT *  4  dau. de Moravia ( - Yes, date unknown)
2 CONT * 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of Mar was the widow of John de Strathbogie, 9th Earl of Atholl. Kenneth 4th Earl of Sutherland was her second husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#IsabelMarMRobertIBrucedied1329
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.         MARGARET of Mar (-after 1306).  A charter dated 3 Sep 1296 records petitions to King Edward I by women whose estates had been seized in Scotland, including an order of restoration of property to "la contesse de Atheles"
2 CONC [496].  "Gilbertus de Haia constabularius Scotie" confirmed donations to Cupar abbey, including the donation made by "Mariore comitisse Atholie, relicte quondam Johannis comitis Atholie et confirmatione David filii sui primogeniti
2 CONC  et heredis", by charter dated 5 Oct 1309[497].  m JOHN of Strathbogie Earl of Atholl, son of DAVID of Strathbogie Earl of Atholl & his second wife Isabel of Chilham (-executed London 7 Nov 1306). 
2 CONT
