1 NOTE 4th High Steward. Regent of Scotland in the time of Alexander III�s minority. Commanded at the battle of Largs (1263). From his second son�s marriage with the heiress of Bonkyl sprang the Stewarts of Darley, Lennox and Aubigny. {C
