2 CONT     1 TITL [HIGH STEWARD OF SCOTLAND]
1 NOTE He was on crusade from 1248 to 1250. He was the principal commander of the right wing uder King Alexander III at the Battle of Largs on 2 Oct 1263, when the Scottish army defeated the Norwegians. He was granted the Barony of Garli
2 CONC es in reward in 1263. In 1264 he invaded the Islo of Man.
