2 CONC  of that Kingdom, with Armorial Illustrations (1904-1914), Paul , Sir James Balfour, (9 volumes. Edinburgh: D. Douglas, 1904-1914), vol. 1 p. 13.  "His wife is said to have been Jean, daughter of James, Lord of Bute."
