2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Montgomerie was born about 1235 Eastwood, Renfrewshire, Scotland.  
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: Sir John de Montgomery of Eaglesham d c1285 & Margaret Murray dau of William Murray, Baron Bothwell 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # Sir Archibald Mure of Rowallan, son of Sir Gilchrist Mure of Rowallan and Isabel Comyn. He was born about 1231 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Children include 
2 CONT # Margaret Mure born about 1262 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT # Jonet Mure born about 1263 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT # William Mure of Rowallan born about 1265 Rowallan, Ayrshire, Scotland d. c 1348 married ?? Lindsey.
2 CONT # Robert (Reginald) Mure born about 1267 Camceskane, Ayrshire, Scotland died after 1329
2 CONT # Andrew (Andro) Mure born about 1269 Monyhagen, Ayrshire, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT # TSP Eglinton; BP1934 Eglinton and Winton. 
2 CONT #  "The Origin and History of the Montgomeries" by BG de Montgomery 1948. 
2 CONT # 'Genealogy of Grahams' see 'Graham 6'. 
2 CONT # [S1322] David Arathoon, "re: Acheson Family and Campbell Family," e-mail message to Darryl Lundy, 8 April 2005 - 14 July 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Acheson Family and Campbell Family.
2 CONT # A genealogical history of the family of Montgomery : including the Montgomery pedigree.  Page 44-45  < [https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00mont/page/44/mode/2up Archive.Org] > Sir John de Montgomerie of Eaglesham … di
2 CONC ed about 1285, leaving four sons and a daughter …“ v. A daughter who was married to Archibald Mure of Rowallan, who was slain at Berwick, where the army of Baliol was wholly routed, 1298.'”
2 CONT * LDS
2 CONT * Ancestry
