2 CONT      Sir Simon Glendonwyne Called Simon the Younger.1 He was born at of Glendonwyne, Dumfries, Scotland.1 He married Elizabeth Lindsay, daughter of Sir Alexander Lindsay, 2nd Earl Crawford and Marjory Dunbar, after 3 January 1437.
2 CONC 1 Sir Simon Glendonwyne died after 1455 at of Glendonwyne, Dumfries, Scotland.2
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Elizabeth Lindsay
2 CONT
