1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ====ELIZABETH GIFFORD
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Gifford is the daughter of James Gifford of Sheriffhall. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/353 The Scots Peerage VI: 353]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Death
2 CONT A date and place of death has not been identified for Elizabeth Gifford, here treated. She was still alive on 8 September 1586. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/353 The Scots Peerage VI: 353]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Gifford married James Douglas of Dalkeith. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/353 The Scots Peerage VI: 353] They were already married on 22 May 1441, when her brother https://www.geni.com/people/Ja
2 CONC mes-Gifford-of-Sheriffhall/6000000117186705828?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1578251569676&through=6000000006444108022 was appointed curator to her husband by the government of James II, King of Scots, who gave him full power to admini
2 CONC ster the Dalkeith estates for the space of nineteen years. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/352 The Scots Peerage VI: 352]
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Children
2 CONT
