1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lady Margaret Douglas''' was the daughter of James Douglas, 7th Earl of Douglas and Beatrice Sinclair.1 She married Henry Douglas of Dalkeith, son of Sir James Douglas, 1st Lord of Dalkeith and Lady Elizabeth St
2 CONC ewart.1 She died in 1473.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Lady Margaret Douglas and Henry Douglas of Borg: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Henry Douglas of Dalkeith and Lady Margaret Douglas:
2 CONT # Patrick Douglas of Corehead 
2 CONT # Hugh Douglas2 of Borg, second son. He and his wife, Christian, are mentioned 1479 {Great Seal Register}. His wife's name was Seton.  He lived at Borg, Scotland.1 In 1474 he renounced all rights to Dalkeith to his cousin, 1st Ear
2 CONC l of Morton.
2 CONT # James Douglas 
2 CONT # John Douglas 
