2 CONT 2.         JAMES Douglas of Balvany ([1375?]-[24 Mar/28 Mar] 1443, bur Douglas) … m [secondly] (1424) BEATRICE Sinclair, daughter of HENRY Sinclair Earl of Orkney & his wife Jill Douglas of Nithsdale (-[Jun 1455/8 Feb 1463]).  Ear
2 CONC l James & his [second] wife had [eleven] children:
2 CONT
2 CONT h)         MARGARET Douglas .  m HENRY Douglas of Borg in Galloway, son of JAMES Douglas Baron of Aberdour & his first wife Lady Elizabeth Stewart of Scotland.
2 CONT
