2 CONC 356
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/207336680/elizabeth-erskine
2 CONT
2 CONT ~ Elizabeth ( Douglas ) Erskine ~
2 CONT Birth: 1467- Morton, Dumfries-shire Scotland
2 CONT Death: 21 February 1490 - Prestonkirk, East Lothian, Scotland
