2 CONC ife of William Todrig, of George Halkerston, & of George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes).1,4,5,6 Margaret Stewart and Sir George Plantagenet, Duke of Clarence, Great Chamberlain of England, Lord of Glamorgan, Morgannwg, & Richmond, Ea
2 CONC rl of Warwick & Salisbury were engaged in 1476; Marriage never took place.5,6 Margaret Stewart and Sir Anthony Wydevill, 2nd Earl Rivers, 8th Lord Scales, Lord of the Isle of Wight, Governor of Portsmouth, Sheriff of Caernarvonshi
2 CONC re were engaged circa August 1482; Marriage never took place.5,6 Margaret Stewart died after 1503.6
