2 CONC ildren already born.4 She died circa May 1488.5 She gained the title of Princess Mary of Scotland. Through her marriage, Mary Stewart, Princess of S cotland gained the title of Countess of Arran before 26 April 1467. Her marri age
2 CONC  to Thomas Boyd, 1st Earl of Arran was annulled before 1468.5 Children of Mary Stewart, Princess of Scotland and Thomas Boyd, 1st Earl of Arran: Jame s Boyd, 2nd Lord Boyd b. b 1468, d. 1484 Margaret Boyd b. b 1468, d. a 151 6 Chi
