1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "III. <strong>Alexander</strong>. He had been associated with his older brother in various events, already referred to, and there is little of a distinctive nature to chronicle regarding him. It is probable that he did not survive
2 CONC  Donald by very many years. His death would have taken place circa 1525. Alexander was succeeded by his son."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/clandonald03macd#page/n441/mode/2up The clan Donald]; by the Rev. A. Macdonald, minister of Killearnan, and the Rev. A. Macdonald, minister of Kiltarlity; Vol. III; 1896; page 381
