1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Someone had given this _ the style of "of Glenpean".  However, according to Stirnet's "Macdonald01" page (link below), her father was styled "of Lochaber".  Further research is warranted to determine whether she was truly style
2 CONC d "of Glenpean".
2 CONT
