2 CONC of sir A∣lexander Seton, lord of Gordon, and sister of Alexander, first earl of Huntly, by whom he had three sons, and two daughters.  … 1. John, 2. Hugh [sic], 3. Celestine [sic], 1st daughter Margaret, married to John Earl of Su
2 CONC therland, and was mother of Elizabeth, heiress of that noble family; 2. 2. Florence,* married to Duncan MacIntosh, captain of the clan Chatton.
