2 CONT
2 CONT '''Florence Macdonald''' is the daughter of Alexander Macdonald, 10th Earl of Ross.2 She married Duncan Mackintosh, 11th of Mackintosh, son of Malcolm Mackintosh, 10th Chief of Mackintosh and 11th of Clan Chattan and Moira Macdona
2 CONC ld.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Florence Macdonald and Duncan Mackintosh, 11th of Mackintosh
2 CONT
2 CONT # Marjorie Mackintosh+2.  Married Ewen Cameron2
2 CONT # Ferquhard Mackintosh, 12th of Mackintosh+2 d. 1514
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info/genealogy/TNGWebsite/getperson.php?personID=I19952&tree=CC
2 CONT
2 CONT Acknowledged as simply dau. of 10th Earl of Ross, Lord of the Isles. 10th Earl is a little difficult to discern. Alexander was the 11th [12th] Earl, whereas his uncle from whom he inherited was the 9th Earl. Possibly Alexander's f
2 CONC ather Donald was known as the 10th Earl but Stirnet source names him as Lord of the Isles only.
2 CONT
