1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Neil Vass married a daughter of   George Munro of Fowlis by his wife, a daughter of Ross of Balnagown, pg. 66
2 CONT
2 CONT THE BOOK OF MACKAY BY ANGUS MACKAY, M.A. (St. Andrews University) Minister at Westerdale, Caithness EDINBURGH : NORMAN MACLEOD, -25 GEORGE IV. BRIDGE CANADA : EDWARD MACKAY, ST. PETER'S MANSE, MADOC, ONT. M DCCCC VI
2 CONT
2 CONT ===========================
2 CONT
2 CONT Scottish peerage lists her as  a daughter of George Munro of Fowlis by his first wife, Isobel, a daugliter of Alexander Ross of Balnagown,"
2 CONT
2 CONT IGI Individual Record FamilySearch™ International Genealogical Index v5.0 
