2 CONT Margaret Baillie was the daughter of Sir William Baillie of Lamington and Marian Seton.1 She married John Sutherland, 7th Earl of Sutherland, son of Robert Sutherland, 6th Earl of Sutherland and Margaret Stewart, before 1432.2 She
2 CONC  died in 1510.3
