2 CONT
2 CONT * “Genealogical history of the Earldom of Sutherland from its origin to the year 1630..”. With a continuation to the year 1651 by Gordon, Robert, Sir, Bart. (1813). Page 75.  <[https://archive.org/details/genealogicalhist00gord/pa
2 CONC ge/75/mode/1up?q=Margaret+Macdonald&view=theater Archive.Org]>
