1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Thomas Beg Sutherland''', possible ancestor of the Sutherlands of Strathullie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas, known as Thomas Beg (i.e. little), of whom nothing has been found except in the pages of Sir Robert Gordon, who states that he was the ancestor of a family of Sutherland in Strathullie.[10].
2 CONT
