2 CONT *Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-281731-1-34879/neil-stewart-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-2b3ce486475de798cf8bd879b2309c77&mrid=442168309f4b0138be5c936808fab1be MyHeritage Family Tre
