1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT * http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00314756&tree=LEO
2 CONT **1. ~Burke's Genealogical and Heraldic History of the Peerage, Baronetage and Knightage, London, 1967. page 1764 
2 CONT **2. ~Burke's Landed Gentry . 1937 1893 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Rattrays of Rattray are of royal descent. Patrick Rattray (1400-1461) married a daughter of James Stewart son of Alexander Stewart (Wolf of Badenoch) who was Robert II of Scotland's natural son. Patrick's children were therefo
2 CONC re 2nd cousins of James IV. [http://www.clanrattray.com/about-the-clan.aspx]
2 CONT
2 CONT ---- Patrick Rattray, of that Ilk. 9th Laird Mentioned in Charters of Sir Walter Haliburton 1453 and of Abbey of Aberbroltinch in 1456. Married d/o James Stewart, who was also a niece of Robert III. Died 1461
2 CONT *Dawn Stapylton-Adkins. ''James Rattray & His Descendants in South Africa'' 1822-1992, self-published, Cape Town, 1992
