1 NAME William /Muirhead/ 2nd Lord Lauchope
2 GIVN William
2 NSFX 2nd Lord Lauchope
2 _MARNM Muirhead
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1415
2 PLAC Lauchope House Lanarkshire, Scotland
2 ADDR
