2 CONT Death
2 CONT 17 Aug 1424 (aged 43–44)
2 CONT Departement de l'Eure, Haute-Normandie, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Home, born c. 1380 at Home Castle, Berwickshire, Scotland, was the patrilineal ancestor of the Lords and Earls of Home. He married Janet (Jean) Hay c. 1406 and died 17 August 1424 in the Battle of Verneuil, France, fight
2 CONC ing the English, aged ~44.
