2 CONC ncluding indexes]
2 CONT #  [https://archive.org/stream/instrumentapublica00thomuoft#page/n8/mode/1up Instrumenta Publica Sive Processus Super Fidelilatibus et Homagiis Scotorum Domino Regi Angliae Factis A.D. MCCXCI - MCCXCVI (Edinburgh, M,DCCC,XXXVI,), 
2 CONC 183 pp. plus indexes]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/cu31924091786024/page/n10/mode/1up Documents illustrative of the History of Scootland from the Death of King Alexander the Third to the Accession of Robert Bruce MCCLXXXVI - MCCCVI. etc. Selected and
2 CONC  Arranged by Rev. Joseph Stevenson. Vol. II (H. M. General Register House, Edinburgh, 1870), 532 pp. including index]
