2 CONT '''     Joanna Moray Lady of Drumsergard. She married Sir Thomas Moray, 5th Earl of Bothwell''', son of Sir Andrew Moray, Keeper of Berwick Castle. '''Joanna Moray married Sir Archibald Douglas, 3rd Earl of Douglas, Earl of Wigtow
2 CONC n, Lord of Galloway & Bothwell''', son of Sir James Douglas, 2nd Earl Douglas & Mar, Lord of Liddesdale, '''on 23 July 1362.2,3 Joanna Moray died before August 1409.'''
