1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===WALTER HAMILTON===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''On 20 May 1441 Walter Hamilton's son James had a charter for Raploch: "James Hamilton, son of the late Water Hamilton" had a charter for the lands of Raploch from his cousin Sir James Hamilton, lord of Cadzow. [Lieutenant-Colon
2 CONC el George Hamilton, The House of Hamilton, p.732]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Walter is said to be progenitor of the Raploch line and Thomas Hamilton of Darngaber is said to be a servant of the family [https://archive.org/details/heraldryofhamils00john/page/59/mode/1up Heraldry of the Hamiltons]'''
2 CONT
