2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander Seton had changed his family name to Gordon by 1458.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his father before April 1441.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 1 July 1470; buried Elgin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married, first, ca 8 January 1426-27. Egidia Hay, daughter and heiress of Sir John Hay of Tullibody. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage was annulled before Nov 1438.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married, second, by 18 March 1439-40, Elizabeth (died 9 July 1479). eldest daughter of William, Lord of Chrichton, Chancellor of Scotland
