1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham'''1
2 CONT Last Edited	4 Apr 2020
2 CONT M, #4434, '''d. 1472'''
2 CONT '''Father'''	Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham d. a 24 Jun 1466
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Christian Erskine d. a 1479
2 CONT Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT '''     William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham was born at of Kincardine, Forfarshire, Scotland. He married Eleanor (Elene) Douglas''', daughter of Sir William Douglas, 2nd Earl of Angus, Lord of Liddesdale, Jedburgh Forest, & Bonkle and
2 CONC  Margaret Hay, '''before 1460. William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham died in 1472.'''
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Eleanor (Elene) Douglas''' d. a 20 Nov 1486
2 CONT '''Children	'''
2 CONT *Christian Graham+
2 CONT *Agnes Graham+2
2 CONT *Jean Graham+
2 CONT *George Graham d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT *Isabella Graham+2 b. c 1443
2 CONT *William Graham, 1st Earl Montrose, 3rd Lord Graham+ b. bt 1463 - 1464, d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1.[S746] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, Vol. II, p. 249.
2 CONT 2.[S11649] Clan MacFarlane & Associated Clans Genealogy.
2 CONT From: https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p148.htm#i4434
2 CONT ____
2 CONT '''William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham'''1 
2 CONT M, #109613, '''d. 1472'''
2 CONT Last Edited=2 Jan 2020
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.26%
2 CONT '''     William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham''' was the son of Patrick Graham, 1st Lord Graham and Hon. Christian Erskine.2 '''He married Lady Anne Douglas''', daughter of George Douglas, 4th Earl of Angus and Isabel Sibbald.3 '''He ma
2 CONC rried Elene Douglas''', daughter of William Douglas, 2nd Earl of Angus and Margaret Hay, '''before 1460.1 He died in 1472.'''4
2 CONT '''     He succeeded as the 2nd Lord Graham [S., 1445] after 24 June 1466.'''2
2 CONT '''Children of William Graham, 2nd Lord Graham and Elene Douglas'''
2 CONT 1. William Graham, 1st Earl of Montrose+2 d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT 2. Jean Graham+5
2 CONT 3. Christian Graham+6
2 CONT 4. George Graham+2 d. 9 Sep 1513
2 CONT 5. Isabella Graham+2
2 CONT 6. Agnes Graham+7
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT 1.[S8] BP1999 volume 1, page 1281. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S8]
2 CONT 2.[S37] BP2003 volume 2, page 2752. See link for full details for this source. Hereinafter cited as. [S37]
2 CONT 3.[S323] Sir James Balfour Paul, The Scots Peerage: founded on Wood's edition of Sir Robert Douglas's The Peerage of Scotland (Edinburgh, Scotland: David Douglas, 1904), volume I, page 178. Hereinafter cited as The Scots Peerage.
2 CONT 4.[S6] G.E. Cokayne; with Vicary Gibbs, H.A. Doubleday, Geoffrey H. White, Duncan Warrand and Lord Howard de Walden, editors, The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain and the United Kingdom, Extant, Extinc
2 CONC t or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume VI, page 53. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
2 CONT 5.[S8] BP1999. [S8]
2 CONT 6.[S37] BP2003. [S37]
2 CONT 7.[S6286] Clan MacFarlane and associated clans genealogy, online http://www.clanmacfarlanegenealogy.info. Hereinafter cited as Clan MacFarlane.
