1 NOTE The following is copied from the "Clan Stirling Online" website athttp://www.clanstirling.org/Main/keirstory/2.FromLukastoThoraldus.html:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. William de Strivelyng of Rathoran was born about 1339 in Scotland. Hedied about 1393 in Scotland. He has reference number VII - Stirlings ofKeir.
2 CONT
2 CONT William may have been born in 1339, being the year following the marriageof his parents. He possessed the lands of Rathoran by the same tenure asthey had been granted to Mary, the wife of John de Striwelyne, and herheirs. It appea
2 CONC rs from the retour of his son in 1423 that William hadbeen dead about 30 years, this is since 1393, fifty-five years after thegrant to Mary Stirling. Source: The Stirlings of Keir, Page 15. Williamde Strivelyng of Rathoran had the
2 CONC  following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     1    i. Lukas Strivelyng of Keir - First Laird of Keir.
