2 CONT '''Marjorie Graham, here treated, was born before 26 January 1598-99, the date upon which her father died. She is reported to have been mentioned in her father's last will and testament, which was confirmed in the Commissary Court
2 CONC  of Dunblane on 27 January 1620. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun06pauluoft/page/150/mode/1up The Scots Peerage VI: 150]'''
