2 CONT Children of Colin Campbell, 3rd Earl of Argyll and Jean Gordon: Archibald Campbell, 4th Earl of Argyll d. bt 21 August 1558 – 2 December 1558, married three times. Lady Elizabeth Campbell d. c 1548, married; firstly, James Stewart
2 CONC , 1st Earl of Moray, an illegitimate son of King James IV; secondly, John Gordon, 11th Earl of Sutherland[1] Lady Agnes Campbell (1526–1601), married James MacDonald and Turlough Luineach O'Neill. 
