2 CONT ''Please note that the quote below does NOT refer to Thomas Kennedy 5th Laird of Bargany. The correct web address for the quote below is http://www.electricscotland.com/history/domestic/    then look up Reign of King James VI part
2 CONC  D.   The quote below is dated 7th November 1597. Thomas Kennedy 5th of Bargany was dead by this time. His son also called Thomas became 6th Laird of Bargany''''''  from Stephen Johnson (Thomas Kennedy 5th of Bargany was my 11 x g
2 CONC reat grandfather)
