2 CONT ===Jean Stewart
2 CONT * Gender:	Female
2 CONT * Birth:	circa 1481 - Balvenie Castle, Glen Fiddich, Fifeshire, Scotland
2 CONT * Death:	Scotland
2 CONT * Father: John Stewart, 1st Earl of Atholl (1440 - 1512)
2 CONT * Mother: Lady Eleanor Sinclair, Countess of Atholl (1457 - 1518)
2 CONT * Spouse: John (or Robert) GORDON 3rd of Auchleuchries, son of John GORDON 2nd of Auchleuchries, 1st of Pitlurg and Margaret FORBES. (John GORDON 3rd of Auchleuchries was born about 1481 and died about 1546 3.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT "7.         JEAN .  m as his first wife, Sir ROBERT Gordon of Pitlurgo." (FMG)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burke's Dormant and Extinct Peerages, p 509, says Jean married "Sir Robert Gordon of Pitlurg"
2 CONT
