1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Gordon married secondly, Margaret Drummond, of the family of Stobhall, without issue (she married after her husband's death George Baird of Auchmedden).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.patrickspeople.scot/ourfamily/11406.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT >"His son John Gordon second Laird of Pitlurge married the Earl o Athols daughter Stuart, with whom he begat a son John Gordon third Laird of Pittlurg; likewise he begat on a Gentlewoman Maitland two natural sons and two daughters
2 CONC  viz. William Gordon of Belchirrie and George Gordon of Kindrught ; one daughter married the goodman of New Forbes, another married Menzies Provost of Aberdeen. Their Father the forsaid John Gordon 2d Laird of Pittlurg was killed 
2 CONC at the battle of Pinkie anno 1547. [He married secondly Margaret Drummond. It was his son who fell at Pinkie.] "
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT from Balbithan Manuscript 1
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT The 1st daughter, Margaret, married to George Drummond, fourth laird of Balloch; [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Family 1	Sir Robert Gordon, 3rd of Auchleuchries, 1st of Pitlurg,   b. 1479, Little Pitlurg, Moray, Scotland  d. 1546, Aberdeenshire, Scotland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2	George Baird, of Glencuthill, later of Auchmedden,   b. 1517, Auchmedden, Aberdeenshire, Scotland d. 29 Mar 1593  (Age 76 years) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 3	George Drummond, 4th of Balloch,   d. 3 Mar 1596 
2 CONT Married	Abt 22 Apr 1556  [1] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 	
2 CONT * +	1. Henry Drummond, 5th of Balloch,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT * +	2. Jean Drummond,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT * +	3. Agnes Drummond,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *  	4. Margaret Drummond,   d. Yes, date unknown
2 CONT *  	5. William Drummond,   d. Aft 11 Sep 1601
2 CONT *  	6. James Drummond,   d. Aft 26 Jan 1613
2 CONT
