2 CONT Margaret Lindsay
2 CONT *F, #21643
2 CONT *Last Edited=19 Feb 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Lindsay was the daughter of Alexander Lindsay of Auchtermonzie, 7th Earl of Crawford and Isobel Campbell.[1],[2] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married James Ogilvy, 3rd Lord Ogilvy of Airlie, son of Sir John Ogilvy, 2nd Lord Ogilvy of Airlie and Jean Graham.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also known as Isobel.[3] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her married name became Ogilvy.[1] As a result of her marriage, Margaret Lindsay was styled as Lady Ogilvy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Margaret Lindsay and James Ogilvy, 3rd Lord Ogilvy of Airlie
2 CONT *1. Margery Ogilvy+
2 CONT *2. John Ogilvy [3]
2 CONT *3. Archibald Ogilvy [3]
2 CONT *4. Margaret Ogilvy3
2 CONT *5. Isobel Ogilvy3
2 CONT *6. Beatrix Ogilvy4
2 CONT *7. James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy of Airlie+ b. b 1505, d. bt 27 Nov 1547 - 13 Jul 1548
