2 CONC nct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 70. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage. [S323] Sir James Balfour Paul, The Scots Pe
