2 CONT ____
2 CONT '''James Ogilvy, 4th Lord Ogilvy of Airlie'''1 
2 CONT M, #109232, '''b. before 1505, d. between 27 November 1547 and 13 July 1548'''
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Oct 2012
