2 CONT *'''     John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond Lord Stobhall. He married Elizabeth Lindsay, daughter of Sir Alexander Lindsay, 4th Earl Crawford and Margaret Dunbar.6 John Drummond, 1st Lord Drummond was born circa 1438 at of Stobhall,
2 CONC  Scotland. He died in 1519; Age 81.8
2 CONT *'''Family      Elizabeth Lindsay d. a 22 Sep 1509
