2 CONT Philip married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34730739082 Elizabeth Walsingham]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-37025452 Catherine Bedingfield]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Philip married [https://www.geni.com/profile-37025506 Agnes Yaxley] circa 1507 in Ditchingham, Suffolk, England. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-77917106 Thomas Bedingfield, Sr.]; [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/profile-34730739345 Robert Bedingfield, Sir]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-84262711 Henry Bedingfield]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1574 in Ditchingham, Norfolk, England, United Kingdom. 
