1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John BEDINGFIELD (1, 2, 3) was born 1470 in Oxborough, Norfolk, England. He died 1493 in Oxborough, Norfolk, England. John married Elizabeth CLERE on 1491 in Oxborough, Norfolk, England.
