3 CONT
3 CONT Joan of England (July 5, 1321–September 7, 1362), known as Joan of the Tower was the first wife and Queen consort of David II of Scotland. She was born at the Tower of London and was the youngest daughter of Edward II of England a
3 CONC nd Isabella of France.
3 CONT
3 CONT
3 CONT Read more about Joan of England in her profile.
