2 CONT *  2.[S2] Peter W. Hammond, editor, The Complete Peerage or a History of the House of Lords and All its Members From the Earliest Times, Volume XIV: Addenda & Corrigenda (Stroud, Gloucestershire, U.K.: Sutton Publishing, 1998), pa
2 CONC ge 15. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage, Volume XIV.
2 CONT **'' Complete Peerage'', Vol. 1, p. 79 – “Muriel, 1st da. of William Keith, Marischal of Scotland, by Margaret, da. and h. of John Fraser of Zouche Fraser, s. and h. of Sir Alexander Fraser, High Chamberlain [S.].” – corrected by 
2 CONC ''Complete Peerage: Addenda and Corrigenda'', Vol. 14.
2 CONT *  3.[S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family, page 219, says she is son of John's father, Alexander, but Cockayne, vol I, page 79 also states this and vol XIV page 15 corrects this.
2 CONT
