2 CONT Stirnet Rzmisc01: Early Earls of Ross: The ScotsPeerage (Ross) makes no claims to this marriage and in Fife1 shows the wife of Edward Bruce as Isabel daughter of David of Strathbogie, Earl of Atholl.
