2 CONT
2 CONT (9) [http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000003828125787 '''Sir Andrew Moray.'''] He was mortally wounded at the battle of Stirling Bridge, 11th September 1297, fighting for Sir William Wallace.  He had a posthumous son: -
2 CONT
2 CONT (10)[http://www.geni.com/people/index/6000000003827394793  '''Sir Andrew Moray'''], died 1338, who was a strong supporter of King Robert Bruce. First Marriage -
2 CONT
2 CONT * 10 (a) '''Sir John''' (No. 11). 
2 CONT * 10 (b) '''Sir Thomas''' (No. 12). 
2 CONT
