1 NOTE He was appointed Regent of Scotland upon the death of Randolph, Earl of Moray, prior Regent of Scotland, by the Parliament at Perth on 2 Aug 1332. He immediately assumed command of the Scottish Army, which, through lack of militar
2 CONC y discipline, was defeated by an inferior force under Edward Baliol, on the 12th of the same month. The Earl died, trampled in the ensuing rout.
