1 NAME Elizabeth /Keith of Aboyne & Cluny/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Keith of Aboyne & Cluny
2 _MARNM Keith of Aboyne & Cluny
2 NICK Elizabeth (de Keith) Gordon Erskine Somerville
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1360
2 PLAC Aboyne
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 16 MAR 1438
2 PLAC Strathbogie, Aberdeenshire, , Scotland
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===ELIZABETH OF KEITH (aka ELIZABETH OF KETH)===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Lady of the Barony of Aboyne===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Keith is the daughter of Sir William Keith, Marshall of Scotland, and his wife Margaret Fraser. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/37 The Scots Peerage VI: 37-8]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LHDH-7CT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===First Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Keith married Sir Adam Gordon of Huntly. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/9 The Scots Peerage VIII: 9] [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/37 The Scots Peerage VI: 37-8
2 CONC ]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Second Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Keith married Sir Nicholas Erskine of Kinnoull. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/9 The Scots Peerage VIII: 9] Sir Nicholas died before December 1406. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeera
2 CONC gefoun06paul/page/37 The Scots Peerage VI: 37-8]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Third Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Keith, Lady of the Barony of Aboyne, married Thomas Somerville of Carnwath. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD52%2f402&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=carnwath&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=
2 CONC &dt=1500&di=n National Records of Scotland, Lord Forbes, reference GD52/402] [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/9 The Scots Peerage VIII: 9] They were married under a dispensation dated 2 November 1411 [h
2 CONC ttps://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/37 The Scots Peerage VI: 37-8] and she is noticed as his wife on 20 October 1431. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD52%2f402&st=1
2 CONC &tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=carnwath&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1500&di=n NRS: GD52/402]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children of the Third Marriage===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''It cannot be regarded as certain but it is possible that she may be the mother of some of the children of  Thomas, Lord Somerville. Stirnet suggests that she may be the mother of the following: [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/da
2 CONC ta/british/ss4as/somerville01.php Stirnet: Somerville 01]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT # 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''20 October 1431: Precept of sasine by Elizabeth of Keth [Keith], lady of the barony of Obyne [Aboyne] and Thomas Somyrweile [Somerville] of Karnwyth [Carnwath], her spouse, to Sir Alexander of Forbes, of their lands of Ballindu
2 CONC rny [Blairindinny], half of the town of Balhangy [Belhangie] with half of the mill thereof, and half of the town of Torquhonneqhy [Torquhonochy] with the forest of Fothirbrys [Fodderbirse] in the lordship of Fothirbrys in their ba
2 CONC rony of Obyne [Aboyne] following on an undated charter. [2 tags; no seal]. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD52%2f402&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=carnwath&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1500&di=n 
2 CONC National Records of Scotland, Lord Forbes, reference GD52/402]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun06paul/page/37 The Scots Peerage VI: 37-8]
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun08pauluoft/page/9 The Scots Peerage VIII: 9]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/ss4as/somerville01.php Stirnet: Somerville 01]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Elizabeth Keith===
2 CONT * Birth: about 1360 - of Aboyne, Aberdeenshire, Scotland 
2 CONT * Parents: William Keith, Margaret Fraser
2 CONT * Married: Adam Gordon, Nicholas Erskine, Thomas Somerville
2 CONT * Death: about 1436
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Keith married, firstly, Sir Adam Gordon of that Ilk, son of John Gordon and Elizabeth (?).1 She married, secondly, Sir Nicholas Erskine of Kinnoull.1 She married, thirdly, Thomas Somerville of Carnwath.1 She died circa 1
2 CONC 437.1 She was the daughter of Sir William Keith and Margaret Fraser.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Keith and Sir Adam Gordon of that Ilk
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Elizabeth Gordon+1 d. 16 Mar 1438/39
2 CONT #     John Gordon3 d. 1407
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT She succeeded her mother in some of her large estates, including Aboyne and Cluny.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
