2 CONC s Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT #     [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2195.
2 CONT #     [S37] Charles Mosley, Burke's Peerage and Baronetage, 107th edition, volume 2, page 2011.
