1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===MALCOLM CALQUHOUN OF LUSS younger===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Malcolm Colquhoun of Luss, younger, was the heir-apparent of his father, Sir John Colquhoun of Luss. His mother is Jean Erskine. He is noticed in a charter dated 13 November 1433 but he died before 1439, during his father's lif
2 CONC etime, leaving a son named John who would eventually succeed his grandfather. The name of Malcolm's wife is not known. [https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/32/mode/1up/search/+erskine The Chiefs of Calquhoun and
2 CONC  their Country, I: p. 32]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhou01fras#page/n6/mode/1up The Chiefs of Colquhoun and their Country (Edinburgh, 1869), I: 416 pp.]'''
2 CONT # '''[https://archive.org/stream/chiefsofcolquhv200fras#page/n4/mode/1up The Chiefs of Colquhoun and their Country (Edinburgh, 1869),I:, 442 pp.]'''
