2 CONT ===comments===
2 CONT
2 CONT from http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=john_d_newport&id=I33641
2 CONT
2 CONT [Jim Weber.ged]
2 CONT
2 CONT Isobel is indicated by Burke's Peerage in the Lovat line as being daughter of John Wemyss and Isabel Erskine. But within the Wemyss line, John & Isabel's daughter Isabel married Hugh Fraser 6th Lord of Lovat, who also married an I
2 CONC sabel Weymyss according to the Lovat line. I follow the Wemyss line as to John & Isabel's daughter, but leave Hugh's wife as Isobel daughter of John Wemyss. The John Wemyss who married Isabel Erskine was 2 generations later than t
2 CONC his Isabel's father.
