2 CONT http://www.archive.org/stream/heraldryofmurray00john#page/18/mode/2up Page 18 No. 94b and Page 33 No. 130
2 CONT
2 CONT (94) William Murray of Tullibardine, died about 1460. He married Margaret Gray, probably daughter of Andrew, Lord Gray, and had:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 94(a) William (No. 95 below).
2 CONT * 94(b) '''Andrew, ancestor of Lord Stormont''' (No. 130 below).
2 CONT * ARMS on Seal. A chevron between three stars (Macdonald's Seals).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(130) Andrew Murray''' second son of William Murray (No. 94). Married Margaret, daughter and heiress of James Barclay of Balvaird, who brought him also the estates of Arngosk and Kippo. They had two sons : 
2 CONT
2 CONT * (a) David (No. 131).  
2 CONT * (b) James Murray of Conland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arms of Barclay of Kippo in Sir David Lindsay's MS., ISA 2 - Azure, a chevron between three crosses patty argent. [Plate IV., fig. 2.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *The house of Moncrieff. by Seton, George, 1822-1908; Moncrieff, Alexander, Sir, 1829-1906.  Published 1890 [https://archive.org/stream/houseofmoncrieff00seto#page/30/mode/2up Page 30-31]   Sir William Moncrieff (died about 1575) 
2 CONC married Margaret, daughter of Murray of Balvaird.
