1 NOTE {geni:about_me} SOURCE: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=john_d_newport&id=I39533 (UNKNOWN IF THIS IS ACCURATE OR THE SAME PERSON) "Ancestry of John D Newport Updated: 2015-04-28 23:33:14 UTC (Tue)    Cont
2 CONC act: John Newport    If you see an error, please let me know, I find them all the time. I am learning but I have a long way to go. I am approaching this like a jigsaw puzzle so I commonly try to fit things together without solid i
2 CONC nformation. Only later, seeing the big picture, deciding if it is correct. ID: I39533  •Name: John Lundie 1  •Sex: M  •Birth: only a few stones left ABT 1390 in Lundie Castle, Lundie, Angus, Scotland 2  •Occupation: Sir 3  •Death:
2 CONC  only a few stones left 1427 in Lundie Castle, Lundie, Angus, Scotland 2  •Name: John Lundin Sir 3  •Birth: ABT 1390 in Lundin, Fife, Scotland 3  •Name: John Lundin of that Ilk 4  •Birth: ABT 1410 in Lundie, Dundee, Angus, Scotlan
2 CONC d 1  •Note:  [Richard Hodgson]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Lundy of that ilk, succeeded his father, William de Lundy [not clear that it is the one shown as his father here], by 1411. It is believed that he was married to Isobel Wemyss, relict of Sir Walter Ramsey of Pitcruvie.
2 CONT -
2 CONT In 1496 Janet daughter and heiress of Walter Ramsey of Pitcruvie, spouse to David Lindsay 2nd Lord Lindsay of the Byres granted a charter to Thomas Fergusson chaplain of the parish of Largo and his successors of an annual rent of 
2 CONC 5 merks of the lands of Scheithum and others for masses for the souls of Sir John Ramsey of Petcruvie, her grandfather, Walter Ramsey of Petcruvie, her father, Lady Elizabeth Wemyss, her mother, John Lundy of that ilk, Andrew Lund
2 CONC y of Pitlochy, her brothers, Sir John Lundy, now of that ilk, and Robert Lundy of Balgony. [The most ancient Family of Lundin or Lundie of that ilk. A History, Compiled By Dr. Robert Lundie Smith. PhD., robert.smith@chemphys.lu.se
2 CONC , First Edition - August 2003 ]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: William de Lundie Sir b: ABT 1360 in Lundin, Fife, Scotland  Mother: Helen Carnegie b: ABT 1365
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Elizabeth Wemyss b: ABT 1402 in Wemyss Hall, Cupar, Fife, Scotland•Married: 2nd husband Children1.Has Children John Lundie Sir b: 1433 in Lundin, Fife, Scotland 2.Has No Children Andrew Lundie of Pitlochy b: ABT 1450 in
2 CONC  Lundin, Fife, Scotland 3.Has No Children Margaret Lundin b: ABT 1455 in Lundin, Fife, Scotland
2 CONT
