2 CONT s/o Robert Colville of Hiltoun & Margaret Arnot
2 CONT x Alison Bruce
2 CONT *James - who succeeded
2 CONT *Alison
2 CONT xx 21 May 1536 Margaret Forrester, sister of David Forrester of Garden, who survived him, d< 16 May 1562. 
