2 CONT Walter Stewart, 3rd High Steward of Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From thePeerage.com:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Walter Stewart, Feudal Baron of Morphie was born illegitimately, although he would be legitimate if truly a son of Janet Erskine before 1425. He was the son of Sir Walter Stewart and Janet Erskine. He died before 1488.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Walter Stewart, Feudal Baron of Morphie gained the title of Feudal Baron of Morphie. On 17 April 1479 he was legitimised.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Walter Stewart, Feudal Baron of Morphie and Elizabeth Arnot
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Alexander Stewart+ d. 1489
2 CONT
