1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == II. ANDREW CUNNINGHAME OF DRUMQUHASSILL ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Andrew Cunninghame of Drumquhassill, here treated, is the great-grandfather of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Cunninghame-of-Drumquhassill/6000000062569583953. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.a
2 CONC spx?reference=GD86%2f204&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=drumquhassill&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1500&dt=1600&di=n NRS: GD86/204]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Andrew Cunninghame of Drumquhassill, here treated, may have died before 26 February 1516, when his son Alexander is identified as: "Alexander Conyghame, son and heir of Andrew Conyghame Drumquhassill." [https://archive.org/deta
2 CONC ils/scottishrecordso29scotuoft/page/26 Protocol Book of Gavin Ros: 158]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Andrew Cunninghame of Drumquhassill, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Stewart/6000000062570666270?through=6000000062570545306. '''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # ''' https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Cunninghame-of-Drumquhassill/6000000062570253946 '''
2 CONT # ''' https://www.geni.com/people/Walter-Cunninghame/6000000220906973824?through=6000000062570545306 '''
