2 CONT
2 CONT **1.	Robert Cunningham, 2nd Earl of Glencairn (d by 1492)
2 CONT *** A.	Cuthbert Cunningham, 3rd Earl of Glencairn (d 1540-1) 	m. (mcrt 24.06.1492) Marjory (or Mary or Marion) Douglas (a 1511, dau of Archibald Douglas, 5th Earl of Angus)
2 CONT ** 2.	William Cuninghame, 1st of Craigends (a 1479)	-- 	m. Elizabeth Stewart (dau of Sir Walter Stewart of Arthurlie)	--
2 CONT ** 3.	Alexander Cunyngham (a 1483)
2 CONT ** 4.	Edward Cuninghame (a 1483) ## see here ##
2 CONT ** 5.	Isabella Cunyngham 	m. Walter Buchanan of Easter Catter, 1st of Spittal
