1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Leslie divorced Margaret Crichton on December 27, 1520 and married Ann Somerville on January 30, 1530. Although some records show one of them as being their mother, the timeline does not add up. Records show
2 CONC  Elizabeth Gray as being 70 years old at the time of Helen's death, so she most likely is also not Helen's mother especially considering she had a son born in 1591. The timeline also doesn't fit George's ex-partners. It seems Hele
2 CONC n Leslie's mother is unknown.
