1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://histfam.familysearch.org/getperson.php?personID=I6997&tree=Nixon '''Margaret Crichton....''']
2 CONT * [http://thepeerage.com/p10960.htm#i109595 '''The Peerage....''']
2 CONT * Margaret Crichton was born illegitimately before 1507.  
2 CONT * She was the daughter of William Crichton, 3rd Lord Crichton and Margaret Stewart.  
2 CONT * She married, 
2 CONT # firstly, William Todrik before 1507.  
2 CONT # secondly, George Halkerstoun before 1513. 
2 CONT # thirdly, George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes, son of William Leslie, 3rd Earl of Rothes and Margaret Balfour, circa 1517.3 She and George Leslie, 4th Earl of Rothes were divorced on 27 December 1520. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * She died before 1546
2 CONT
2 CONT * From before 1507, her married name became Todrik.2 From before 1513, her married name became Halkerstoun.2 From circa 1517, her married name became Leslie. '''Children''' of '''Margaret Crichton''' & '''George Leslie, 4th Earl o
2 CONC f Rothes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT # Helen Leslie, d. 28 Oct 1594
2 CONT # Lady Agnes Leslie
2 CONT # Norman Leslie, Master of Rothes, d. 1554
2 CONT # Lady Margaret Leslie
