2 CONT “THE FAMILY OF LESLIE OF GLASSLOUGH
2 CONT
2 CONT “The family of Leslie of Glasslough, in Ireland, is descended from the Wardis branch of the family of Leslie, Barons of Balquhain.
2 CONT
2 CONT “George Leslie, second son of William Leslie, fourth Baron of Wardis, by his wife, Janet Innes, married, in 1570, Marjory, daughter of John Leslie of Kincraigie, in the parish of Tarland, and had issue–
2 CONT
2 CONT “   I. John Leslie, founder of the family of Leslie of Glasslough. “   II. George. “   III. Henry, who married, and had a son, the Right Rev. John Leslie, D.D., Bishop of Bromore, who tanslated to the See of Clogher in 1671, and h
2 CONC ad a daughter, Jane, married to the Rev. Charles Leslie. “   IV. Janet, married to Alexander Leslie."
