1 CONT Interred: Scone Abbey, Perthshire
1 CONT Notes:
1 CONT Was in command of the second division of the Scotch Army at Halidon Hill, and was one of the few who escaped the carnage of that disastrous day. See Europäisch Stammtafeln Band II tafel 69. There is some confusion over which daugh
1 CONC ter is which and who are their mothers which still needs some clarification.
1 CONT
