0 @N6000000002329575622@ NOTE Originally born John Stewart, King Robert III of Scotland, changed his name to Robert when he ascended the throne. He was named Earl of Carrick 22Jun1368. Although he reigned as King of Scotland from 1390-1406, history and folklor
1 CONC e tell us that 
