0 @N6000000001783571700@ NOTE Basic Life Information
1 CONT
1 CONT Lady Mary Stewart was the daughter of Robert III Stewart, King of Scotland and Annabel Drummond.  Lady Mary Stewart gained the title of Princess Mary of Scotland.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriages and Children
1 CONT
1 CONT She married by contract, firstly, George Douglas, 1st Earl of Angus, son of William Douglas, 1st Earl of Douglas and Margaret Stewart, Countess of Angus, on 24 May 1397. As a result of her marriage, Lady Mary Stewart was styled as
1 CONC  Countess of Angus after 24 May 1397. From after 24 May 1397, her married name became Douglas.  They had two children:
1 CONT Lady Elizabeth Douglas
1 CONT William Douglas, 2nd Earl of Angus b. c 1398, d. Oct 1437
1 CONT
1 CONT She married, secondly, Sir James Kennedy of Dunure, younger, son of Sir Gilbert Kennedy of Dunure, circa 1404. From circa 1404, her married name became Kennedy.
1 CONT They had the following children:
1 CONT Sir John Kennedy d. a 1434
1 CONT Mary Kennedy
1 CONT Gilbert Kennedy of Dunure, 1st Lord Kennedy b. c 1406, d. a 6 Mar 1478/79
1 CONT James Kennedy b. 1405/6, d. Jul 1465
1 CONT
1 CONT She and Sir William Cunningham were engaged in July 1409
1 CONT
1 CONT She married, thirdly, Sir William Graham on 13 November 1413. From 13 November 1413, her married name became Graham.
1 CONT
1 CONT She married, fourthly, Sir William Edmondstone of Culloden in 1425. From 1425, her married name became Edmonstone.  They had one child:
1 CONT Robert Graham
1 CONT
1 CONT Death
1 CONT
1 CONT She died circa 1458. She was buried at Strathbane Church, Scotland
1 CONT
1 CONT <http://thepeerage.com/p10533.htm#i105322>
0 @N6000000004270567679@ NOTE http://www.landersgen.com/landers/62/8174.htm
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary Stewart
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Born: Abt 1380, Dunfermline, Fife, Scotland 631
1 CONT     * Marriage (1): Earl George Douglas, Duke of Angus on 24 Mar 1397 631,766,816
1 CONT     * Marriage (2): Sir James Kennedy, Earl of Dunure in 1405
1 CONT     * Marriage (3): Sir William Cunningham in Jul 1409 766
1 CONT     * Marriage (4): William Graham, Lord of Kincardine on 13 Nov 1413 766
1 CONT     * Marriage (5): William Edmonstone, of Duntreath in 1425 766
1 CONT     * Died: 1458, Scotland, England about age 78 631,766
1 CONT     * Buried: Strathblane Church, Stirling, Scotland
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary married Earl George Douglas, Duke of Angus, son of William Douglas and Margaret Stewart, on 24 Mar 1397 631,766.,816 (Earl George Douglas, Duke of Angus was born about 1376 in Mar, Aberdeenshire, Scotland 631 and died in 1402
1 CONC  in Battle of Hameldon Hill, Lancashire, England 631.)
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary next married Sir James Kennedy, Earl of Dunure, son of Sir Gilbert Kennedy and Agnes Maxwell, in 1405. (Sir James Kennedy, Earl of Dunure died on 8 Nov 1408 766.)
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary next married Sir William Cunningham in Jul 1409.766
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary next married William Graham, Lord of Kincardine on 13 Nov 1413.766
1 CONT
1 CONT Mary next married William Edmonstone, of Duntreath in 1425.766 
0 @N6000000002187794458@ NOTE Lady Mary Stewart1,2 (F)
