1 CONT
1 CONT 'Bruce2'
1 CONT http://www.stirnet.com/HTML/genie/british/bb4fz/bruce2.htm
1 CONT Families covered: Bruce of Airth, Bruce of Clackmannan, Bruce ofEarlshall, Bruce of Green,
1 CONT  Bruce of Kennet, Bruce of Stenhouse, Bruce of Wester Kennet
1 CONT
1 CONT Main sources:
1 CONT (1) Bruces of Clackmannan - TSP (Elgin & Ailesbury).
1 CONT (2) Bruces of Wester Kennet - TSP (Balfour of Burleigh).
1 CONT (3) Bruces of Airth and Stenhouse - BP1934 (Bruce of Stenhouse).
1 CONT (4) Bruces of Earlshall
1 CONT (a) "Fife: Pictorial and Historical", 'Its People, Burghs, Castles, andMansions', by A.H. Millar. Printed and published in 2 volumes in 1895 byA. Westwood & Son, Cupar.
1 CONT (b) "The Bruces of Airth and their Cadets" by Major William BruceArmstrong, printed for private circulation in Edinburgh, 1892.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT For the sources of information, see in this file under "INFORMATION,Sources of" and also "INFORMATION, General Clan Genealogical".
