1 CONT David Lindsay, 3rd Earl of Crawford was the son of Alexander Lindsay, 2nd Earl of Crawford <p10812.htm> and Marjorie Dunbar <p10812.htm>. He was born before 1410. He married Marjory Ogilvy, daughter of Sir Walter Ogilvy of Auchter
1 CONC house <p291.htm> and Isabel Ramsay <p291.htm>.2 He died between 17 January 1445 and 1446.  He gained the title of 3rd Earl of Crawford.1
1 CONT Children of David Lindsay, 3rd Earl of Crawford and Marjory Ogilvy:
1 CONT Alexander Lindsay, 4th Earl of Crawford <p481.htm>+ b. b 1424, d. a Sep 1453 Janet Lindsay <p10951.htm> b. b 1425, d. fr 1483 - 1484 Walter Lindsay, Lord of Beaufort and Edzell <p2040.htm>+ b. b 1445, d. 1476 William Lindsay <p205
1 CONC 5.htm> b. b 1445 Sir John Lindsay <p2055.htm> b. b 1445 James Lindsay <p2055.htm> b. b 1445
1 CONT Citations
