1 CONC ensation 11 July 1339), Maurice(MORAY), EARL OF STRATHEARN [SCT] (so created 1344), who was killed atNeville's Cross, 17 October 1346. She married, 4thly, as his 2nd wife(post nuptial dispensation 9 November 1347), William (SUTHER
1 CONC LAND), 5thEARL OF SUTHERLAND [SCT], who died about 1370. She was living, 20March 1366/7, but the date of her death is not known.  [CompletePeerage XII/1:385, (transcribed by Dave Utzinger)]
