1 CONC  various grants of lands in theEarldom of Mar united into the Barony of Innernochty, and receivedalso Kildrummy and was constable of its castle. He was created a Lordof Parliament at the christening of Prince Arthur 1509, and in 1
1 CONC 513had Kildrummy regranted to himself and his wife and united withInnernochty into the Lordship of Elphinstone. He was k at Flodden 9Sep 1513 leaving (with his widow, who m 1515 as his 3rd wife JohnForbes, 6th Lord Forbes and d 15
1 CONC 18) issue:
1 CONT ..A1 Alexander, his heir
1 CONT ..a1. Isabel Elphinstone m 1st David Lindsay of Dunrod and m 2ndRobert Maxwell of Calderwood
1 CONT ..a2. Eupheme Elphinstone m John Bruce of Cultmalindie
1 CONT ..a3. Elizabeth m Sir David Somerville of Plain
