0 @N6000000002187896766@ NOTE Alan, Earl of Menteith
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Alan, Earl of Menteith (d. c. 1310) was, as his title suggests, Earl of Menteith.
1 CONT
1 CONT He succeeded his father and was succeeded by his brother.
1 CONT
1 CONT He supported King Robert I of Scotland (Bruce) in his initial attempt to seize power. He was captured at the Battle of Methven and died in an English dungeon.
