0 @N6000000003043224883@ NOTE James, the elder son, second Lord Forbes, was knighted by King James the Third. This nobleman built the strong castle of Druminner, in the parish of Forbes (now united to that of Tullynessle), the ancient seat of the Lords Forbes.
