0 @N6000000002187794380@ NOTE James Douglas, 1st Earl of Morton
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT James Douglas, 1st Earl of Morton (d. 1493) was created Earl of Morton in 1458. He was a descendant of Agnes Dunbar, 4th Countess of Moray (known as "Black Agnes of Dunbar"). He married Princess Joan Stewart (1429 - c. 1488), daug
1 CONC hter of James I, King of Scots. His wife was buried in Dalkeith Church, Dalkeith. They were the parents of four children; Janet, Elizabeth, James and John Douglas, 2nd Earl of Morton.
1 CONT
