1 CONT George Gordon, 2nd Earl of Huntly was the son of Alexander Gordon, 1st Earl of Huntly and Elizabeth Crichton.
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriages and Children
1 CONT
1 CONT He married, firstly, Elizabeth Dunbar, daughter of James Dunbar, 4th Earl of Moray, on 20 May 1445. He and Elizabeth Dunbar were divorced after 1446.
1 CONT
1 CONT He married, secondly, Annabella Stewart, daughter of James I Stewart, King of Scotland and Lady Joan Beaufort, before 10 March 1459/60.1 He and Annabella Stewart were divorced on 24 July 1471 on the grounds of consanguinity.1 Chil
1 CONC dren of George Gordon, 2nd Earl of Huntly and Annabella Stewart were:
1 CONT
1 CONT Lady Margaret Gordon
1 CONT Hon. Adam Gordon, Lord of Aboyne+ d. bt 17 Mar 1537 - 1538
1 CONT Alexander Gordon, 3rd Earl of Huntly+ d. bt 21 Jan 1523 - 1524
1 CONT Lady Janet Gordon d. b Feb 1558/593
1 CONT Lady Elizabeth Gordon
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Lady Elizabeth Hay, daughter of Sir William Hay, 1st Earl of Erroll and Lady Beatrix Douglas, on 12 May 1476.
1 CONT
1 CONT Death
1 CONT
1 CONT He died on 8 June 1501 at Stirling, Stirlingshire, Scotland.
1 CONT
