0 @N6000000002187896527@ NOTE Sir Morice Moray, 1st Earl of Strathearn1  (M)
1 CONT b. before 1323, d. 17 October 1346, #109190
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=27 Oct 2005
1 CONT
1 CONT      Sir Morice Moray, 1st Earl of Strathearn was born before 1323. He was the son of Sir John Moray.2 He married Joan Menteith, daughter of Sir John Menteith, after 11 July 1339, by dispensation.1 He died on 17 October 1346 in Ne
1 CONC ville's Cross, killed in action.1
1 CONT      Sir Morice Moray, 1st Earl of Strathearn was also known as Thomas Moray.3 He gained the title of 1st Earl of Strathearn in 1343/44.1 He fought in the Battle of Neville's Cross on 17 October 1346.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Sir Morice Moray, 1st Earl of Strathearn and Joan Menteith
1 CONT     Joan Moray+ b. bt 1339 - 1354, d. bt Jan 1403 - Aug 14094
1 CONT
