1 CONC tinct or Dormant, new ed., 13 volumes in 14 (1910-1959; reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, U.K.: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000), volume I, page 310. Hereinafter cited as The Complete Peerage.
1 CONT    2. [S6] Cokayne, and others, The Complete Peerage, volume XII/1, page 387.
