1 CONT
1 CONT      Joan Moray was born between 1339 and 1354. She was the daughter of Sir Morice Moray, 1st Earl of Strathearn and Joan Menteith.1,2 She married, firstly, Sir Thomas Moray, Lord of Bothwell, son of Sir Andrew Moray and Lady Chri
1 CONC stina Bruce, before 1361.1 She married, secondly, Archibald Douglas, 3rd Earl of Douglas, son of James Douglas, after 23 July 1362.3 She died between January 1403 and August 1409.2
1 CONT       From after 23 July 1362, her married name became Douglas.
1 CONT
