1 CONT Sir Robert de Brus, Lord of Annandale was the son of Robert de Brewes, Lord of Annandale and Lady Isabella of Huntingdon. He was born in 1210.1 He married, firstly, Isabella de Clare, daughter of Gilbert de Clare, 4th Earl of Glou
1 CONC cester and Lady Isabella Marshal <p10125.htm>, on 12 May 1240. He married, secondly, Christina de Ireby <p10776.htm>, daughter of Sir William de Ireby <p10776.htm>.2 He died on 31 March 1295.  He gained the title of Lord of Annand
1 CONC ale.1
1 CONT Child of Sir Robert de Brus, Lord of Annandale and Christina de Ireby <p10776.htm>:
