1 CONC Countess of Carrick <p10248.htm>, circa 1308.2 He married, secondly, Margaret Graham <p10809.htm>, daughter of Sir David Graham <p468.htm>, before 29 November 1329.3 He married, thirdly, Jean Stewart <p10793.htm>, daughter of Walt
1 CONC er Stewart, 6th High Steward of Scotland <p10210.htm> and Alice Erskine <p10792.htm>.4 He died on 19 July 1333.  He was also known as Hugh Leslie. He gained the title of 4th Earl of Ross.1
