1 CONT grandmother, Elizabeth, dau of Sir William Keith, Marischal of Scotland, with his grandfather, Sir Adam Gordon, and that it was really his grandmother, the said Elizabeth, who (through her mother, Margaret, dau of Sir John Fraser)
1 CONC  brought the
1 CONT territory of Aboyne and other lands in Aberdeen to the family".
